ark on a journey to dissect the underlying factors propelling these tokens towards a projected surge of tenfold in value over the next six months. From Cardano's groundbreaking blockchain technology to Retik Finance's innovative DeFi solutions and Dogecoin's unorthodox yet undeniably resilient community-driven ethos, we delve deep into the unique attributes and compelling narratives that set these projects apart.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): The Powerhouse of Proof-of-Stake\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) stands as a beacon of innovation within the realm of blockchain technology, revered for its unparalleled proof-of-stake framework that champions scalability, security, and energy efficiency. Departing from the energy-intensive proof-of-work models, Cardano's pioneering Ouroboros consensus mechanism not only minimizes environmental impact but also fortifies the integrity of transactions. The evolutionary trajectory of Cardano, delineated by the Byron, Shelley, Alonzo, Mary, and Basho epochs, signifies a journey marked by relentless advancement. The successful integration of smart contract capabilities through the Alonzo hard fork in September 2021 heralded a new era of possibilities, fostering the creation of a diverse ecosystem of decentralized applications (dApps) on the Cardano network. As the community eagerly anticipates the forthcoming Basho epoch, slated to address scaling challenges, Cardano's trajectory toward mainstream adoption appears increasingly inevitable. Bolstered by a robust foundation, dynamic development initiatives, and an engaged community, Cardano emerges as a frontrunner poised for exponential growth. Analysts speculate that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  may surge to $5 by the close of 2024, a remarkable ascent indicative of its burgeoning prominence within the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  landscape.\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance (RETIK): A Token Surged To Yield 10x Gain Over the Next 6 Months\par \par \uc2 Embarking on a journey to redefine the financial landscape, Retik Finance (RETIK) emerges as a pioneering force, dedicated to bridging the chasm between traditional fiat currencies and the dynamic world of cryptocurrency. At its core, Retik Finance (RETIK) champions the establishment of an open-source, decentralized payment network, fostering a seamless environment for users to transact effortlessly across fiat and crypto domains. A testament to its innovative approach, Retik Finance's presale campaign exceeded expectations, rallying an astonishing 400% more than its initial target. This resounding success underscores the fervent community backing and palpable enthusiasm surrounding the project's transformative potential. Central to this ecosystem is the RETIK token, a linchpin asset that fuels the network's operations and facilitates transactions within the platform.\par \par \uc2 Empowering User Experience with Cutting-Edge Features\par \par \uc2 Retik Finance (RETIK) introduces a suite of groundbreaking features designed to elevate user experience and redefine financial accessibility. Notably, the launch of Retik DeFi Crypto Cards stands as a watershed moment, enabling users to seamlessly utilize their crypto holdings at millions of global merchants, effectively blurring the lines between digital assets and traditional finance. Complementing this innovation is Retik's decentralized payment network, engineered to deliver secure, swift, and cost-effective global payment solutions, bolstered by a steadfast commitment to scalability and user security.\par \par \uc2 Projecting Growth and Potential\par \par \uc2 With a total token supply of 1 billion and an initial listing price of $0.15, Retik Finance (RETIK) presents itself as a compelling investment opportunity with significant room for growth. Industry experts foresee a meteoric rise, projecting RETIK to soar to $1.50 by the culmination of 2024, signalling an extraordinary 10x increase in value. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook reflects the confidence in Retik Finance's disruptive vision and unwavering dedication to reshaping the future of finance.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE): The Meme Coin With Staying Power\par \par \uc2 DogeCoin (DOGE) frequently discredited as a purely meme-inspired form of cryptocurrency, has defied prognostications, ensuring its standing in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. Underlying its amusing exterior is a sturdy foundation bolstered by an unflinching community and prominent endorsements, notably from individuals such as \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 . This unique combination of levity and sincerity has contributed to its enduring popularity. From a technological standpoint, DOGE utilizes a proof-of-work consensus mechanism similar to Bitcoin, yet distinguishes itself with expeditious block times and a larger token allocation, guaranteeing swift transactions and encompassing accessibility. The potential for a tenfold increase in the ensuing six months is buttressed by several critical factors: relentless development efforts centered on reducing transaction fees and augmenting scalability, increasing mainstream acceptance by merchants, and the influential presence of a fervent Dogecoin community on social media platforms such as \uc2 Twitter\uc2  and Reddit. Despite its current valuation hovering around $0.10 as of March 27, 2024, industry analysts anticipate a potential ascent to $1 by the year's conclusion, reflecting a notable tenfold increase driven by sustained development and adoption momentum.\par \par \uc2 Final Thoughts\par \par \uc2 In the world of cryptocurrencies, where \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is common, three contenders stand out for their growth potential: Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Retik Finance (RETIK), and Dogecoin (DOGE). While each of them has its unique features, Retik Finance is particularly innovative as it brings together traditional finance and the crypto landscape. Its revolutionary features, such as Retik DeFi Crypto Cards and a decentralized payment network, aim to redefine how people access finance. Retik Finance was initially listed for $0.15, and it is expected to surge to $1.50 by 2024, which would represent a tenfold increase in value.\par \par \uc2 Visit the links below for more information about Retik Finance (RETIK):\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Whitepaper: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://retik.com/retik-whitepaper.pdf}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.twitter.com/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.twitter.com/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.t.me/retikfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.t.me/retikfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240412ek4b00012\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,606 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market briefly sold-off after today's inflation report, but signs of a recovery have emerged.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to hover around the $69,000 mark, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. Some analysts expect the upcoming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  to act as a major trigger, but new research by crypto analytics firm CryptoQuant said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-price-demand-diminished-whale-demand-key-driver-cryptoquant"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the halving effect}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Chas been diminishing, as the new issuance of Bitcoin gets smaller relative to the amount of Bitcoin selling from long-term holders.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another negative voice in the near term is that of BitMEX co-founder \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2 , who believes there will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-crypto-firesale-arthur-hayes-heatwave"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extreme weakness in risky assets until May 1}}}\uc2 . However, Hayes is positive for the medium term as he expects the Bitcoin halving to push prices higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/c389c914-5a30-43da-94ff-57790b0621ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 If one rides the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the subsequent rally could cheer the investors in the long term. \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  analysts said in a research report shared with Cointelegraph that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-150k-btc-top-10-days-before-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could soar 160% post halving}}}\uc2  to reach between $150,000 and $169,000 in the next 14 months.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin bulls assert their supremacy and push the price higher, or will the bears make a comeback? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the symmetrical triangle on April 8, but the bears yanked the price back into the triangle on April 9. This shows that the bears are trying to trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/375e4df7-0f44-4e0d-86c7-50d3c1f3321e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the buyers is that they are trying to buy the dip to the 20-day exponential moving average ($68,497). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair will make another attempt to rise above the $73,777 overhead resistance. If that happens, the pair could rally to $80,000 and then to $84,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will sense an opportunity and pull the pair down to the uptrend line. A break and close below the triangle will suggest the start of a corrective phase toward $60,000 and eventually to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the overhead resistance of $3,679 on April 9, indicating that the bears are not willing to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/7511539f-abd8-41b3-a53d-72fa21717247.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to stall the decline at the 20-day EMA ($3,479). If the price turns up from the moving averages, the bulls will have another go at the $3,679 level. If this resistance gets taken out, the ETH/USDT pair may rally to the overhead resistance of $4,100.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action between $3,056 and $3,679 may extend for a few more days. The trend will favor the bears on a break below $3,056.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the downtrend line on April 8, but the bulls did not allow the price to sink back below the 20-day EMA ($574). This shows buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/ad692e2a-8411-4d73-9828-62a25bb3909a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers maintain the price above the triangle, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $692 and thereafter attempt a rally to the pattern target of $795.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the downtrend line and sink the price to the uptrend line. A break below this support will signal the start of a correction toward $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($178), signaling that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/09d59f59-31ae-486c-84c6-2083d551daa0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the SOL/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA ($159), but the bulls are likely to vigorously protect the level. If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $162 and $205 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair will complete a double-top pattern. The pair could collapse to the next strong support at $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to extend XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery above the moving averages on April 9, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/d9a60498-0244-4d4d-b5a7-aabdb2e76f89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. That could keep the XRP/USDT pair range-bound between $0.56 and $0.69 over the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The advantage will tilt in favor of the buyers if the price rises above $0.69. That could clear the path for a possible rally to the formidable level of $0.74. On the downside, a drop below $0.56 could sink the pair to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally met with heavy selling pressure from the bears near $0.21 on April 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/72b0479a-5688-4fe6-8cd2-4cdf08fa15ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.19) on April 10, suggesting demand at lower levels. Buyers will make another attempt to drive the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.21. If they manage to do that, the pair may climb to $0.23. A break and close above this level will signal the resumption of the uptrend toward $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upward move, they will have to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then descend to the 50-day SMA ($0.16).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading inside an ascending channel pattern for the past few days. The price picked up momentum after breaking above $5.69 on April 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/0ade4ce5-5e10-4bbb-9fd8-f03b4e0563fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to stall the up move at the resistance line. If the price turns down sharply from the current level, the TON/USDT pair could drop to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line. The bulls are expected to fiercely defend the support line because a break below it may start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will signal the start of a vertical rally. The pair may surge to $8.56 and then to $10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($0.61) on April 9, signaling that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/06892f02-8a6a-420a-aca2-41728170b4a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price dipped to the strong support at $0.57, an important level to watch out for in the near term. If the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may remain range-bound between $0.57 and $0.68 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below $0.57 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, which could start a downward move toward the critical support of $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the downtrend line on April 9, suggesting that the bears continue to sell on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/28d47c40-0079-42ce-b122-3b9342017c9c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair is stuck between the downtrend line and $42. If the bulls propel the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair could then attempt a rally to $60.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price continues lower and breaks below $42. That will indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair may plummet to $35, which is likely to act as a formidable support.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line, but the bears held their ground. However, a minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to dip below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/73fdd4db-3615-41ed-8c0c-bdc37584b285.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source:\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.000028) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between buyers and sellers. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. That could open the doors for a rise to $0.000033 and subsequently to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a drop below $0.000023 will signal that bears are trying to take charge. The SHIB/USDT pair may slump to $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvYjM0NGM5ZjctNWRlNS00Yjc2LTk5NGQtYTMxNTE3OGM4ZWI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240411ek4a0001x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/8: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,619 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders seized control of Bitcoin price, opening the door for altcoins and BTC to seek new all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  is less than 11 days away and Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is approaching the event with strength. This shows that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying on dips. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows digital investment products saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-investment-products-negative-outflows-4th-consecutive-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $646 million in inflows last week}}}\uc2 . That takes the year-to-date inflows to $13.8 billion, far higher than the $10.6 billion in 2021.\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics firm Santiment said in a X post that inflows into spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) are likely to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-trading-activity-robust-until-halving-santiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remain high until the Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2 . However, the firm added \u8220\'20\'1Cit will be interesting to see whether a drop-off in ETF volume and on-chain volume will occur directly afterward.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/09642c31-1420-452a-8d34-d2464d5b4e9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to determine how the markets will behave just after halving, but analysts remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the long term. \uc2 SkyBridge Capital\uc2  CEO \uc2 Anthony Scaramucci\uc2  said in an interview with CNBC that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-worth-half-value-gold-sky-bridge-ceo-anthony-scaramucci"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could soar to $170,000 during the cycle}}}\uc2 . Eventually, he expects Bitcoin to trade at \u8220\'20\'1Chalf the valuation of gold\u8221\'20\'1D but warns of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  en route.\par \par \uc2 What are the important resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index made an outside-day candlestick pattern on April 4 and an inside-day candlestick pattern on April 5, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/af74a6fb-43e1-404c-880e-e3946d9e06fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (5,184) has flattened out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the positive zone, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns lower and breaks below 5,146, it will signal the start of a corrective phase. The 50-day simple moving average (5,089) may try to arrest the decline, but it is likely to be broken.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues higher and breaks above the all-time high of 5,265, the index will resume its uptrend. The next stop is likely to be 5,450.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) turned down sharply from the 105 overhead resistance level on April 2, signaling that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/d73bee47-715a-43af-a6b1-0ca7f8b71ac0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they did not allow the index to slide below the moving averages. This suggests that lower levels are being purchased. Selling at higher levels and buying on dips signals a possible range-bound action in the near term. The index may swing between the 50-day SMA (104) and 105 for some time.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above 105 clears the path for a potential rally to 106 and then 107. On the contrary, a drop below the 50-day SMA could sink the index to 103 and subsequently to 102.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the symmetrical triangle pattern on April 8, indicating that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/b4c2c044-8526-4b7d-8506-ac2f147b697e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair is likely to retest the all-time high of $73,777. This level may act as a significant barrier, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend toward the pattern target of $84,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA ($68,335). If that happens, the pair may plunge to the 50-day SMA ($64,828).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $3,056 and $3,679 for several days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/07e38e6f-bd90-4530-9d68-e06297d82e16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair has reached the overhead resistance of $3,679, an important level to keep an eye on. If buyers overcome this obstacle, the pair could pick up momentum and rally to $4,093. The bears are expected to fiercely defend this level, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend toward $4,488.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from $3,679 and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/ef35cc40-f1ae-4fe2-a3fd-fd76dfd5bc68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($570) is moving up gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls are at a minor advantage. The BNB/USDT pair has reached the downtrend line of the triangle. If this resistance is overcome, the pair could retest the March 16 high at $645.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a few more days. The bears will be in a commanding position if the price plunges below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to sustain Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($181), indicating that the bears are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/ad080e30-bc40-476e-b8f4-b7a509009c76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $162. The bulls are expected to vigorously protect this level because failing to do that could open the gates for a fall to $126.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $162 and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the pair may extend its stay inside the $162 to $205 range for some more time. The next leg of the uptrend could begin on a break above $205.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to capitalize on XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fall below the uptrend line may have attracted buyers who pushed the price above the moving averages on April 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/461a7485-d3f6-4831-961b-ec0800e54a00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  just above the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. The XRP/USDT pair could swing between $0.56 and $0.69 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to kick the price above $0.69 to enhance the prospects of a rally to the formidable resistance at $0.74. Instead, if bears want to take charge, they will have to sink and sustain the price below $0.56. The pair may then plunge to $0.52 and subsequently to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) jumped back above the 20-day EMA ($0.18) on April 6 and continued the move higher to rise above $0.19 on April 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/85aed5d9-009e-479c-a50f-006ed78fba1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to maintain the momentum and push the price toward the overhead resistance at $0.23. A break and close above this level will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The DOGE/USDT pair will then attempt a rally to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price slips back below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. That will increase the likelihood of a drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.15).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above $0.57 in the past few days and pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.62) on April 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/1060636b-bed8-4e58-a626-58995d383fd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are in command. The sellers will try to sink the price below $0.57. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That could start a downward move toward the next major support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That will open the doors for a rise to $0.68. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to increase the possibility of a rally to $0.81.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) skyrocketed above the $5.50 to $5.69 overhead resistance zone on April 8, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/9b2a5a7f-c63f-4b3c-8a87-69166411192e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above $5.69, the TON/USDT pair could rally to the next target objective at $7.09. The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate that the bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to tug the price below $5.50 to trap the aggressive bulls. That could result in long liquidation, threatening the 20-day EMA ($4.97). If this level gives way, the pair may slump to $4.72 and then to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $4.22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvZTkyM2U1YjItMDZjOS00MWI5LWJmMTYtZmIwYzBjNzU3Y2YyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240408ek48000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
