\par\par \b \uc2 $RECQ Presale Advances Amid Investors\u8217\'20\'19 Excitement Buildup While Traders Eye Cardano And Bitcoin Cash\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 735 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 April 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rebel Satoshi\u8217\'20\'19s $RECQ Presale Enters Stage 1 After 85% Surge}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Continues To Trade in Red Despite Market Showing \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Signs}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Cash Surges To New Yearly Highs as it Approaches Halving}}}\par \par \uc2 \u9679\'25\'CF The presale of Rebel Satoshi\u8217\'20\'19s ($RBLZ) $RECQ token rises by 85% to enter intoStage 1.\u9679\'25\'CF Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is predicted by experts to drop below $0.60 in the coming months.\u9679\'25\'CF The Bitcoin Cash (BCH) token to rise above $700 and beyond as it approaches halving.\par \par \uc2 The presale of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://recq.rebelsatoshi.com/?utm_source=4374&utm_medium=News&utm_id=Fox"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rebel Satoshi}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s ($RBLZ) second token, $RECQ, has surged by 85% to enter Stage 1 due to immense demand. Meanwhile, traders are looking to make profits on the best altcoins like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Bitcoin Cash (BCH). Let\u8217\'20\'19s understand which among $RBLZ, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and BCH are the best cryptos to buy according to experts.\par \par \uc2 Rebel Satoshi\u8217\'20\'19s $RECQ Presale Enters Stage 1 After 85% Surge\par \par \uc2 The innovative and community-driven memecoin project Rebel Satoshi is built on the Ethereum network. Rebel Satoshi is inspired by Guy Fawkes and \uc2 Satoshi Nakamoto\uc2  and aims to bring a revolution in the market. Rebel Satoshi will lead its community to usher in true decentralization and take back control from the elites.\par \par \uc2 Rebel Satoshi is not just a memecoin but also has a vibrant ecosystem built around its dual token system of $RBLZ and the $RECQ tokens. Both the $RBLZ and $RECQ tokens adhere to the ERC-20 token standard and have total supplies of 250 million and 3 billion respectively. Rebel Satoshi raised over $2.5 million with the $RBLZ presale where it surged 150%. Rebel Satoshi then listed the $RBLZ token for trading on Uniswap and Coinstore on March 5.\par \par \uc2 Right now, Rebel Satoshi is conducting the presale of the $RECQ token. The $RECQ presale has entered Stage 1 at $0.0037 per token with a surge of 85% from the Early Bird Stage. The $RECQ token will surge by 170.27% to $0.0100 by the end of the presale. As a result, the $RECQ token has emerged as one of the best cryptos to buy right now.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rebelsatoshi.com/?utm_source=MCAP&utm_medium=Banner&utm_id=Bird"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano Continues To Trade in Red Despite Market Showing \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Signs\par \par \uc2 The Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token has been one of the major underperformers in recent months. Even as the market rallied to new highs in mid-March, the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token was only trading at $0.80 on March 14. With the market soon entering into a correction, the Cardano(\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token also witnessed a drop. The Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token was down by 27.5% to trade at $0.58 on March 20.\par \par \uc2 Since then, as the market has recovered, the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token has only risen by 10.3% to $0.64 on March 31. Amid the subdued price action for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), it announced the dates for the Cardano Summit 2024 on March 8.\par \par \uc2 Hence, due to a lack of strength in the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token, experts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on it. They predict that the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) token will drop below $0.60 in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash Surges To New Yearly Highs as it Approaches Halving\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin Cash (BCH) token had been lagging in the market even as the market rose to new highs in mid-March. The Bitcoin Cash (BCH) price dropped by 30.2% from $508.38 on March 3 to $354.51 on March 20 as the market corrected. Since then the Bitcoin Cash (BCH) token has managed to reverse its downtrend and rise to new yearly highs.\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin Cash (BCH) token was up by 92.9% on April 1 to rise to $684.09. This surge in the Bitcoin Cash (BCH) price has been a result of its upcoming halving on April 3. Moreover, it was revealed on March 21 that \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  is preparing to list Bitcoin Cash (BCH) Futures\par \par \uc2 Hence, the experts predict the Bitcoin Cash (BCH) price to continue rising and trade above $700.\par \par \uc2 For the latest updates and more information, be sure to visit the officialRebel Satoshi Website or contact Rebel Red via {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/RBLZRED"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\uc2  Telegram\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240406ek450000v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , TON, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,613 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin may stay range-bound till the halving, indicating that the bulls and the bears are cautious in taking large bets.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $69,000 mark. Independent trader and analyst Daan Crypto Trades said in a X post that Bitcoin has been hovering around the 2021 cycle high for about four weeks. Historically, Bitcoin consolidates for about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4-8 weeks near the cycle highs}}}\uc2  before the price starts moving again.\par \par \uc2 Although the range-bound action frustrates traders, the shallow pullback is a positive sign. Checkmate, the pseudonymous lead on-chain analyst at Glassnode, said in a X post that during the previous bull market cycle between 2019 and the end of 2021, Bitcoin witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-absorbs-100m-sell-bears-lose-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two corrections of more than 50%}}}\uc2 . However, pullbacks during the current bull phase have been milder, with the last 20% drawdown in September last year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/fc354435-02fc-44c2-9c9f-e716467daafd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The massive buying interest in the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds may have limited the downside during the current cycle. Another reason for the shallow pullback could be the expectation that Bitcoin could extend its bull market after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current consolidation resolve to the downside or the upside? Is the correction in select altcoins over? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating a balance between buyers and sellers. Generally, the symmetrical triangle acts as a continuation pattern, but sometimes, it may behave as a reversal setup.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/b6578ec8-b3de-4e26-bdfc-d2ef4b6e9249.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($67,750) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price turns down and breaks below the triangle, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction. The BTC/USDT pair may drop to $60,000 and eventually to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks above the triangle, it will suggest that the bulls have absorbed the supply. That will increase the likelihood of the resumption of the uptrend. The pair may rise to $73,777 and subsequently to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 50-day SMA ($3,434) for the past three days, indicating a lack of aggressive demand at these levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/24df6796-9d1c-40b7-8359-c1900af14319.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, indicating that the sellers have an advantage. There is strong support at $3,056, but if that level gets taken out, the ETH/USDT pair may decline to $2,700.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off the $3,056 level with strength, it will signal aggressive buying on dips. The pair may consolidate between $3,056 and $3,678 for a few days. A rise above $3,678 will indicate that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/c0f483e9-1873-48cd-a1fd-5e25e54a7822.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout from a triangle. Hence, it is best to wait for the breakout to happen before establishing large positions. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA ($565) and breaks above the triangle, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The BNB/USDT pair could climb to $692 and then to the pattern target of $795.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price skids below the triangle, the advantage will shift in favor of the bears, and the pair could collapse to $460. If this level gives way, the next stop could be the pattern target of $395.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 20-day EMA ($181) on April 5, indicating profit-booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/b8e30abd-e765-43ee-9f2d-f2ac49583c32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $162. If the price rebounds off this level with strength and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $162 and $205 for a while.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  double-top pattern if the price continues lower and plunges below $162. There is a minor support at the 50-day SMA ($152), but it is likely to be broken. The pair could thereafter tumble to $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fell below the uptrend line on April 3, and the bears successfully defended the level on April 4, indicating selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/9bb793cf-b45f-4df1-8e30-2fcdb69ae9a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.61) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. If the price skids below $0.56, the XRP/USDT pair could slump to $0.52 and then to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly push the price back above the 20-day EMA. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $0.69. This level may again act as a strong barrier, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair may reach $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.18) on April 3, and the bears thwarted attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the level on April 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/4579a217-f9fa-4011-acc2-3b35ba9f47c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to build on their advantage and yank the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.15). This is an important level to watch out for because a break below it could open the doors for a further fall to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have their work cutout. If they want to regain the upper hand, they will have to quickly propel the price above $0.19. If they do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could climb to the $0.23 overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to defend the $0.57 level in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), suggesting a lack of demand at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/3029e66e-5cce-4caa-b8da-f0bc27cb5476.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below $0.57, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. This negative setup has a target objective of $0.33, but the bulls will try to arrest the fall at the strong support of $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from $0.57, it will signal solid buying at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will then attempt a rally to $0.68, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-66k-blackrock-us-banks-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price bounces at $66K as BlackRock adds US banks to Bitcoin ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 50-day SMA ($47) on April 3, indicating that the bears are in charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/d3432781-d6fb-4401-839d-ef1cf1eb0c39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back above the 50-day SMA on April 4 but failed. That increases the likelihood of a drop to $42. This is an important support, and the bulls are likely to defend it with vigor. Any recovery may again face selling at the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to thrust and maintain the price above the downtrend line to suggest that the correction may be over. The AVAX/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $60 and subsequently to $65.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s (TON) bounce off the 20-day EMA ($4.73) on April 3 has reached the downtrend line, a crucial level to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/7a3f3ef8-9eed-4de0-868e-d62abafffddf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The TON/USDT pair could retest the $5.69 resistance. The bears are expected to fiercely defend this level because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair could skyrocket toward $7.09.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from $5.69, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound between $5.69 and $4.72 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) back above the 20-day EMA ($0.000028), but the bears are not relenting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/c647c6d6-1d05-4842-b751-26c6ab300b05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. A break and close below the 50-day SMA ($0.000024) could accelerate selling and sink the SHIB/USDT pair to $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive and maintain the price above the downtrend line to suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could rise to $0.000033 and later to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvNGZiY2VlMzUtZTY1YS00MjExLWIwMDYtYTUxYzI4OWU4MjZhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240405ek45000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,640 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price looks set to swing between $60,000 and $72,000 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in an uptrend, indicating a tussle between the bulls and the bears. The bears hold the edge in the near term, as the 14th week of the year has historically seen {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-65k-more-losses-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin prices fall by an average of 8.33%}}}\uc2 , according to Coinglass data.\par \par \uc2 During Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action, traders are likely to focus on the performance of the spot Bitcoin-exchange traded funds, which have been the primary driver of the price. A comparison may be made with March, which saw a sharp uptick in trading volume.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-trading-volume-tripled-in-march-to-111-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Bitcoin ETF volume surged}}}\uc2  from $42.2 billion in February to $111 billion in March.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/938fd418-fc18-4161-8ec0-79025335e9bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the uncertainty increases as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  approaches. Independent analyst Rekt Capital believes the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pullback is a part of the pre-halving retrace}}}\uc2  that resulted in a 38% drop in 2016 and 20% in 2020.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bulls to propel the price above $71,770 may have tempted the short-term traders to throw in their towel. That sent the price tumbling below the 20-day exponential moving average ($67,646) on April 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/039e0f44-686f-4d84-98c1-f0adc105ab02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium could tilt in favor of the bears if the price skids below the 50-day simple moving average ($63,098). That could open the doors for a drop to $59,000 and subsequently to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $54,298.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the BTC/USDT pair may stay range-bound for some time. The bulls will have to shove the price above the $71,770 to $73,777 resistance zone to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the 50-day SMA ($3,414) on April 2, opening the doors for a retest of the March 20 low of $3,056.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/4f25e7af-0bff-467e-ac3b-6aea6d0fe9cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($3,493) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating that the bears have the upper hand. If the price breaks below $3,056, the selling could pick up, and the ETH/USDT pair may collapse to $2,700.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to push the price back above the moving averages. That will suggest a range-bound action between $3,056 and $3,679. A break and close above $3,679 will indicate that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then rise to $4,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($561) on April 2, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/54965d17-6fd5-4957-a00f-9bf2de2c11ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term. If the price rises from the current level, it could rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower and breaks below $535, the next stop is likely to be $495. This level may act as a strong support, but if the bears prevail, the decline could extend to the breakout level of $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) fell to the 20-day EMA ($181) on April 2, but the sharp rebound on April 3 shows the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/9f6294d1-2629-4e4c-944a-be152fc23a84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to overcome the barrier at $205. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may rally to $243 and later to $260.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price once again turns down from $205, it will indicate that the bears are fiercely defending the level. That increases the possibility of a drop below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the short-term traders may dump their positions, pulling the pair to the 50-day SMA ($150).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the large range between $0.46 and $0.74. The price fell below the uptrend line on April 1, indicating that the bears are trying to take charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/a41d8591-9545-4475-b805-9324047cecab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not given up and are trying to start a relief rally, which is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.61). If the price turns down from this resistance, the likelihood of a drop below $0.56 increases. The XRP/USDT pair could then slump to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal solid buying at lower levels. The pair could then rise to $0.69 and eventually to $0.74, which remains the key resistance to cross.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sustained selling pressure has pulled Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to the strong support at $0.57. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/dca1581c-d96e-4c1d-8242-80c1a677ed17.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the $0.57 level, it is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.64). If the price turns lower from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a drop below $0.57. That will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, which could clear the path for a fall to the critical support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may consolidate between $0.57 and $0.68 for a while. A rise above $0.68 will suggest that the corrective phase may be over.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply on April 2 and nosedived below the breakout level of $0.19, signaling that the traders are aggressively booking profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/62e2c325-350d-4e05-9793-6e52afef4007.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair continued lower and slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.18) on April 3, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. If the buyers push the price back above $0.20, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The bulls will then try to challenge the overhead resistance at $0.23.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and maintains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that every minor rally is being sold into. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.14).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-solana-price-up-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above the downtrend line accelerated selling and Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the breakout level of $50 on April 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/43127198-2a1b-4d44-a392-2391bb68419b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling continued, and the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair dropped below the 50-day SMA ($47) on April 3. Buyers are trying to defend the 50-day SMA, but the recovery is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA. The pair could then retest the crucial support at $42. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated on a break and close above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 20-day EMA ($0.000028) on April 2, indicating that the bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/f44265bd-1d01-410d-8ac7-dd679eba23b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.000023), which is likely to act as a solid support. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will attempt to push the pair to $0.000033. A break and close above this level will be the first sign that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price plummets below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction toward $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) reached the 20-day EMA ($4.63) on April 3, an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/9bfa699e-0e4c-4786-89cd-4b48bd3a08cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the rebound off the 20-day EMA sustains, it will suggest that traders continue to buy at lower levels. That could keep the TON/USDT pair stuck inside a range between the 20-day EMA and $5.69 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are booking profits in a hurry. That could sink the pair to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $4.22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvYTMwYmEyYzEtM2FhNS00YWZhLWEyY2UtN2U3ZWJhNDcyMzFmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240403ek43000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/2: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,577 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 April 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market is crumbling ahead of Bitcoin's long-awaited halving event. Is the correction a buy-the-dip opportunity?\par \par \uc2 Risky assets have been on a roll in the first quarter of 2024. The S&P 500 Index (SPX) rose 10.2% to record its best first-quarter performance since 2019, while Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/highest-monthly-close-ever-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rallied nearly 69%}}}\uc2 . Will the rally continue into the second quarter, or is it time for profit booking?\par \par \uc2 Investors remain upbeat on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prospects for the second quarter. Expectations of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pick up in institutional demand}}}\uc2  for spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving}}}\uc2  is helping maintain the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/37fa63a7-f424-4fd1-9c54-148ba0a93f0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders need to be careful after the strong Q1 performance because nothing goes up in a straight line. Bull markets are known for their sharp corrections, which shake out the late entrants. However, the dips offer a low-risk buying opportunity to the long-term investors.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index bounced off the support of the ascending channel pattern and made a new all-time high on March 28, indicating that the uptrend remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/bd750c33-650c-4957-9fff-13681c3d3dcd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the upsloping moving averages indicate that the bulls are in control, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) cautions of a possible correction or consolidation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness on the downside will be a break and close below the 20-day exponential moving average (5,176). If that happens, the stops of several traders may get hit, and the index could plummet to the 50-day simple moving average (5,055).\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to kick the price above the channel if they want to maintain control. That could start an up move toward 5,450.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar Index (DXY) has been gradually moving higher and has reached the crucial overhead resistance of 105.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/cd926b1a-1aa0-4adf-a3a2-6ef747ac2bf2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory show that the bulls have the upper hand. If buyers overcome the obstacle at 105, the index could start an up move to 106 and eventually to 107.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from 105, the index could slip to the 20-day EMA (104). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a rise above 105 increases, but if the index breaks below the moving averages, it will open the doors for a possible fall to 102.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Bitcoin above $71,770, and today's correction proves that bears are not ready to let go.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/344a7900-57f0-47d9-9823-97d20bd90c24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The tight-range trading is likely to break out soon, but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. If the price slumps below the 20-day EMA, the short-term traders may book profits, pulling the BTC/USDT pair to the 50-day SMA ($62,430).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up and breaks above the $71,770 to $73,777 zone, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair could then resume its march toward $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to rise and maintain above the immediate resistance at $3,679, indicating that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/3172378a-0b43-4f2e-a278-24f0d453cc96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to take advantage of the situation and sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($3,386). If they do that, the selling is likely to pick up, and the ETH/USDT pair could skid to $3,250 and subsequently to the critical support at $3,056.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the decline, they will have to propel the price above $3,679. That could open the doors for a possible retest of $4,000. This level may again act as a significant hurdle, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could reach $4,500.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $620 on March 29 and fell to the 20-day EMA ($562) on April 1, suggesting profit booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/41d9188e-2937-4086-ade6-97a7e889205b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is an essential support to watch out for because a break and close below it could sink the BNB/USDT pair to $496. Buyers are expected to aggressively defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. The bulls will then make another attempt to push the price to $645. A break above this level could catapult the price to $692.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the overhead resistance of $205 on April 1, indicating aggressive selling at the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/3467710f-8421-4134-85bc-eb83b65fcc45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the 20-day EMA ($180), an essential support to watch. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls continue to buy the dips. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $205. If that happens, the pair may resume the uptrend and rally toward $267.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($147).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price action of the past several days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/29907746-4639-4151-87bc-d40bd2d27d87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the buyers or the sellers. The bulls will have to shove the price above the triangle to suggest the start of an up move to the formidable resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below the triangle, it will indicate that the bears are trying to take charge. The selling could pick up below the uptrend line, and the XRP/USDT pair could dive to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to flip Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) $0.19 level into support but are struggling to push the price above $0.23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/46663654-688c-43b4-9f22-780c0d571193.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to exploit the situation and sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the 20-day EMA ($0.18). If they do that, the selling could pick up, and the pair may plunge to the next significant support at the 50-day SMA ($0.14).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks above $0.23, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to resume the uptrend. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.30, where they may again face resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) failure to rise above the $0.68 resistance in the past few days shows that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/5ee6b83e-a04f-4c44-8d0d-4387d9ec4430.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $0.63 and will try to extend the decline to the solid support at $57. If the price rebounds off $0.57, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may remain range-bound between $0.57 and $0.68 for a while.\par \par \uc2 The pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern if the price plummets below the critical support at $0.57. That may signal the start of a deeper correction to $0.46. The bulls will have to kick the price above $0.68 to be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to keep Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($53) in the past few days but failed to start a strong rebound. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-04/f05608e5-82b0-40c6-9c43-39daccec4350.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up on April 1, and the bears pulled the AVAX/USDT pair to the $50 support. This is a crucial level to watch out for because a break below it could accelerate selling and pull the pair to $42.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line. The pair could rise to $60 and thereafter attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $65.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDQvMzBjYmUwNjgtNzMyMi00NWJhLWIzOTEtMDdkMDk0Njk2NGE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240403ek4200005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
