\par\par \b \uc2 Why Is Kelexo (KLXO) Sets the Stage for a Crypto Lending Milestone Drawing Interest from Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) & \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) Investors Join Early\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 564 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 March 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) - Navigating the \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Trend}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Litecoin (LTC) - Approaching a Major Milestone}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kelexo (KLXO) - Revolution in Cryptocurrency Lending}}}\par \par \uc2 Kelexo (KLXO) has entered the cryptocurrency investing industry with the goal of reinventing traditional crypto lending. There has been exponential growth in decentralized finance (DeFi), which has driven a desire among scores of investors to examine {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://kelexo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kelexo}}}\uc2  (KLXO) crypto lending platform, believing it has the potential to establish a trend in the next big thing when it comes to the redefinition of borrowing and lending procedures.\par \par \uc2 Hence, here we will get into the dynamics of the Kelexo (KLXO) platform while also exploring both the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tendencies of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC).\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) - Navigating the \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trend\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has come under intense attack as big cryptocurrencies regain their footing. Despite recent market moves, many predict Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will gain pace in the next few days. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), which is presently trading at $0.6476 and has a market capitalization of $23.04 billion, has seen an 8% increase in trading volume, indicating good market sentiment. Although it has not yet reached an all-time high, the recent rise and Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ranking appear to be highly promising.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) - Approaching a Major Milestone\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) has received a lot of attention over the last week, following an unremarkable \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  week in the middle of March in which the price tested the important $100 barrier. This altcoin is currently selling at around $95. Investors and analysts are confident about its future growth. The Reserve Risk indicates that investors are quite confident that \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) has a bright future, while the \uc2 RSI\uc2  indicates that there is still room for the price to rise further. Strong selling interest was observed near the $102 mark.\par \par \uc2 However, this did little to deter \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) bulls from being motivated by profit opportunities. However, the liquidation of positions from long-term holders could create temporary resistance in front of \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 's (LTC) run-up towards $100.\par \par \uc2 Kelexo (KLXO) - Revolution in Cryptocurrency Lending\par \par \uc2 Kelexo (KLXO) is a groundbreaking name in the cryptocurrency lending space, attracting a lot of attention from investors and enthusiasts. Kelexo (KLXO) distinguishes itself from the competition through its decentralized strategy. It means the platform has entirely excluded intermediaries from participating, which has resulted in fee reductions during the borrowing and lending processes.\par \par \uc2 It has also proved its potential among top cryptocurrency investors such as Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC), indicating a strong potential for attracting a diverse investor base. The platform's decentralized governance architecture, which places a greater emphasis on security and transparency, boosts investors' confidence even further.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the team tokens are locked. The team has devised a strategy to ensure long-term liquidity. As Kelexo (KLXO) moves through this stage and into the second half of its presale, investors have early possibilities to invest in this unique crypto lending ecosystem at the modest price of $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Kelexo (KLXO) presale by visiting the website {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://kelexo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240401ek3v00009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,635 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s failure to maintain above $70,000 may tempt short-term traders to book profits, dragging the price lower.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery is showing hesitation near $70,000, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. Acheron Trading CEO Laurent Benayoun believes the current bull cycle has room to run and could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-high-can-bitcoin-go-180k-btc-price-prediction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 top out between $120,000 and $180,000}}}\uc2 , buoyed by several factors such as the Bitcoin exchange-traded funds, the upcoming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2 , and the likely reduction in interest rates.\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  voice was that of Bitwise chief investment officer \uc2 Matthew Hougan\uc2 , who said in a memo to the investment professionals to \u8220\'20\'1Ckeep calm and take the long view.\u8221\'20\'1D Hougan believes that if global wealth managers allocate 1% of their portfolio into Bitcoin, that could result in an inflow of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-1-trillion-bull-market-bitwise-chief"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 roughly $1 trillion into the space}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/07fa49a3-10b0-42bb-9cec-2f81b71557bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although there are several \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalysts for Bitcoin to continue its rally in Q2 2024, trading firm QCP Capital cautioned that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exhaustion-q1-btc-price-gains-near-70"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 current move was showing signs of exhaustion}}}\uc2  and the bulls may find it challenging to extend the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins correct in the near term, or will their rally continue? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been stuck inside a tight range of $71,770 and $68,359 for the past few days, suggesting indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4198446d-be3d-4d0b-b669-026e3b1104d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near the highs is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are holding on to their positions and not rushing to the exit. The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($67,274) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone suggest that bulls have an edge.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair will resume its uptrend if the price breaks above the $71,770 to $73,777 resistance zone. That could open the gates for a rally to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are booking profits. That could sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($61,107).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range near the $3,678 overhead resistance, suggesting a solid battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/5605930b-89f2-4b68-884a-c32cb97542cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($3,527) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price turns up and breaks above $3,678, the ETH/USDT pair could climb to $4,100. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level, but if the bulls come out on top, the rally could reach $4,500.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $3,460, it will signal that the bulls have given up. That could start a decline to the 50-day SMA ($3,324). This level is likely to attract buyers, but a weak bounce off it will enhance the prospects of a drop to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $588 for a few days, BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) made a decisive move higher on March 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/44bdcee5-b786-41b3-9134-721ca78f137d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $588, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance of $645. This level may act as a hurdle, but if bulls overcome it, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $669 and eventually to $692.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to fiercely defend the $645 level and yank the pair below the 20-day EMA ($552). That could start a deeper correction toward $495.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at the downtrend line, signaling that the bears are trying to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ed72b423-3424-4db2-9cc9-b21a7848a09e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($175), it will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. The SOL/USDT pair could fall to $162 and below it to the 50-day SMA ($141).\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to kick the price above the downtrend line. The pair will then attempt to break above the stiff overhead resistance of $205. If that happens, the pair may start the next leg of the up move to $267.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.62) for several days, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/3006dae0-4eb1-4fac-bdc3-22be069d9f91.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the uptrend line. This is an essential level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could signal an advantage to the bears. The pair could then sink to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bulls if they drive the price above $0.69. That could clear the path for a rally to the formidable resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to keep Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the breakout level of $0.68, which is a negative sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/23aec131-0ff5-44e4-807f-61560610bf38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price falls below $0.63, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could remain range-bound between $0.68 and $0.57 for a few days. The 20-day EMA ($0.66) has started to slope down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will be in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat after the price rises and sustains above $0.70. If that happens, the possibility of a rally to $0.81 increases.\par \par \uc2 The bears will be back in control on a break below $0.57, as that will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back in an uptrend, suggesting that the traders are booking profits near the overhead resistance of $0.23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/b58a98ba-e8e1-4507-87f1-a3b55d6b442a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could correct to the breakout level of $0.19. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will increase the likelihood of a rally to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price dives below $0.19. That could open the doors for a fall to the 20-day EMA ($0.17). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it may sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($0.13).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is finding it difficult to bounce off the support line of the pennant, indicating that the bears are keeping up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/e42f7502-92ad-4ab1-afcf-9e4743a64de9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price plunges below the 20-day EMA ($53), the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $50. This level may again attract buyers, but if the bears prevail, the pair could start a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($46).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the support line, the pair could reach the resistance line of the pennant. A break and close above the pennant will be the first sign of strength. The pair could then retest the stiff overhead resistance of $65.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing selling at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000032, indicating that the bears are trying to stage a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/950eb9db-6c28-40d7-b050-301d5af0266b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.000028), it will increase the risk of a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.000021). Such a sharp decline is likely to delay the start of the next leg of the up move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The SHIB/USDT pair could then rise to $0.000035 and thereafter to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s (TON) rebound on March 29 shows that the bulls are trying to defend the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $4.78.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/98ee17c9-d365-4898-b4c3-92029e3352f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the rebound sustains, the buyers will try to push the price toward the overhead resistance of $5.69. The upsloping moving averages suggest advantage to buyers, but the negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be slowing down.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $4.78, the selling could intensify, and the TON/USDT pair may slip to the 20-day EMA ($4.30). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a close below it will suggest a short-term trend change.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvNWRmODI1YzEtZDU5Zi00MDFhLWI1MzQtMzllY2EzN2I2ZGYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240329ek3t000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,611 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing resistance at $72,000, but the bulls have not given up much ground, indicating buying on every minor dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recent fall does not seem to have dented the demand for the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. After five days of successive net outflows last week, demand bounced back sharply with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-inflows-back-in-black-418-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $418 million in net inflows into the ETFs}}}\uc2  on March 26 and $243 million inflows on March 27, according to Farside Investors data.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO \uc2 Larry Fink\uc2  said in an interview with Fox Business that he was \u8220\'20\'1Cpleasantly surprised\u8221\'20\'1D with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-fastest-growing-etf-larry-fink"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 performance of the firm\u8217\'20\'19s spot Bitcoin ETF}}}\uc2 , which was the \u8220\'20\'1Cfastest growing ETF in the history of ETFs.\u8221\'20\'1D Fink added that he was \u8220\'20\'1Cvery \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the long-term viability of Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/996d8134-284d-418f-86e1-acbaefffdf11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant said in its latest \u8220\'20\'1CWeekly Crypto Report\u8221\'20\'1D that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sell-side-liquidity-crisis-btc-move-2010"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s demand skyrocketed}}}\uc2  from \u8220\'20\'1C40K Bitcoin at the start of 2024 to 213K Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D on March 26. That could create a \u8220\'20\'1Csell-side liquidity crisis\u8221\'20\'1D within the next year.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery and hit a new all-time high before the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2 ? Will that trigger buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin witnessed profit booking on March 26 and 27, but a positive sign is that the bulls maintained the price above the pennant.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/79cb7f5a-5602-470a-a60f-fabbcb9023d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($67,069) has started to turn up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the positive territory, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above $73,777, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and rally to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it could open the doors for a potential drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($60,629).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling near $3,678, but a positive sign is that the bulls are trying to defend the 20-day EMA ($3,530).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/55838412-116a-42a5-b8be-76aac29b44ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above $3,678, the possibility of a rally to $4,100 increases. This level may act as a stiff hurdle, but if the buyers prevail, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $4,500 and then to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below $3,460, it will suggest that the bears are not willing to give up. The pair may then slip to the 50-day SMA ($3,302). A slide below this support could start a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) March 25 and 26 candlestick shows that the bears are defending the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $588.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ef24b401-1bcf-4e25-a73d-556c23b0e2aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the 20-day EMA ($546). This remains the critical level to keep an eye on. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the pair will again attempt to rise above $600 and reach $645.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price drops below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The pair could then drop to the critical support at $495. The bulls may aggressively buy the dips to this level.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery is faltering at $196, indicating that the bears are selling on relief rallies near the overhead resistance of $205.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2e463c09-662f-4fc6-a4e9-2f84fc4eff1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($173), which is a crucial level to keep an eye on. If the price plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The SOL/USDT pair could decline to $162 and below that to the 50-day SMA ($140).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate solid demand at lower levels. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $205. If that happens, the pair may start its journey to $267.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the uptrend line and $0.67 for the past few days, indicating indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/51a87983-9b04-43fd-9adc-70ed8da833b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below the 20-day EMA ($0.62), the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the uptrend line. A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above $0.67 or on a drop below the uptrend line. Above $0.67, the pair could start a rally to the formidable hurdle at $0.74. On the downside, a break below the uptrend line could sink the pair to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) March 26 candlestick suggests that the bears are trying to keep the price below $0.68.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/6aa6e35b-d521-44be-9123-c5ca2809ef04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price remains below the moving averages, it will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could swing between $0.57 and $0.68 for a while. The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.66) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 However, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.70, it will indicate that the bulls are back in the game. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.81, where the bears may pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) soared above the $0.19 to $0.21 overhead resistance zone on March 28, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/65ab3c6e-3a6a-4e31-97a0-a971b80cf714.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in command. There is a minor resistance at $0.23, but if buyers bulldoze their way through, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.30 and then to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly pull the price back below $0.19. If they do that, it will trap the aggressive bulls, resulting in long liquidation. The pair could then slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.16).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-copy-classic-bull-market-btc-price-72k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whales copy classic bull market moves as BTC price eyes $72K}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) price action of the past few days has formed a pennant, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/81ee0d54-65ad-4fce-91aa-79076d774b7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($52) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate a slight advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to defend the support line of the pennant and push the price toward the resistance line. A break and close above the pennant will signal that the AVAX/USDT pair could resume the uptrend. The pair may rise to $65 and later to the pattern target of $76.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the pennant, it will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls. There is strong support at $50, but if this level gives way, the pair could tumble to the 50-day SMA ($45).\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) recovery climbed above the resistance line on March 26, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/1d59ff43-7e25-4b06-b33e-bf28dba8fb3f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair is likely to rise to $0.000035 where the bears are again expected to mount a strong defense. A break above this level could open the doors for a possible rise to $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($0.000028). If that happens, it will suggest that the break above the resistance line may have been a bull trap. The pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.000021).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is correcting in an uptrend, but the pullback is finding support at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $4.78, signaling buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/51cf5531-0cd0-43a8-adeb-817154a83e95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages suggest an advantage to the bulls, but the developing negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  points to a possible consolidation or correction in the short term. If the price turns down and slips below $4.78, it will indicate selling on rallies. The TON/USDT pair could sink to the 20-day EMA ($4.22).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the rebound sustains, the rally could reach the stiff overhead resistance of $5.69. A break above this level will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend toward $7.15.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvZmNmM2JkMjQtODllOS00MzBmLWIyMmItYWFjNzdjOWI0NDljLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240328ek3s000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
