ared to Cosmos (ATOM) and Polkadot (DOT).\par \par \uc2 Kelexo (KLXO) has already been audited by a reputable company. This ensures the security and safety of funds and protects the platform from bad actors. Users can also view all transactions and records ensuring a transparent and stable environment.\par \par \uc2 While Polkadot (DOT) and Cosmos (ATOM) might enjoy better market conditions in the future, Kelexo (KLXO) presents a better alternative for investors seeking huge returns.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Kelexo (KLXO) presale by visiting the website {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://kelexo.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240326ek3p00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/25: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,532 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp recovery suggests that the most recent corrective phase could be over.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has started the week positively and is trying to maintain above the $70,000 level. Analysts are hopeful of a reversal this week following {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-outflows-incredible-demand-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 five successive days of negative inflows}}}\uc2  into spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) last week.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said its clients are showing a strong appetite for the firm\u8217\'20\'19s future and options offerings. Max Minton, head of digital assets for Goldman Asia Pacific, said the firm\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-hedge-fund-clients-come-back-crypto-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 larger clients were showing greater interest}}}\uc2  in the crypto sector following the launch of the spot Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/e878055b-b278-4d62-91d9-d66605d7e593.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The demand for spot Bitcoin ETFs is likely to remain strong barring a sharp fall in Bitcoin. That could keep the retracements shallow as market participants will jump in to buy the dips.\par \par \uc2 What are the key resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index continues to rise inside the ascending channel pattern, indicating that the buyers remain in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/7519bcff-41cb-4475-a488-c9139ae737f4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up move is likely to face selling at the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line. If the price turns down from the resistance line, the index could extend its stay inside the channel. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up on a break above the channel, and the index could soar to 5,450.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average (5,147), it will indicate that the bulls are rushing the exit. That may accelerate selling and tug the price down to the 50-day simple moving average (5,018). The negative divergence on the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) warns of a possible correction in the near term.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the U.S. dollar Index (DXY) below the 20-day EMA ($103) on March 20 but could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2f37fe55-a865-4aa3-86ee-2ec984436cbe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The index turned up sharply on March 21 and climbed back above the moving averages, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels. The index could rise toward the solid overhead resistance at 105. If the price turns down from this level, the index may remain range-bound between 102.50 and 105 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above 105, it could start a trending move toward 107. There is a minor resistance at 106, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke out of the pennant formation of the past few days, signaling that the bulls have seized control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/e60b7230-146e-49b7-8156-43b8b9125d6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bulls maintain the price above $69,000, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to surge to the overhead resistance at $73,777. This level may act as a significant roadblock, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could rally to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The bears will try to sink the price below the pennant. If they do that, the pair could tumble to the 50-day SMA ($59,018).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has broken out of the 20-day EMA ($3,521) on March 25, indicating that the bulls have asserted their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2ed91e8f-440b-4989-ad0b-4dffdf60f158.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The ETH/USDT pair could rise to $3,679 and thereafter rally to the overhead resistance at $4,094.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down from $3,679 and plunges below the 50-day SMA. That could indicate the start of a deeper correction to $3,056 and then $2,868.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) relief rally has risen above the overhead resistance at $590, an important level to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/b1b94631-d7a7-44a0-a523-293c5989f70d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers sustain the price above $590, the BNB/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and jump to $645. This level may pose a strong challenge, but if overcome, the next stop may be $692.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($534). If they do that, the pair may drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $500.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($168) on March 24, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/9363b079-d5d4-48e5-8f86-8e9c000f13e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the SOL/USDT pair to the formidable resistance at $205. If the price turns down from $205, the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA and remain between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $205 will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair could rise to $243 and eventually to $260. The strong support on the downside is the 20-day EMA, below which the pair could reach the 50-day SMA ($134).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been hovering around the 20-day EMA ($0.62) for the past few days, indicating a tussle between the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/69a86f4d-c96c-4b46-a9cf-aef8a336faac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The XRP/USDT pair could swing between the uptrend line and $0.67 for a while.\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above $0.67, the pair could rally to the overhead obstacle at $0.74. The bears are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a drop below the uptrend will put the bears in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then collapse to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-69k-bitcoin-short-liquidation-zone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price battles for key $69K as Bitcoin nears short liquidation zone}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally has reached the stiff resistance at $0.19, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/0a22583f-da45-4f58-b4a0-76660f239ea3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.15) is sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, the likelihood of a rally above $0.19 increases. The DOGE/USDT pair may jump to $0.23 and subsequently to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the pair may continue its range-bound action between $0.12 and $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.66), a crucial resistance to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ebc49892-9c15-4fc5-ab18-2898077bbf86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the bears continue to view the relief rallies as a selling opportunity. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then again drop to $0.57. If this support gives way, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises above $0.70, it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The pair will then attempt to climb to the overhead resistance at $0.81. If this level is scaled, the next stop is likely to be $0.92.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has stayed above the breakout level of $50 in the past few days, indicating solid demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/7e6ef2ab-b50c-4dc0-8885-74ad44e762b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls are in command. There is a minor hurdle at $58, but if it is crossed, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the critical resistance at $65. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level, but if overcome, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $87.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside move, they will have to drag the price back below $50. That may accelerate selling and sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($44).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvYmYyODcxZTAtY2IzMS00NTQ4LWJkM2ItZTI1OTcwNzMyOTUwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240325ek3p000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
