r \par \uc2 \u9679\'25\'CF Market cap: $6.7 Billion\u9679\'25\'CF Use case: Decentralized Exchange\u9679\'25\'CF All time high: $44.97\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): A Revolutionary Blockchain with the Aim to Make the World a Better Place\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is an open-source, proof-of-stake protocol that contributes to positive global change through peer-reviewed technological developments. The Cardano coin has encountered a recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, which has seen the token lose about 17% in value over the last week. This has put a dent in the token's ambition of reaching the $1 mark in the foreseeable weeks.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Cardano's price has overseen a significant uptrend, as shown in the token's 79% growth in a year-to-date {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price metric}}}\uc2 . Similarly, Cardano's trading volume is showing an average day-to-day growth of over 30% since last week. This growth underscores the slight but visible \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal being showcased by Cardano. Experts believe the token is likely to trigger a significant uptrend before the end of March.\par \par \uc2 \u9679\'25\'CF Market cap: $22 Billion\u9679\'25\'CF Use case: Staking\u9679\'25\'CF All time high: $3.10\par \par \uc2 XRP (XRP): An Effective Alternative to the Bitcoin Blockchain\par \par \uc2 XRP (XRP) is an open-source, decentralized blockchain ledger that employs permissionless protocol to execute on-chain transactions. The XRP protocol was launched in 2021 by owners David Schwartz, \uc2 Jed McCaleb\uc2 , and Arthur Britto. XRP supports a variety of DApps in its ecosystem, such as DeFi and NFTs (in prospect).\par \par \uc2 The XRP token has recorded over 53% in a year-to-date price metric. Moreover, XRP's trading volume has been on a positive growth of over 100% on a day-to-day average since the past few weeks. Also, the XRP's market cap valuation sits comfortably above the $33B valuation. While the token's 7-day price turn shows a 7% loss, XRP still maintains a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trajectory in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 As such, XRP's journey to reaching the $1 mark is likely to happen in Q2. Some analysts believe the token price will reach $5 in the year.\par \par \uc2 \u9679\'25\'CF Market cap: $33 Billion\u9679\'25\'CF Use case: Decentralized Ledger\u9679\'25\'CF All time high: $3.84\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrencies highlighted in the article are based on in-house crypto analysts' market analysis of a significant number of altcoins in the market. These alt coins all have a substantial likelihood of growth over the next couple of months. However, KangaMoon is perhaps the crowning jewel of the tokens listed in the article due to its exponential potential while still in its presale phase.\par \par \uc2 With over 180% growth within the first four stages of its presale, it is no wonder that experts are projecting massive price growth for the token in the future. At the current trajectory, KANG may go on to become the next blue-chip meme coin in the industry alongside Dogecoin, Shiba Inu, and more.\par \par \uc2 Explore the thrilling opportunities available in the KangaMoon (KANG) presale today!\par \par \uc2 Website:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://KangaMoon.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://KangaMoon.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Join Our Telegram Community: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/kangamoonofficial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/KangaMoonofficial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/KangaMoonofficial}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the viewsof Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240325ek3o0000d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,579 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price treads on soft terrain as the bulls struggle to clear the overhead resistance at $69,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) failure to build upon its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-gains-12-fomc-bitcoin-260m-etf-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 solid comeback on March 20}}}\uc2  shows that bears are selling on relief rallies. The pullback has dampened sentiment in the short term, resulting in net outflows from the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) for four straight days, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/?p=997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  from Farside Investors.\par \par \uc2 However, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-cycle-is-far-from-over-thanks-to-the-halving-cryptoquant-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bull market is not yet over}}}\uc2 , according to a report by CryptoQuant. The on-chain data analytics firm said the bull market generally ends with \u8220\'20\'1C84%-92% of investment\u8221\'20\'1D from the short-term holders, which currently is at 48%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4133aeed-512d-4aa2-a655-baf589b601dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The correction before the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Halving}}}\uc2  is a healthy sign for the long-term sustainability of the bull market because parabolic moves are rarely sustainable. Every dip shakes out the weak hands and allows the stronger hands to add to their positions.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins continue their correction, or is it time for the recovery to begin? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded sharply off the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $61,736, indicating that traders view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/bece4a7b-470e-4823-9206-78ac883f54d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) has flattened out, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is just above the midpoint, suggesting a range-bound action in the near term. The BTC/USDT pair may face resistance at $69,000 and support at $60,775.\par \par \uc2 A consolidation near the high is a positive sign, showing the bulls are holding on to their positions and not rushing to the exit. A break above $69,000 could open the doors for a retest of the all-time high at $73,777.\par \par \uc2 The downside support is at $60,775, followed by the 50-day SMA ($57,623). Buyers are expected to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the 50-day SMA ($3,161) on March 20, but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($3,537).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/0222c447-792b-4013-8c86-ff7deed6c400.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair turned down from the 20-day EMA on March 22, indicating that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. Sellers will make one more attempt to break the 50-day SMA support. If they succeed, the pair may collapse to $2,717.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the pair may remain between the moving averages. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up after the pair rises above $3,700. The pair may then reach the overhead resistance at $4,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($520) on March 20, but the relief rally faces resistance near $590.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/021ffead-6652-4b4b-b108-7f8c87dc824f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the March 22 candlestick shows selling near $590. The bears will again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA and open the gates for a drop to the breakout level of $460. This level is likely to witness aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above $590 could push the BNB/USDT pair to the stiff overhead resistance at $645. If this resistance is taken out, the uptrend may continue, and the pair could rally to $692.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) witnessed solid buying at the 20-day EMA ($163) on March 20, but the bulls could not drive the price above $205.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/62f11e8a-3292-4de7-baeb-e962560dfcd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to clear the overhead resistance shows that the bears are active at higher levels. If the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal advantage to bears. The SOL/USDT pair could slump to the strong support at $126.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bulls continue to buy on dips. The pair could then rise to $205. If this level is scaled, the pair may ascend to $267.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the uptrend line on March 20 and rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.62) on March 21, signaling buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4d10d390-50e1-4072-8bef-68e4fdb7831d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above $0.67, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and travel to the formidable resistance at $0.74. This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $0.95.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and maintains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that higher levels are attracting sellers. The pair may oscillate between $0.67 and the uptrend line. A slide below the uptrend line could tug the pair to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the $0.57 support in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) on March 20 but are struggling to sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.63).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ac4947d0-b29e-4d5e-9c33-b35e46084ebb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.67) has turned down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. Sellers will make another attempt to sink the price below the $0.57 support. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.53 and later to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the $0.57 support, it will suggest that the bulls are defending the level. The pair will then make another attempt to rise to the 20-day EMA. A break above $0.70 will indicate that the correction is over.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.15) on March 20, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/5ec11d16-b380-4049-ab5e-63b81c6614a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the DOGE/USDT pair will again attempt to rise above $0.16 and challenge the overhead resistance of $0.19. This level may prove to be a difficult hurdle to cross. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may remain range-bound between $0.12 and $0.19.\par \par \uc2 The next leg of the uptrend is likely to begin after buyers kick and maintain the price above $0.19. The pair may then rise to $0.23.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-bitcoin-price-going-to-crash-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is Bitcoin price going to crash again?}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers have managed to keep Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level of $50, suggesting they are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/8cd911a0-0014-48ed-820a-1a85f4c22b89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The marginally rising 20-day EMA ($51) and the RSI in the positive territory show that the bulls have the edge. The AVAX/USDT pair could gradually increase to the $62 to $65 resistance zone. Sellers are expected to protect this zone with vigor. If the price turns down from this zone, the pair may consolidate between $50 and $65 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The uptrend could resume after buyers overcome the obstacle at $65. The pair could thereafter climb to $75. The trend will favor the bears if the price plunges below $50.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $0.000029 suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/a95fe9f4-0ce9-4e99-9413-86d1976a4ae3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.000027) and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will tilt in favor of the bulls if the price rises above the resistance line. The SHIB/USDT pair could rise to $0.000035 and eventually to the strong resistance at $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.000023, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($0.000018).\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push Toncoin (TON) to $4.60, but the long wick on the March 22 candlestick shows stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/90ee1ccf-7b29-4ee7-9a47-35597284e197.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($3.54) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control. If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, the possibility of a break above $4.60 remains high. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair could start the next leg of the rally at $5.64.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, the pair is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvNGQzM2U5MGYtMDhmYi00NmRiLThhNDItNGUzYTdiYjc0YWJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240322ek3m000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price gains 12% post-FOMC while Bitcoin ignores $260M ETF outflows\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin shakes off ETF outflows to gain 12% following the latest FOMC meeting and Fed commentary.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) stayed higher on March 21 after a snap rebound gave bulls 12% BTC price gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/d34c1115-8a01-4d6e-95ad-9fd9ddc27550.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC price shoots higher on FOMC outlook\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCGBP/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed consolidation in a narrow range after a dramatic comeback the day prior.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reacted positively to commentary from the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  as it chose to hold interest rates at current levels.\par \par \uc2 After the meeting of the Federal Open Market Committee, or FOMC, Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  suggested that it would be \u8220\'20\'1Cappropriate\u8221\'20\'1D to enact rate cuts later in the year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe Committee does not expect it will be appropriate to reduce the target range until it has gained greater confidence that inflation is moving sustainably toward 2 percent,\u8221\'20\'1D an accompanying {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20240320a.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 press release}}}\uc2  reiterated.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD ultimately avoided another retest of $60,000 support, instead marching to $68,000 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dip-17-5-week-bitcoin-etf-net-outflows-near-500m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fully canceling out its previous losses}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ec0c264e-4254-4c54-a9e8-974dda1f78f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MatthewHyland_/status/1770601248540016928"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Matthew Hyland}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday\u8217\'20\'19s objective: hold above $65,300,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Jelle wrote in part of his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoJelleNL/status/1770683696414085331/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 latest analysis}}}\uc2  on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDo that- and a reclaim of the 2021 cycle highs is on the menu.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/97e80521-a027-4c7b-9543-a76cb2562475.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: Jelle/X\par \par \uc2 Shorters were predictably on the receiving end of pain during the move. Data from monitoring resource {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/LiquidationData"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinGlass}}}\uc2  put total short BTC liquidations for March 20 at $70 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/1b5d55ff-490a-46de-8bcc-3d4315bc44f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC liquidations (screenshot). Source: CoinGlass\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs see third day of outflows\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-post-third-outflow-day-261-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New outflows}}}\uc2  from the United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs), meanwhile, failed to dent sentiment further.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-3-20-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ada-doge-avax-shib-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 3/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , DOGE, AVAX, SHIB, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/?p=997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 latest figures}}}\uc2  from United Kingdom-based investment firm Farside estimated $261 million left the new ETF products on March 20, mostly fueled by $386 million in outflows from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC).\par \par \uc2 The other ETFs saw inflows, which totaled a mere fraction of daily revenue earlier in the month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/7dc3d05e-2b38-4f45-ba56-2d148ca30ed9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  flows (screenshot). Source: Farside\par \par \uc2 Responding, market observers looked to remain optimistic. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s lack of reaction to a third consecutive day of outflows, popular commentator Dyme suggested, showed a newfound resilience to ETF forces.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday\u8217\'20\'19s bounce with the negative inflow (assuming accurate and including post-market?) means that the market is not dependent on the ETFs to move up,\u8221\'20\'1D part of an X post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoParadyme/status/1770701371563557268"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 read}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Samson Mow\uc2 , CEO of \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  firm Jan3, argued that in the future, even GBTC would see net inflows as standard.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  outflows will eventually become inflows. Plan accordingly,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Excellion/status/1770680394825814330"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvMzllYjNhZDMtNmQ5Mi00MGIyLWI4NmQtNDBmMTY3M2RkYzc0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240321ek3l0005m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,752 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s uptrend may not resume in a hurry if bears continue to sell the top of each rally.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) nosedived below the $61,000 level on March 19, signaling an urgency by select traders to exit their positions. According to data from investment firm Farside, the recent fall has led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dip-17-5-week-bitcoin-etf-net-outflows-near-500m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 roughly $480 million in outflows}}}\uc2  from the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) in the past two days.\par \par \uc2 If the \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  investments fail to pick up, another round of selling cannot be ruled out, but a fall does not mean the bull market is over. Capriole Fund founder Charles Edwards said in a X post that it\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cnormal\u8221\'20\'1D for \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  to pick up one month \u8220\'20\'1Ceither side of the Bitcoin Halving.\u8221\'20\'1D However, he added that the 12-month period following the halving {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-price-narrative-strengthens-crypto-market-falls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 historically offers the best risk-reward}}}\uc2  tradeoff for Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/1f56233a-14a9-4c45-a23c-29a42215b2c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While retail traders speculate on the next move in Bitcoin, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , one of the largest public holders of Bitcoin, continues to buy more. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  Executive Chairman \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  said in a X post that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-sells-604m-notes-buy-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firm bought 9,245 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cusing proceeds from convertible notes & excess cash.\u8221\'20\'1D The latest purchase boosted the firm\u8217\'20\'19s stockpile to 214,246 Bitcoin, more than 1% of the 21 million Bitcoin that will ever exist.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins continue their correction, or is it time for the recovery to begin? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the support line of the ascending channel on March 18, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. That intensified selling and pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($65,271) on March 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/07198746-c66a-4fde-b963-3220f3fc1aa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to arrest the decline at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $61,736. A bounce off the current level is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong selling on rallies. The BTC/USDT pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($56,614), where the bulls are expected to buy aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rise above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair may rise to $69,000. This is the final hurdle before the pair challenges the all-time high at $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to maintain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($3,550) on March 18 attracted aggressive selling by the traders. That pulled the price to the 50-day SMA ($3,113) on March 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/af3e415e-d2e8-4445-83de-6289c60f245f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory, suggesting that bears have the upper hand. The recovery is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. That could keep the ETH/USDT pair stuck between both moving averages for some time.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 50-day SMA will suggest that the bulls are dumping their positions in a hurry. That could sink the pair to $2,717. Alternatively, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will signal that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) pullback reached the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $500 on March 19, just below the 20-day EMA ($511).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/92caa0fc-3b66-4c4f-b401-7c7f6fe0dea3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to stop the fall at the 20-day EMA, which is a positive sign. The BNB/USDT pair could rally to $590, where the bulls and the bears are likely to witness a tough battle.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $590, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That increases the risk of a slide to the breakout level of $460.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers kick the price above $590, it will suggest that the pullback may be over. The pair may then climb to $645.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the $205 resistance on March 18 but could not sustain the breakout. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/a05bf7eb-9109-4a48-a341-67363a992c6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair dipped to the 20-day EMA ($158) on March 20, a crucial support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive. The bulls will again try to drive the price above the overhead resistance at $205.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a shallow bounce will suggest a lack of aggressive buying at the current levels. If the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the selling could accelerate, and the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($126).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a large range between $0.46 and $0.74 for several months. Trading inside a range can be volatile and random.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/bc9c5954-fadb-452f-a052-ae5a446f6509.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is trying to take support at the uptrend line, but the relief rally is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below the uptrend line, the pair could slump to the support of the range at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up if the pair rises above $0.67. The pair may subsequently climb to the formidable resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the 20-day EMA ($0.68) on March 18 and plunged below the 50-day SMA ($0.62) on March 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/dc957621-333e-4860-a213-f559490c3901.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is attempting to take support at $0.57, but the recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a break below $0.57. The pair may then skid to $0.53.\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair may reach the 20-day EMA. This remains the critical overhead resistance to watch out for. A break above this level will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears sold Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempts on March 17 and pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($0.15) on March 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/aff32af5-72b9-417d-8b0c-b42d530a2e0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on March 19, and the DOGE/USDT pair plunged to the strong support at $0.12 on March 20. Buyers are expected to guard the 50-day SMA ($0.11), but they may find it difficult to propel the price above $0.16.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting that bears have a slight edge. The bulls will be back in command on a break above $0.16. That could clear the path for a rally to $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-low-can-the-bitcoin-price-go"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How low can the Bitcoin price go?}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) March 18 candlestick shows profit booking at higher levels. The selling picked up, and the price reached the breakout level of $50 on March 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/83060ce3-1802-4d24-85b8-625fd199af45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to flip the $50 level into support. If they succeed, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could again rise toward $65. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may consolidate between $50 and $65 for a while.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $50 suggests that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That may sink the pair to the next solid support at the 50-day SMA ($42). The bulls will have to catapult the price above $65 to signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the $0.000029 support on March 16, and the bears successfully defended the retest on March 17. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip $0.000029 into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/8bf15650-0c50-45f9-9795-d69212051884.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair fell to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000023 on March 20, which is the last bastion of support. If this level cracks, the pair may nosedive to the 50-day SMA ($0.000017). The deeper the fall, the greater the time it will take for the new up-move to begin.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to drive and sustain the price above the resistance line to indicate that the correction may be over. The pair could then travel to the overhead resistance of $0.000035 and eventually $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($3.39), but the bulls aggressively purchased the dip, as seen from the strong bounce on March 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/53d2f1df-4779-408d-b06e-8e69fad9876e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AtonUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears sold the rallies and tried to sink the price below the 20-day EMA on March 18 and 19, but the bulls held their ground. Buyers are trying to sustain the price above $4.15. If they manage to do that, the TON/USDT pair could rise to $4.60. A break and close above this level will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $5.64.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA to indicate that a local top may be in place.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvMDMwNzczMDEtOTBjNC00ODk3LThlZWYtNzAzY2U3NjhiOGI5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240320ek3k000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 why is bitcoin price down\par \b \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price fails to find footing at key support levels, leading some traders to fear a drop below $60,000.\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dropped 7.2% to as low as $62,400 on March 19 as a broader market correction reinforced BTC\u8217\'20\'19s resistance at the $68,000 level. BTC is now trading 15% below its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-new-73-6-k-all-time-high-etfs-eat#:~:text=Data%20from%20Cointelegraph%20Markets%20Pro,dip%20before%20abruptly%20heading%20higher."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $73,835 all-time high reached on March 14}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/8db1ba2c-9d0a-4cc0-bd00-03f046f888a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/YbWa0yVI/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s investigate the reasons behind Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price decline.\par \par \uc2 BTC drop below $63,000 leads to a marketwide sell-off\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price fell under $63,000 on March 19, causing a marketwide sell-off that saw the global crypto market capitalization drop 8% over the past 24 hours to rest at $2.4 trillion, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Other top 10 non-stablecoin cryptocurrencies are also flashing red, with Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) down 8.4% over the last 24 hours. Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), BNB Chain\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slumped more than 8% over the same time period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ebba474f-c24a-41b5-9d7b-a810ccf3e664.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 Memecoin\u8217\'20\'19s were also tumbling after recording an impressive performance on Monday, March 18. Just like DOGE, Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  is down 7.2%, and Pepe ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/pepe-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE}}}\uc2  ) has dropped 7.5% on the day. The new memecoins in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-memecoin-presales-hit-peak-degeneracy-over-one-hundred-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem}}}\uc2 , Dogwifhat (WIF) and Book of Meme (BOME), each recorded the largest losses of more than 14%.\par \par \uc2 Popular crypto investor and X user Lady of Crypto observed the slump in Solana-based memecoins, saying that late investors are being used as \u8220\'20\'1Cexit liquidity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/5a2e4fa1-5cbd-4684-94a6-3625c97b0b94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Commentary on Solana-based memecoins. Source: Lady of Crypto/X\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, large sell orders caused Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s flash crash to areas below $9,000 on BitMEX, while BTC prices on other crypto exchanges stayed above $$60,000.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-levels-next-btc-price-risks-sub-60k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin levels to watch next as BTC price risks sub-$60K retest}}}\par \par \uc2 In a post on X, the crypto exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/BitMEX/status/1770036207424344271?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D We are investigating potential misconduct by traders on our Bitcoin-USDT Spot market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Spot Bitcoin ETFs see negative inflows\par \par \uc2 More than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-gbtc-outflow-highest-daily-record-spot-bitcoin-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $640 million worth of BTC}}}\uc2  flowed out of Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  GBTC on March 18, according to data from BitMEX Research. This was the fund's largest day of outflows for IBIT since it began trading on Jan. 11. Fidelity\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin ETF FBTC saw inflows of just about $5.9 billion. This led to a net outflow from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-etfs-a-beginners-guide-to-exchange-traded-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  to $154 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/9f34aa97-7cc2-4cea-af9c-2f02445a0a46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  flows table. Source: BitMEX Research/X\par \par \uc2 Slowing \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  flows and the selling pressure faced by BTC has been attributed to profit-taking by short-term investors. According to data from on-chain data provider CryptoQuant, users who have held BTC for less than five months have been taking profits over the last week, contributing to the selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 The on-chain analytics firm posted the following chart on X showing short-term holder SOPR ratio for BTC and revealed that there was a \u8220\'20\'1Cbig movement related to profit realization by short-term holders who held #BTC for less than 5 months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COn March 13, this SOPR on-chain data showed a movement that was believed to be a profit-taking similar to the peak of the past bull markets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/aaca0f24-77f9-4152-8533-ea6d7049c091.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin: Short-term holders SOPR. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 According to CryptoQuant, such a movement \u8220\'20\'1Chappens once every few years,\u8221\'20\'1D but it is insufficient for use as a \u8220\'20\'1Csignal of the peak of a bull market,\u8221\'20\'1D considering the increased institutional and individual interest in Bitcoin through the spot ETFs.\par \par \uc2 BTC sell-off accompanied by $650 million in crypto liquidations\par \par \uc2 A sharp movement in the crypto futures market appears to have been a reason for the swiftness of today\u8217\'20\'19s price declines. The timing of the long liquidations coincided with the sharp drop in crypto prices\par \par \uc2 Total crypto liquidations came in at $651 million in the last 24 hours, with $515 million being long liquidations. Long leverage Bitcoin liquidations quickly spiked $8 million in a span of one hour on March 19 and now stand at $141 million for the last 24 hours, with the tally still going on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/095d4b9f-9898-411f-aec4-07d8e55a0a1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations heatmap. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Typically, long liquidations occur when there is a sudden drop in the price of the asset that is being traded. This is because traders who were \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the asset and had opened long positions on the same will now face losses since the market has moved against them.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTEvZDM2MDViNmItMGVmZi00NmY2LWE0NmYtYjE1ZWMzYjNlY2JlLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240319ek3j000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/18: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,585 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin plunges below the 20-day EMA, several altcoins may succumb to selling pressure by posting double-digit losses.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed profit-booking in the past few days, but the bears could not sink the price below $64,500. However, Bitcoin may come under renewed selling pressure if history repeats itself.\par \par \uc2 Crypto analyst Rekt Capital said in a X post that Bitcoin was about to enter the \u8220\'20\'1CDanger Zone\u8221\'20\'1D when it tends to correct. That period happens to be 14 to 28 days leading up to the halving, which is expected on April 20 in this cycle. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-entering-pre-halving-danger-zone-binance-crypto-ceos-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 In 2020, Bitcoin had fallen 20%}}}\uc2  during the said period, while in 2016, the correction was 40%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/f811654f-19a7-4826-ab14-c08647358f9c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts will closely monitor the inflows into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs). If inflows remain steady during a pullback in Bitcoin, then the likelihood of the uptrend continuing remains high. However, if inflows dry up considerably, then the next leg of the uptrend may get delayed.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index turned down from 5,180 last week but bounced off the support line of the ascending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4ea34a31-f37e-4ac5-9fa0-b30da6c6e012.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to propel the price above the overhead resistance of 5,189. If they succeed, the index may climb to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears. If the price turns down from the resistance line, the index may remain inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The uptrend could accelerate if buyers thrust the price above the channel. The index could then jump to 5,450. On the downside, a break below the 20-day exponential moving average (5,100) could start a decline toward the 50-day simple moving average (4,972).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) has pulled back to the moving averages, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2a294d71-385e-4dd0-a8a4-212f3a1e0916.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price stays above the moving averages, the index could rise to 105, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the index to 102. This level is likely to attract strong buying because if it cracks, the index may drop to 101.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day EMA ($65,830) on March 17, indicating that the bulls continue to buy on dips to strong support levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/7a0396be-afa6-43e6-8f7c-52ed97bb77ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair faces resistance at the breakdown level from the ascending channel pattern. If the price turns lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears have flipped the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line into resistance. That increases the risk of a fall to $59,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the bulls push the price back into the channel, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The bulls will again try to drive the pair to $73,777. A break above this level will open the doors for a potential rise to $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($3,619) on March 16, but the bears are struggling to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/8f44c5d8-d335-4c70-9a8c-e9447242c792.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA and trap the aggressive bears. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could attempt a rally toward the overhead resistance of $4,093. A break above this level will indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $3,400, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The pair could then slide to $3,200 and later to the 50-day SMA ($3,077).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for several days, with no signs of a slowdown. The bears tried to start a pullback on March 15, but the bulls aggressively purchased the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2e69c5d2-26f4-49ee-803f-81c92f75b7dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the overhead resistance of $205, which may prove to be a formidable hurdle to cross. However, if the bulls prevail, the SOL/USDT pair could start its journey toward the all-time high of $260.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the upside is that the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen deep into the overbought territory, suggesting that the rally may be extended in the short term. This points to a possible consolidation or correction in the near term. The support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($156). A break below this level will suggest a short-term trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back in a strong uptrend, but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $534.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/7e156673-5f8e-4255-9f4f-6a66e2a03e24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rises above $591, the BNB/USDT pair could retest the overhead resistance at $645.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below $534, it will suggest that bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then tumble to the 20-day EMA ($509). This is a crucial support to watch out for because a break below it may accelerate selling and sink the pair to $460.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.62) on March 16, indicating that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2699ea69-76ea-4f40-b47c-2d292ed06508.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted a recovery on March 17 but could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA. The price has turned lower from the 20-day EMA on March 18, suggesting that the bears are active at higher levels. The XRP/USDT pair could dive to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA and start a robust recovery. The pair could first climb to $0.67 and thereafter to the overhead resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-etf-less-likely-bitcoin-etf-recharge-capital-founder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether ETF is less likely than Bitcoin ETF was: Recharge Capital founder}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.62) on March 17, but the bulls are struggling to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.70) on March 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/0e8c9e5b-6aed-456e-bb10-5da90cf5c6d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the 20-day EMA, signaling that the bears are selling on rallies. That increases the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.57.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price rises and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The bulls will again try to propel the price to the overhead resistance of $0.81. A break and close above this level will suggest the start of the rally to $0.92.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply off the $50 level on March 17, signaling aggressive buying at lower levels,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/085fe966-1008-4f62-bd76-89c8016a113f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance of $61.50 on March 18, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend. If buyers sustain the breakout, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $87.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to maintain above $61.50, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. The pair may remain range-bound between $50 and $62 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the $0.15 support on March 16, suggesting that the bears are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ea5b23b9-724a-40a5-b429-14cd395c4282.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA ($0.15) on March 17, but could not build upon this strength. This shows that every recovery attempt is being sold. The bears are trying to sink the price below $0.14 on March 18. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.11).\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to push and maintain the price above $0.16. That may keep the pair inside the $0.15 to $0.19 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvNGIwM2E1NzctY2M5ZS00N2Y3LTlhMDYtYjZmNmUzNWI5MDdmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240318ek3i000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin drops 9% from its \uc2 ATH\uc2  as the market shows signs of being \u8216\'20\'18overheated\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 941 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ether and the broader crypto markets sold off on March 15.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is trading at $68,319 on March 15, down 4.5% over the last 24 hours as the crypto market displays \u8220\'20\'1Coverheated\u8221\'20\'1D conditions, according to a report by on-chain analytics firm IntoTheBlock.\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*19ubqbr*_ga*MTAxMzE3MDgyMS4xNzA2Nzk5MzMw*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxMDQ4OTEyNi4xNzEuMS4xNzEwNDg5MjY5LjAuMC4w"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ETHGBP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that the price of BTC turned down from its latest all-time high of $73,835 on March 14, dropping 9% to a new weekly low of $65,565 on Friday, March 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/26ced5e4-e3a9-46e8-b694-11edeea8759a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price has also triggered a sell-off across the market, with the global crypto market cap dropping 4.1% on the day to rest at $2.59 trillion, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 The second largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), has also dropped 5% in the last 24 hours to $3,708. Other top-cap tokens were also flashing red, with BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) losing 2.3%, 7.3%, 5.8%, and 8% of their value, respectively, over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) was the only token among the top 10 cryptocurrencies recording gains, rising 8% over the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Previously, Cointelegraph had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-bitcoin-price-metrics-point-to-overheated-conditions-and-a-potential-btc-correction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned of a possible correction in the BTC price}}}\uc2  due to \u8220\'20\'1Coverheated\u8221\'20\'1D conditions, as summarized by X user TOBTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/3c9c246e-aadf-4b62-958b-9da2546dc43f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC showing signs of a correction. Source: @_TOBTC\par \par \uc2 Data from market intelligence firm IntoTheBlock corroborates this information, highlighting growing leverage in the crypto market, which presents warning signs of a correction.\par \par \uc2 Funding rates reach highest levels since 2021\par \par \uc2 In this week\u8217\'20\'19s On-chain Insights newsletter, IntoTheBlock reveals that the \u8220\'20\'1Camount that buyers of Bitcoin perpetual swaps pay those going short is at its highest since October 2021.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In the chart below, IntoTheBlock analysts note BTC\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cfunding rates on \uc2 Binance\uc2  and Bybit reached levels of 0.06% and 0.09% yesterday, paid every 8 hours.\u8221\'20\'1D \u8220\'20\'1CThese fees translate to an annualized cost of 93% and 168% in order to go long Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D the report added.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe abnormally high funding rates are indicative of a market that skews very heavily on the long side.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/10c798ed-06b8-4881-952d-4519f2da6658.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin perpetual swaps funding rate. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 More data from Coinglass reveals that Bitcoin futures open interest (OI) on all exchanges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-futures-open-interest-hits-all-time-high-is-it-a-red-flag-for-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached its all-time high}}}\uc2  of $35.55 billion on March 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/05e30a7f-5003-4d39-a5ac-4e036d00168d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin futures open interest on exchanges. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 While high OI reflects new buying in the market fueled by increasing inflows into the spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/investing-in-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2 , when open interest grows too high, \u8220\'20\'1Coverly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  positioning in derivatives posts a warning sign for the market,\u8221\'20\'1D as IntoTheBlock analysts point out.\par \par \uc2 DeFi\uc2  ecosystem is accumulating too much risk\par \par \uc2 The high leverage conditions are extending beyond centralized exchanges, with loans on DeFi networks rising sharply.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that the total debt on all \uc2 DeFi\uc2  protocols has doubled in 2024. According to additional data from IntoTheBlock, the total debt increased from around $2 billion at the beginning of January to reach $4.15 billion on March 14.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs Bitcoin reaches new all-time highs, crypto investors have begun seeking leverage against their holdings.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/0efb61d6-d332-4e1b-85c2-795484ee3ced.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total debt on DeFi protocols. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 IntoTheBlock also reports an uptick in the \u8220\'20\'1Caggregate amount of debt issued through Aave v3 on Ethereum,\u8221\'20\'1D which \u8220\'20\'1Chas increased by a factor of 2.14 year-to-date.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe amount of wrapped Bitcoin (WBTC) supplied to Aave has increased by more than 10,000 BTC (~$700M) so far in 2024,\u8221\'20\'1D the report added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/62498898-08e9-4c61-b4e8-61f3a0116242.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 USDC lending rate. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 This means the rates in DeFi have increased with increasing \u8220\'20\'1Cdemand for leverage.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As such, the firm warns the DeFi ecosystem is accumulating too much risk, which might lead to a price correction in the near term.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe crypto market is likely to experience a significant correction as leveraged positions get paid back or are liquidated.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-shorts-normal-sub-66k-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin shorts stay absent amid 'very normal' sub-$66K BTC price dip}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin holders currently sitting in profits\par \par \uc2 BTC price breached multiple all-time highs in March in an uptrend largely influenced by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-scoop-10-x-more-btc-than-mined"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 success of the spot Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  in the United States.\par \par \uc2 Pointing to \u8220\'20\'1Coverheated\u8221\'20\'1D conditions, the report by IntoTheBlock notes that the \u8220\'20\'1Caverage 90-day return for the top 20 crypto-assets (excluding stablecoins) [...] is 103%.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This means that most traders have realized profits from their crypto investments. According to independent analyst and X user Ali, investors \u8220\'20\'1Care currently sitting on profits of 70% in their holdings.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In a March 14 post on X, analyst Ali shared the following chart from CryptoQuant showing that traders\u8217\'20\'19 unrealized profit margins reached 69% when the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-new-73-6-k-all-time-high-etfs-eat"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price hit higher highs above $73,000}}}\uc2 , which is historically associated with upcoming corrections as traders embark on booking profits.\par \par \uc2 Ali said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis level of unrealized $BTC profits is the highest in the past three years!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/d2431378-8f78-43f9-b7ce-9fdf844b2879.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin unrealized profit margins. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/ali_charts/status/1768287308405502054?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @ali_charts/X}}}\par \par \uc2 More data from IntoTheBlock shows that 86% of all Bitcoin holders are in profit at current prices, increasing the chances of a continued sell-off in the short term as profit-booking continues.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/a5414255-a9d4-4fba-9337-b3dd8488d51b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin IOMAP chart. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvZTY3MTY5ZWYtZWIwYi00M2M1LTk2MzAtMGU2Nzg4Yjk1N2NiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240315ek3f000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,632 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls continue to buy the dips below $69,000, indicating solid demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) sharp rally is showing signs of a short-term pullback, which could be one of the reasons for the mere {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-net-inflow-dropped-80"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $132 million in inflows}}}\uc2  into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds on March 14. A marked slowdown in inflows could start a corrective phase as Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s most recent leg of the rally has largely been driven by solid inflows into the Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 If a correction starts in Bitcoin, how deep could that be? During previous halving cycles, Bitcoin has seen a drop close to 40%, according to a X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post by the pseudonymous trader known as Bags. If history were to repeat, then {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-low-can-btc-price-go-bitcoin-analysis-45k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could plummet to about $45,500}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/c3834514-50ba-4f91-a765-f4fc0480cec1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Corrections are a part of every bull market. A positive sign during the current pullback is that it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-shorts-normal-sub-66k-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largely due to profit-booking on hedges}}}\uc2  and has not led to \u8220\'20\'1Cpanic shorting yet,\u8221\'20\'1D according to popular trader Skew.\par \par \uc2 Could the correction in Bitcoin and altcoins deepen, or will the price rebound from the current levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin witnessed profit booking at $73,777 on March 14, but the bulls purchased the dip, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/d7aaf4fa-6a64-4371-ba52-2c477e29035f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the failure to build upon the momentum on March 15 attracted strong selling by the short-term traders. The price has reached the support line of the ascending channel pattern, which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below the channel and the 20-day exponential moving average ($65,195), it will indicate the start of a corrective phase. The BTC/USDT pair could slide to $59,000 and thereafter to the 50-day simple moving average ($54,291).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price bounces off the support line, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the channel for some more time. The bulls will again try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) up move stalled near $4,000, tempting short-term traders to book profits. The long tail on the March 14 candlestick shows the bulls tried to flip the $3,600 level into support, but the fall on March 15 shows that the bears have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/d521ba7d-05c2-4237-a3e8-a8273ce8a008.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are likely to witness a tough battle near $3,600. If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to push the ETH/USDT pair to $4,000. The bears are expected to vigorously defend this level.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will try to yank the price below $3,600. If they do that, the selling could accelerate, and the ETH/USDT pair could slump to $3,200 and later to the 50-day SMA ($2,997). The greater the fall, the longer it will take for the pair to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back in a strong uptrend, indicating that the traders are booking profits after a sharp rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/18a0ebf0-f1f4-4265-924f-d5ee1795bf09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the March 15 candlestick shows that the bulls are not ready to give up and are buying at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $527.50.\par \par \uc2 A shallow pullback is a positive sign as it shows the bulls are not waiting for a deeper correction to enter. That increases the possibility of a break above $633. The pair may then climb to the $670 to $692 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $527, it will signal that every rally is being sold into. The BNB/USDT pair may then tumble to the 20-day EMA ($485).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few days, indicating solid demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/224688af-a316-4c3c-a067-6ab153c63627.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up move has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory, suggesting that the SOL/USDT pair may have run up too fast in a short time. That could start a correction, which could pull the pair to the 20-day EMA ($142).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. That may enhance the prospects of a rally to $205. This optimistic view will be negated on a break below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then slump to the breakout level at $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.74 on March 12, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4fd9481b-6f14-43d2-97e0-ca179dd5d634.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to flip $0.67 into support on March 13, but the bears had other plans. They continued their selling and pulled the price back below the $0.67 level on March 14.\par \par \uc2 The selling increased further on March 15, and the XRP/USDT pair broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.62). This suggests that the pair may consolidate inside a large range between $0.50 and $0.74 for some time. A break and close above $0.74 will signal the start of a new uptrend toward $1.02.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to kick Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.80 on March 14, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/e0d2ca50-263c-421c-96de-b0df4f1e8ff2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply, and the price dipped to the breakout level of $0.68 on March 15. If bears sink the price below $0.68, it will signal the start of a deeper correction toward the 50-day SMA ($0.61).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.68, it will suggest that the bulls continue to buy near strong support levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then swing between $0.68 and $0.80 for a while. A break above $0.80 could launch the pair to $0.92.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.18 resistance on March 14, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/627689ab-6329-4667-98f7-1a0f46db1557.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.15) on March 15. This suggests that the DOGE/USDT pair may remain stuck inside the range for a few more days. A break and close below $0.15 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The pair could then tumble toward $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a rally above $0.18 will suggest that the bulls have absorbed the supply. That will open the doors for a rally to $0.24 and then $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-overtakes-gold-investor-portfolio-jpmorgan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin overtakes gold in investor portfolio allocation \u8212\'20\'14 JPMorgan}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a large range day with a long wick and a long tail on March 14, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4d1181c4-86f8-4e0d-9d58-822da254a00a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to strengthen their position on March 15, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying near the breakout level of $50. This suggests that the bulls are trying to flip $50 into support. If buyers shove the price above $59, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could resume its uptrend to $87.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to maintain the price below the 20-day EMA. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($40).\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the $0.000029 support on March 15, indicating that the bears are trying to establish their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/9b78e5c4-aaca-4636-8873-b9723e7a1114.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.000027), but the recovery is expected to face selling at the downtrend line. If the price turns lower from the downtrend line, it will increase the likelihood of a slide to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.000023 and then $0.000019.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The SHIB/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance of $0.000039.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $11.88 on March 14, and the selling picked up momentum on March 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/00a699e0-6ba3-4e10-919a-7409ca4df038.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is waning. That increases the risk of a drop below the 20-day EMA ($9.93) and the breakout level of $9.59. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair may start a deeper pullback. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($8.23).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the bulls will again try to push the price to $11.88.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvODNmMGI0NzYtOTJiZC00ZGEyLWFhNWMtNzhlY2JlZThiMzBhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240315ek3f000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 US attorney seeks to reclaim $2.3M crypto from \u8216\'20\'18pig butchering\u8217\'20\'19 scheme\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Amaka Nwaokocha \par \uc2 487 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 U.S. Attorney\u8217\'20\'19s Office aims to retrieve $2.3M crypto from "pig butchering" scam affecting 37 victims, initiating legal action for restitution.\par \par \uc2 The United States Attorney\u8217\'20\'19s Office in Massachusetts has initiated legal proceedings to reclaim cryptocurrency linked to a scheme dubbed the \u8220\'20\'1Cpig butchering\u8221\'20\'1D operation, which victimized a Massachusetts resident and 36 others.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Attorney\u8217\'20\'19s Office {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.justice.gov/usao-ma/pr/united-states-files-forfeiture-action-recover-cryptocurrency-traceable-pig-butchering"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed}}}\uc2  a civil forfeiture action on March 13 aimed at returning $2.3 million in a variety of cryptocurrencies, including USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ), Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), to the victims of online scams and fraud.\par \par \uc2 A civil forfeiture action is a legal process through which law enforcement agencies seize assets, such as property or funds, that they suspect are involved in illegal activity. In these cases, the assets are considered the defendant in the legal proceedings rather than any person.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/3a2b1a51-b734-4055-a8d8-63609f4c50b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Screenshot of a post about the U.S. Attorney\u8217\'20\'19s office civil forfeiture action. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DMAnews1/status/1768000996230263111"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 U.S. Attorney Massachusetts on X}}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrencies, which include nearly 300,000 USDC, 1.5 million USDT, 102,000 Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ), 3,000 SOL and 14,000 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), were seized from two Binance accounts in January following an investigation last spring into a \u8220\'20\'1Cpig butchering\u8221\'20\'1D scam targeting a Massachusetts resident.\par \par \uc2 Pig butchering is a technique in which scammers establish trust online and get the victim to invest in a crypto scheme before the victim realizes they have been defrauded. Regulators in the U.S. have warned investors of the technique and have brought charges against some bad actors.\par \par \uc2 Authorities initiated an inquiry into the scheme in the spring of 2023 and disclosed that cryptocurrency had been confiscated from funds connected to 37 victims, including the individual from Massachusetts.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/doj-crypto-mining-patterson-joint-unified-school-district-electricity-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOJ charges duo for crypto mining in school district amid US energy scrutiny}}}\par \par \uc2 According to the statement, the scam victim was tricked into wiring $400,000 to the scammers, who transferred the funds to other wallets that investigators then connected to funds from the other 36 victims.\par \par \uc2 The United States Attorney\u8217\'20\'19s Office\u8217\'20\'19s action closely follows last week\u8217\'20\'19s news that the U.S. Attorney\u8217\'20\'19s Office in Chicago had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-helps-us-doj-fbi-recover-1-4-m-stolen-usdt-tokens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seized $1.4 million in USDT}}}\uc2  from an unhosted virtual cryptocurrency wallet tied to a suspected tech support scam targeting the elderly.\par \par \uc2 Tether cooperated willingly in the asset recovery process, destroying the funds linked to the accused fraudsters and reallocating them to alternative wallets under government supervision for restitution to the victims.\par \par \uc2 In January, the \uc2 Commodity Futures Trading Commission{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cryptocurrency-exchange-debiex-romance-scam-allegations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued warnings and charged \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22  platform Debiex with fraud}}}\uc2  for allegedly using pig butchering to take $2.3 million from investors. The Financial Crimes Enforcement Network also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fincen.gov/sites/default/files/shared/FinCEN_Alert_Pig_Butchering_FINAL_508c.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  investors when it issued a pig butchering alert late last year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvNWU3ZDcxMzMtNzliZS00ZjBkLTk4N2EtNzAzNDhlMDdmNzhhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240314ek3e0008p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
