\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) & USDC (USDC) Bulls Diversify into Raffle Coin (RAFF) Triumph Post Binance Coin (BNB) Surge: Ethereum (ETH) at $4K, Shiba Inu (SHIB) Up 124%\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 764 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 March 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ): Mimicking Previous \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Cycles Amidst Market Optimism}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC (USDC): Enhancing Liquidity on Solana Through Cross-Chain Transfer Protocol (CCTP)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH): Approaching Critical Resistance Amidst \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Momentum}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB): Records Highest Weekly Trading Volumes Since Historic Bull Market}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Raffle Coin (RAFF): Introducing Decentralized Raffles with Blockchain Technology}}}\par \par \uc2 In this moving preferences environment, between established assets and emerging projects, investors see on an everyday basis. Leading is Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and USDC (USDC), with increased activity coming from \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  retail traders who diversify into some of these promising ventures like Raffle Coin (RAFF). Meanwhile, altcoins such as Ethereum (ETH) and Shiba Inu (SHIB) make some waves with each of their respective market movements.\par \par \uc2 This growing atmosphere around Bitcoin (BTC) does add to the color of the market and shows it has more potential for bigger gains. Here are the recent trends in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), USDC (USDC), Ethereum (ETH), Shiba Inu (SHIB) and the innovations of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://raffcoin.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Raffle Coin (RAFF)}}}\uc2  in the thick of the crypto rush.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Mimicking Previous \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Cycles Amidst Market Optimism\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is literally surfing on the waves of positive sentiments that run through the cryptocurrency market immediately after Bitcoin (BTC) obliterated the all-time high price of $69,000. Analysts point out that, for now, much of the development on Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is following the same path that previous \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cycles have suggested over the years in pushing for a move toward the $10 level. With Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) already breaking out of a cup & handle formation from June 2022, investors anticipate further upward movement.\par \par \uc2 USDC (USDC): Enhancing Liquidity on Solana Through Cross-Chain Transfer Protocol (CCTP)\par \par \uc2 Circle's cross-chain transfer protocol aims to boost liquidity on Solana (SOL) by allowing for the seamless transfer of USDC (USDC) across all supported blockchain networks. Interconnecting seven networks, including Ethereum (ETH) and Polygon (MATIC), will enable users to transfer USDC (USDC) at any point in time while holding the liquidity on Solana. This correlates with the vision for \uc2 Solana\uc2  to become a center for stablecoin transactions with an active DeFi industry and an increase in the total value locked (TVL).\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH): Approaching Critical Resistance Amidst \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Momentum\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) had a pretty \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  weekend, where it gained 4.31% over the last day to get closer to the most important resistance at $4,000. Some of the causes of the ascent have been a large amount of large-whale accumulation, on-chain activity and profitability among investors.\par \par \uc2 Market analysts attributed the rally to huge Ethereum (ETH) accumulations by wallets affiliated with PulseChain and PulseX, showing a solid foundation for future prices to rally. Further, the anticipation of the Dencum upgrade and the news that speculation is rife regarding an Ethereum (ETH) ETF have added confidence on the part of the investors.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB): Records Highest Weekly Trading Volumes Since Historic Bull Market\par \par \uc2 Trading volumes on Shiba Inu (SHIB) peaked, signaling the beginning of a new market cycle. In weeks, Shiba Inu (SHIB) has broken beyond $0.000045, making huge returns. Nevertheless, some analysts indicate that, with the Shiba Inu (SHIB) upside in price movement, it has reached the overbought \uc2 RSI\uc2 . In spite of profit-taking and a few days of gyrating \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Shiba Inu (SHIB) continued to maintain strong support and thus rose to a retest of the recent highs.\par \par \uc2 Raffle Coin (RAFF): Introducing Decentralized Raffles with Blockchain Technology\par \par \uc2 Raffle Coin (RAFF) is a decentralized platform that allows participation in secure raffles based on the blockchain. Raffle Coin (RAFF) is characterized by revenue sharing, instant funding and many other models of innovation in the space of cryptocurrencies. At stage 1 presale, Raffle Coin (RAFF) is on offer at $0.016 a lucrative price that many potential investors would be eyeing due to the dynamic space within cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 As the market grows in value, so do the future projections of cryptocurrency, where new and not-so-new projects continue to pop up, presenting evidence for literally endless opportunities out there. These include projects like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), USDC (USDC), Ethereum (ETH), Shiba Inu (SHIB) and Raffle Coin (RAFF).\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Raffle Coin (RAFF) presale by visiting the website here.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240312ek3b00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/11: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,650 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally is pulling select altcoins higher, indicating that traders are willing to take on more risk in the markets.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bulls are in no mood to let go of their advantage. They pierced the $70,000 mark on March 11, signaling continued demand from the traders. Bitwise chief investment officer \uc2 Matt Hougan\uc2  said in a memo to investors that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/large-corporations-wirehouses-prepare-bitcoin-etf-bitwise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 professional investors were waiting to buy}}}\uc2  Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs).\par \par \uc2 However, that has not held back the demand for Bitcoin ETFs. According to data from Dune, the spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-breaks-new-high-above-71-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs have accumulated 4.06%}}}\uc2  of the current Bitcoin supply. If buying continues at the same rate, Bitcoin holdings of the ETFs are projected to reach 8.65% of the Bitcoin supply on a yearly basis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/5426461f-f86b-42d0-9012-2b31ecc04d5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  founder and chairman \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  said in a X post that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-buys-800m-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firm had purchased 12,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  at an average price of $68,477, using the proceeds from the recently completed $800 million convertible note offering. After the latest purchase, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin holdings stand at 205,000 Bitcoin acquired at an average price of $33,706 per Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Traders will have to closely watch the \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  inflows because a sustained slowdown will hurt sentiment and may cause a correction. What are the important support levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index has been rising inside an ascending channel pattern for several days. The price turned down from the resistance line of the channel on March 8, indicating that the bears are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/1d2709b7-07aa-4598-ac82-614fa0224b08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) cautions of a potential correction or consolidation in the near term. If bears sink the price below the channel, the selling could intensify, and the index may fall to the 50-day simple moving average (4,930).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on every minor dip. The bulls will have to kick the price above the channel to start a sharp rally toward 5,350.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S.dollar Index (DXY) slipped below the 20-day EMA (103) on March 1, and the bears successfully defended the level during subsequent attempts by the bulls to push the price above it. The failure to rise above the 20-day EMA accelerated selling on March 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/c531e89b-21a3-46e8-94a1-8a40fe9f49d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers pulled the price back below the 50-day SMA (103) and the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on March 7. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the oversold zone, indicating that bears have the edge. The index could skid to 102 and eventually to 101.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. A rise above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the selling pressure may be reducing. The index could then rise to 105.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin struggled to break above $70,000 during the weekend but blasted above the level on March 11, indicating solid demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4a01ca10-b28a-419b-89e2-71a8143be18b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone show that the buyers are in control. The BTC/USDT pair could reach $76,000 and subsequently $80,000. This zone is likely to offer strong resistance to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to call a top in an asset when it is backed by strong momentum. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA ($62,443). That will signal profit booking by the bulls and may start a deeper pullback.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) toward the breakout level of $3,600, but the long tail on the March 11 candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/b4334a22-6874-4ac5-8f38-a180a1145dcd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed the price above the psychological level of $4,000. That opens the doors for a rally to $4,372, which may act as a minor hurdle, but if this resistance is crossed, the ETH/USDT pair could jump to $4,868.\par \par \uc2 The sharp up move of the past few days has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  into deep overbought territory, signaling caution. Sellers will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA ($3,505) to break the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair may then start a corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for several days. The momentum picked up further after buyers pushed the price above $460.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4d5031af-d859-4a73-bfe4-d8f0190a0382.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair is likely to reach $560, which may act as a stiff resistance in the short term. If bulls do not give up much ground from $560, the uptrend may continue. The pair may then climb to $617.\par \par \uc2 The essential support on the downside is $460, and then the 20-day EMA ($433). Sellers will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA to indicate that the uptrend may have ended in the short term.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Repeated failure of the bears to sustain XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.60) may have attracted buyers on March 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/02835af3-1789-49c1-a1b9-306c3c84f621.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the immediate resistance of $0.67, indicating solid buying at lower levels. Buyers will try to maintain the momentum and challenge the formidable resistance at $0.74. If this level is scaled, it will indicate the start of a new uptrend. The XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.85 and subsequently to $0.95.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $0.74, it will suggest that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then slide to the strong support at $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to start a correction in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), but the bulls are in no mood to relent. The shallow pullback shows a lack of sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/a9a25e13-2b90-4785-ac69-f20dfd7fb78f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will take advantage of the situation and try to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above $153. If they do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could resume the uptrend. The pair may then climb to $184.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly yank the price below the breakout level of $126. That may accelerate selling, opening the doors for a drop to the 50-day SMA ($110).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped to the breakout level of $0.68 on March 11, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/89971dcc-ff6d-4529-8086-8a38b3540164.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.68) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will try to propel the price to the March 4 high of $0.80. If this level is surmounted, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could extend the rally to $0.90 and later to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $0.68. That will indicate a comeback by the bears. The pair then risks a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.59).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been fighting with the bears to keep Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level of $0.16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/73fb8d4f-deaf-429b-a10f-86eae301959e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.14) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone suggest that the bulls have an edge. If buyers propel and maintain the price above $0.000018, the DOGE/USDT pair could retest $0.21 and then rally to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price breaks below $0.16, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may slump to the 20-day EMA, which remains the critical level to watch out for. A break below this support may start a deeper correction to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside a large range between $0.000029 and $0.000039 after the sharp rally,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/09e83ead-c6e4-475a-84c7-525cfc27044e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The range-bound action is correcting the deeply overbought levels on the \uc2 RSI\uc2 , suggesting that the markets are cooling down. The SHIB/USDT pair may trade inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the range, the pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($0.000024), a crucial level to watch out for. A break below this level will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break above $0.000039 will signal that the bulls are back in command. The pair could then rise to $0.000046. If this level is crossed, the rally could reach $0.000065.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvMTY1NzFkYzMtZTAzYS00NDU4LTg2OTMtY2Q3Zjk0MjU0MTVkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240311ek3b000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
