\par\par \b \uc2 Is the Recent Dip in Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) and Polygon (MATIC) Forecasting a Major Altcoin Rally?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 713 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 March 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ride The Wave of Innovation with ScapesMania}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ): Market Position Post-Bitcoin Ripple}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Technical Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Action \u8211\'20\'13 What\u8217\'20\'19s next?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC): Breaking Barriers with Bitcoin's Rally}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Technical Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Action \u8211\'20\'13 What\u8217\'20\'19s Next?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Final Words}}}\par \par \uc2 On March 5, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  (BTC) shattered its previous all-time high, peaking at a staggering $69,324. But the triumph was short-lived as a flurry of substantial sell orders on Binance, including sell orders worth 300 BTC at $69,000 and 500 BTC at $70,000, swiftly plunged the price below the $60,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 This sudden downturn, which saw Bitcoin lose over $1,000 in a mere minute and nosedive to $59,700, sparked intense market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and catalyzed a staggering $1.1 billion in liquidations across various digital assets, predominantly impacting leveraged traders with $870 million in long positions. Notably, BTC showcased its resilience, managing to claw its way back to above $66,000, though still marking a 2% decline over 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Amidst this whirlwind, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoin market}}}\uc2  became a beacon for analysts and investors alike, surging by an impressive 50% to $1.2 trillion in just the last month. However, major players like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Polygon (MATIC) seemed to resist the trend, each experiencing over a 6% loss in value. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was surprisingly interpreted by market analysts as a positive sign for long-term investors.\par \par \uc2 In this nuanced market, attention is now shifting to emerging projects like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ADAMATIC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA). While its presale stage has concluded, the coming Token Generation Event and anticipated DEX listing have piqued the interest of crypto enthusiasts.\par \par \uc2 Ride The Wave of Innovation with ScapesMania\par \par \uc2 The ScapesMania public sale wrapped up, becoming the talk of the crypto community. The project managed to secure over $6,125,000 at an unprecedented rate and there\u8217\'20\'19s a strong probability that the token's value might increa