\par \uc2 ScapesMania is also notable for a great cliff vesting structure to prevent token dumping, making sure that supply and demand are well-matched for potential growth.\par \par \uc2 Make sure you don't pass up the opportunity to leverage all discounts and potentially beat the market with the TGE fast approaching. Be quick if you want to be the first one in line for all the post-listing opportunities, which might be quite lucrative.\par \par \uc2 LISTING ALERT \u8211\'20\'13 Keep Up With Latest News \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240307ek360000f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SHIB, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,645 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins remain in solid uptrends where buyers aggressively purchase the dips.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) made a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-sets-new-record-high-69k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new high above $69,200 on March 5}}}\uc2  but then succumbed to massive selling, which pulled the price below $60,000. This capitulation caused {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-crash-bitcoin-higher-67k-returns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.17 billion in cross-crypto liquidations}}}\uc2 , according to monitoring resource Coinglass.\par \par \uc2 However, the fall did not deter the investors from buying the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. Data from Farside Investors shows a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-etfs-record-inflow-bitcoin-bullrun"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net inflow of $648.9 million into Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2 , with \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT) ETF recording its highest inflow of $788 million. This shows a solid appetite for Bitcoin, and if it is maintained, corrections are likely to be shallow.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/bfcb54cb-6365-49ee-bc2e-f0a585fa0004.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 When the markets are rising sharply, the traders tend to throw caution out of the window and take on too much leverage. That is a quick way of making money in the near term, but it could damage the portfolio if traders are not adept at booking losses when they are small. Therefore, traders should remain cautious and follow trading rules when using leverage for trading.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend the uptrend, pulling the altcoins higher, or will the cryptocurrencies enter a consolidation phase? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been in a strong uptrend for several days. Traders view the dips as a buying opportunity during an up move, and that is what happened on March 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4753751c-fe9b-41d5-80af-788d6a5ab437.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls aggressively purchased the drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($58,131), indicating solid demand at lower levels. Buyers are trying to resume the uptrend by pushing the price above $69,000. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $76,000 and then $80,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. They will have to guard the $69,000 level and yank the price below the 20-day EMA if they want to start a correction in the near term. The pair could then witness long liquidation and nosedive to the 50-day simple moving average ($49,107).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the $3,600 resistance on March 4 and tried to extend the uptrend on March 5, but the bears had other plans.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/bf773c1d-5762-4284-bae6-5c50493dbce5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Strong selling pulled the price down to the 20-day EMA ($3,233), where buyers stepped in to arrest the decline. This suggests a positive sentiment where the bulls are defending the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued buying and are trying to maintain the price above $3,822. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair is likely to start a rally to $4,000 and thereafter to $4,150. If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to drag the price below the breakout level of $3,600. That could deepen the pullback to the 20-day EMA, which will be in danger of breaking down.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $427 on March 5 and plunged below the 20-day EMA ($387), but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/82f7623f-c63f-40e3-b4aa-64f0e26f1376.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip below the 20-day EMA, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. Buyers are trying to strengthen their position further by maintaining the price above $427 on March 6. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $460.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to sustain above $427, it will indicate that bears are defending the level with all their might. That will increase the likelihood of a fall to the 50-day SMA ($341).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from the immediate resistance of $143 on March 5 and fell to the 50-day SMA ($105).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/e3ee7ad9-27e5-4a40-9dc1-0d4cfeec6524.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bulls are aggressively protecting the 50-day SMA. The bulls have pushed the price above $126 and will again try to overcome the barrier at $143. If they can pull it off, the SOL/USDT pair could start the next leg of the up move to $158.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the bears are not willing to give up. The pair may then again slide to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.67 on March 5, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/c21188d0-8fc2-45b5-81c0-ad792a99ac0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($0.55), signaling that the bulls continue to buy on sharp dips. The XRP/USDT pair will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.67 and start the journey to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the bears will again try to defend the $0.67 level. If they do that, it will indicate a range-bound action in the near term. The pair may swing between the 50-day SMA and $0.67 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.80 on March 4 and plummeted to the 50-day SMA ($0.56) on March 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/fd2988bd-6284-4dcf-90db-dbc47c59632a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls aggressively bought the dip near the 50-day SMA and the price recovered to close above the breakout level of $0.68. This shows a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment among traders. If the price rises from the current level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance of $0.80.\par \par \uc2 This positive sentiment will be invalidated if the price turns down and closes below the 20-day EMA ($0.65). The pair could then slump to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.16 resistance on March 4 but could not sustain the breakout on March 5, indicating profit booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/71685282-819b-4734-a554-8965884162f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again struggling to maintain the price above $0.16, indicating continued selling on rallies. If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the DOGE/USDT pair may slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.12), where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers sustain the price above $0.16, the pair could gradually retest the local high at $0.20. A break and close above this level could signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-south-korea-72k-kimchi-premium-returns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $72K in South Korea as \u8216\'20\'18Kimchi premium\u8217\'20\'19 returns}}}\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong bull run for the past few days. The bulls propelled the price to $0.000045 on March 5 but could not sustain the higher levels, as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/dfdd9c0d-25db-4208-95df-60071d386ff9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AshibUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That started a wave of selling, which pulled the price down to $0.000025. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that the lower levels were purchased aggressively. This shows solid demand on dips.\par \par \uc2 After the large range day, the SHIB/USDT pair may remain range-bound for a few days. The boundaries of the range could be $0.000025 on the downside and $0.000045 on the upside. The deeply overbought level on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also warns of a possible correction or consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start an uptrend after completing the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern in Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) could have led short-term traders to dump their positions on March 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/9fd32f68-4617-46a3-8580-d1f549551d6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair plummeted below the 50-day SMA ($37.04), but a minor positive is that the bears could not sustain the lower levels. Solid buying started a recovery, and the bulls are trying to push the price back above the overhead resistance of $42. If this level is cleared, the bulls may again face stiff resistance near $44.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $44 will be the first indication that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then retest the psychological resistance at $50. The 50-day SMA and $35 are the two crucial supports to watch on the downside.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) soared to $10,76 on March 5, where profit booking set in, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/4ffa889b-3c0e-4bf0-bbfc-db204a3c8697.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($8.57), but the long tail on the candlestick shows that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The bulls have pushed the price above the breakout level of $9.59. If they can sustain the higher levels, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance of $10.80.\par \par \uc2 Generally, an increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is followed by a period of low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The pair may consolidate between the 20-day EMA and $10.80 for a while.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvZDAyZTgzZGUtMTJlMC00MTdmLWE5NmYtZTEzZTQ1YmU3M2VmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240306ek36000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
