\par\par \b \uc2 Limited Supply Raffle Coin (RAFF) Draws Bitcoin (BTC) Investors Pre-Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Whale Influx\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 634 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 March 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) NFTs Explode In Sales as Halving Event Nears}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Eyes $1 Valuation as Asset Takes \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Trajectory}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investors Scramble For Position as Raffle Coin (RAFF) Limited Supply Spurs Urgency}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto industry is afire with the recent pumps and price appreciations, particularly from Bitcoin (BTC) and altcoins like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). In light of this event, \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  has increased and more personalities are considering switching from fiat to the currency of the future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://raffcoin.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Raffle Coin (RAFF)}}}\uc2  has seen a heavy whale influx from new and old crypto investors, as many users cash in on the token's limited supply.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) NFTs Explode In Sales as Halving Event Nears\par \par \uc2 In recent observations, Bitcoin (BTC) Ordinance-based NFTs have exploded in trading volume, surpassing Ethereum (ETH). Launched in January 2023, Ordinance-based NFTs enabled Bitcoin (BTC) holders to insert IMG files into Satoshis (SATS), the smallest unit of a Bitcoin (BTC).\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin (BTC) Ordinance-based NFTs unprecedentedly topped the trade charts with significant activity from the Node Monkeys collection. What many may have considered a crypto bubble has continued to attract tremendous wealth into the crypto industry. Bitcoin (BTC) will herald a new era of profitability as its halving event draws nearer, giving budding project investors optimism.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Eyes $1 Valuation as Asset Takes \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trajectory\par \par \uc2 A wave of optimism has rippled through the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ecosystem as the project inches closer to $1. The Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) project has battled a lot of resistance in its quest for market dominance and longevity.\par \par \uc2 The community support for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has also increased as its SEC legal battle stretches out. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) maintained a weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rally with a price appreciation of 23.03%. The asset still maintains its #8 ranking according to CoinMarketCap's list of valuable crypto assets.\par \par \uc2 The recent decline in trading volume does not seem to affect Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) as the bulls continue to pump its price up. The future looks promising for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) as new assets like Raffle Coin (RAFF) are beginning to step up.\par \par \uc2 Investors Scramble For Position as Raffle Coin (RAFF) Limited Supply Spurs Urgency\par \par \uc2 Raffle Coin (RAFF) has delegated a chunk of its total supply into its presale phase but it seems to be running out fast as whale activity grows. The project is currently in its presale phase and tokens are selling out fast as investors position their investments for gains. Raffle Coin (RAFF) provides a unique platform for blockchain-based raffles.\par \par \uc2 Users will be able to select draws for prices from money to crypto to real-world gifts. Raffle Coin (RAFF) features a swap service for users to swap their winnings for crypto seamlessly and instantly at very low fees. A special loyalty bonus is awarded to Raffle Coin (RAFF) users who repeatedly engage with the platform. Raffle Coin (RAFF) also offers 40% of the fees generated on the platform are split between presale investors proportionally to their holdings.\par \par \uc2 True decentralization and user protection are upheld, as no KYC verification is required to engage the Raffle Coin (RAFF) platform. At press time, Raffle Coin (RAFF) is staging 1 of 6 stages of its presale phase and tokens are selling out fast at $0.016, prompting heavy investor traffic. Decentralization, scalability and profitability have been hallmarks of projects like Bitcoin (BTC) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). Now, Raffle Coin (RAFF) aims to follow suit.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Raffle Coin (RAFF) presale by visiting the websitehere.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240305ek350018j\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 845 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market soars toward new highs as Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s continued breakout confirms that a bull market has started.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is up today, with the global market capitalization rising by 5.8% to rest at $2.51 trillion on March 4. This movement has increased Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) market dominance to 53.3% as the pioneer cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization hit a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has rallied 8.5% over the last 24 hours to hit an intra-day high of $68,602 on March 4. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) and other top-cap altcoins also rallied higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/668ff60d-e361-47b6-8ebd-59c80c707a22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market performance, 24 hours. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the major factors driving the crypto market today.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization hits a new all-time high\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization has hit a new record high against the dollar. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s rally to $68,602 on March 4 saw its total market value hit a high of $1.33 trillion. The last time BTC\u8217\'20\'19s market cap reached $1.3 trillion was over two years ago, on Nov. 10, 2021, when it reached $68,990.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/c9a28f81-124f-4f1c-912b-0394ac1634f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD market capitalization. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A cryptocurrency\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization is the total value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  calculated by multiplying the number of coins in circulation by the current spot price of the coin. There were 19,644,550 BTC in supply at the time of writing, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cup only\u8221\'20\'1D price rally has been attributed to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-halving-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upcoming supply halving}}}\uc2 , which is expected to reduce miner rewards by 50%. Data from CoinMarketCap shows there are 6,870 blocks until the halving, which is roughly 48 days away.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-bitcoin-etf-approvals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approval of spot exchange-traded funds}}}\uc2  (ETFs) in the United States has also contributed to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price growth as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-holds-above-62k-as-etfs-see-record-volumes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFs continue to suck in more capital}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Crypto inflows record second largest weekly inflow of $1.8 billion\par \par \uc2 BTC price continued to march toward its all-time high amid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-volumes-7-billion-break-records"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increasing inflows}}}\uc2  into the spot Bitcoin ETFs.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly Report, crypto products recorded their second-largest weekly inflow, totaling $1.84 billion. This was accompanied by a record $30 billion in trading volume, representing \u8220\'20\'1C50% of global Bitcoin daily trading volumes on trusted exchanges,\u8221\'20\'1D said the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-172-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-6e6506a5c274"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/985706df-2f32-4aa8-a904-be3e0474d43c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto products\u8217\'20\'19s flows. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  analyst James Butterfill said,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTotal assets under management (AuM), after recent price rises, are now very close to the all-time high at US$82.6bn, just shy of the US$86bn peak set early November.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to the report, Bitcoin accounted for \u8220\'20\'1C94% of the inflows\u8221\'20\'1D at $1.72 billion, as U.S.-based funds continued to dominate with net inflows totaling $1.88 billion.\par \par \uc2 This comes against a backdrop of increasing outflows from the incumbent Grayscale Bitcoin ETF, GBTC. After declining significantly toward the end of February, GBTC outflows have reversed their trend in March, bringing the tally for its outflows to $1.46 billion over the last week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/3b462174-5a3e-48f9-b7d0-4a1f741cb5d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly Bitcoin purchases. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/HODL15Capital/status/1763971309954818197?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @HODL15Capital/X}}}\par \par \uc2 While institutional capital continues to flow into Bitcoin, \u8220\'20\'1Crecent price moves saw short investors double down with a further US$22m inflows,\u8221\'20\'1D according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-new-ath-euros-price-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin passes new all-time high in euros as price reaches $65K}}}\par \par \uc2 $346 million crypto liquidations accompany the crypto market rally\par \par \uc2 The crypto market rally has fueled a wave of short position liquidations across the market, totaling over $348.2 million in 24 hours. There have been $26.9 million short leverage position liquidations in the last hour alone.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin short liquidations lead the way with $107.71 million in total shorts wiped out, Ether liquidations total $41.92 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/dc6f0b52-6b0d-4a9b-81ee-dd304912fd92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total Crypto market liquidations. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Despite the short-seller losing streak, \u8220\'20\'1C$3 billion in open interest has been added to the #crypto market over the last 24 hours,\u8221\'20\'1D according to crypto trading analysis platform Coinalyze.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/529b8b58-e3e8-4e1b-a055-6d0774a7f372.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency futures market data. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/coinalyzetool/status/1764651059509690571?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @coinalyzetool/X}}}\par \par \uc2 Open interest (OI) measures the total value of all outstanding crypto futures contracts across exchanges. A high OI value indicates increased market activity and \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Moreover, there is optimism surrounding the spot ETFs and the upcoming Bitcoin halving, leading to increased positive sentiment. Data from Alternative.me, a platform tracking \u8220\'20\'1Cemotions and sentiments\u8221\'20\'1D surrounding cryptocurrencies, shows that the Crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-this-week-fear-26k-key-5-things"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fear and Greed Index}}}\uc2  is now in the \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/78881e24-928c-43f8-b379-ddec5b8b3e20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear and Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Increased institutional capital flows into crypto funds, a potential spot \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  and the upcoming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-halving-how-does-the-halving-cycle-work-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving}}}\uc2  are strong indications the bull market is here.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvYTYzMzIzMGQtM2Y5YS00NzQ5LThiYWItMDE3YzRiOTQzNWEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240305ek3400032\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/4: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,719 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 March 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally is bring BTC price much closer to its all-time high. Will altcoins continue to follow BTC's lead?\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) and the Nasdaq Composite made a new all-time high last week, indicating a risk-on sentiment among investors. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) also does not want to be left behind and is currently less than $2,000 shy of the lifetime high of $68,990 made in November 2021.\par \par \uc2 The momentum favors the buyers to catapult Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price to a new all-time high over the next few days. But the central question is, will a rise above $68,990 start the next leg of the uptrend or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-bearish-64k-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will the price turn down sharply}}}\uc2  and start a corrective phase, trapping the aggressive bulls?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/f39e14f1-bff3-4802-9ee8-bb008ce466d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 During a FOMO phase, strong returns are made within a short span of time. Even though the risk is high, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analyst-planb-predicts-10-months-face-melting-fomo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the period rewards traders}}}\uc2  who can ride this phase. However, traders need to be careful because vertical rallies are followed by sharp declines. Hence, traders should keep their stops ready lest their gains may evaporate quickly.\par \par \uc2 Could the bulls propel Bitcoin to a new all-time high and maintain it, or is it time to book profits? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index closed at a new all-time high on March 1, indicating that the bulls firmly remain in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/266cfea8-4325-411d-8443-c3707e18ba7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The index has been trading inside the ascending channel pattern for many days, indicating that the bears may pose a strong challenge at the resistance line. If the price turns down from the resistance line, the bears will try to pull the index to the support line. A break below the channel will start a short-term corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls catapult the price above the channel, it will signal a pickup in momentum. That could start a vertical rally, which may take the index to 5,300 and then to 5,500. Traders need to be cautious as the negative divergence on the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) suggests the bulls may be losing steam.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the U.S.dollar Index (DXY) above the 20-day exponential moving average (104) on Feb. 29, but could not build upon it. Sellers pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on March 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/6e32c9cc-3c58-4974-b81e-e5cfa874d492.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a possible range-bound action in the near term. If the price remains below the 20-day EMA, the index could slip to the 50-day simple moving average (103). Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above 104.30, it will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The index could then rise to 105. A break above this resistance could open the doors for a potential rise to 106.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been in a solid uptrend for the past several days. The bears tried to halt the up move near $64,000, but that resulted in the formation of a pennant.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2e4812fb-0514-4fc4-97c2-c7884b88b686.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls reasserted their supremacy after kicking the price above the pennant on March 4. This signals the start of the next leg of the uptrend, which could reach the all-time high at $68,990 and thereafter continue to $76,000, which is the pattern target of the breakout from the pennant.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly drag the price below $60,000. If they do that, several stops of short-term traders may hit, and the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($56,250).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) witnessed profit booking near $3,600 on Feb. 29, but the bears failed to start a pullback, indicating that every minor dip is being purchased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/e3ab1b0f-2a33-476f-a4fb-b7a61a31dd3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again trying to overcome the stiff barrier at $3,600. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend and surge toward $4,000 and later to $4,150.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages suggest that bulls are in control, but the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has been in the overbought zone for several days, increasing the possibility of a short-term pullback. The immediate support on the downside is at $3,300, and then the 20-day EMA ($3,129).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been in an uptrend for several days. The bears tried to stall the rally at $427, but the bulls bought the dip on Feb. 29, indicating a positive sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/f5ebac64-a75a-431b-aa4c-37a728d904ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers shove the price above $427, the BNB/USDT pair could reach $460. The bulls may find it challenging to break above this resistance with ease.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($383). If this support cracks, it will indicate that the short-term traders may be rushing to the exit. That could start a corrective phase toward the 50-day SMA ($338).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply on March 3, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/0cc3f77e-f059-4975-9f6b-8eba32843a16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.58) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone suggest the bulls are in command. There is a minor resistance at $0.67, but it is likely to be crossed. The rally could then reach the powerful resistance of $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $0.67, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the level. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA and keep the XRP/USDT pair inside the $0.46 to $0.67 range for a while.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) closed above the $126 resistance on March 1, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the momentum. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/9c2154e5-25cf-40c7-8e56-76dda7320d39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $126, it will increase the likelihood of the resumption of the uptrend. If buyers pierce the $138 level, the SOL/USDT pair is likely to rise to $143 and then to $158.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the $126 level gives way, the pair may slump to the 20-day EMA ($116). The bears will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA to suggest that the breakout above $126 was a fake move. The pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($104).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-nears-67k-new-gbtc-bitcoin-outflows-550m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price nears $67K as new GBTC Bitcoin outflows pass $550M}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) started the next leg of the uptrend after buyers overcame the $0.68 barrier on March 1. The bears tried to tug the price back below the breakout level on March 3, but the bulls held their ground. This shows strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/6103e771-0c92-45f9-a29c-fdc000de528b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up move is likely to reach $0.90, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the momentum remains strong and buyers bulldoze their way through $0.90, the rally could extend to $1.25. The bulls may find it difficult to cross this level.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen above 80, indicating that the rally is at a risk of stalling. The 20-day EMA ($0.64) remains the essential support to watch out for on the downside. A break and close below this level will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.56).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong bull run for the past few days. The bears tried to pull the price lower on March 3, but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/ed67f4e7-7b6a-4598-b097-50dda327d0e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls resumed the uptrend by pushing the DOGE/USDT pair above the $0.16 overhead resistance on March 4. This opens the door for a possible rise to $0.18 and thereafter to $0.22. The sharp rally has sent the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory, suggesting a consolidation or correction may be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at $0.16 and then at $0.12. If this support is taken out, it will suggest that the uptrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern after the price closed above the neckline at $42 on March 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-03/2b3420d6-6415-4661-b236-1db40b9aa046.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $42 level. If buyers flip the level into support and propel the price above $45, the pair could rally toward the psychological resistance at $50. If this level is overcome, the pair may reach the pattern target of $57.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($40) to weaken the bulls. The pair could then slump to the 50-day SMA ($37), suggesting that the breakout on March 1 may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDMvOTkwNjA1YmItN2FjNS00MTljLTlmYzYtNTY2ZmQzZGZkMWRmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240305ek3400006\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
