\par\par \b \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Presale Hooks Solana (SOL) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Investors Amid 250% Surge\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 March 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana Set to Make Huge Comeback, Analysts Remain Optimistic}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Draws interest as value climbs over 10%}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Set To Dominate the DeFi World As Interest Increases Amidst Presale}}}\par \par \uc2 New market entrant, Pullix (PLX) has generated significant buzz through its presale, attracting considerable interest from investors in both communities of Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). With an impressive surge of 250% in value, the ongoing PLX presale has captivated the crypto community at large, indicating a strong belief in the project's potential. As enthusiasts of Solana and Cardano rush to secure their share in Pullix, an exciting chapter unfolds in the innovation of decentralized finance (DeFi).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  Set to Make Huge Comeback, Analysts Remain Optimistic\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), one of the most well-known DeFi cryptocurrencies, is making waves on the cryptocurrency market again with indications of a huge comeback. Entering February at a low price range of around $94 and $93, the native \uc2 SOL\uc2  token has since rebounded, currently trading at a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weekly price range}}}\uc2  of around $106- $131.\par \par \uc2 The fact that the asset has recovered from this level suggests a robust support area that may help spark a resumption of the prior \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. With momentum building up as investment in the token increases, analysts are optimistic and have predicted another sharp increase in value\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Draws interest as value climbs over 10%\par \par \uc2 Native to the Cardano network, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token has gained incredible momentum following the latest run of the bull market. In the last week, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has witnessed a dramatic surge in value, gaining up to 14.76%.\par \par \uc2 While trading at a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weekly price range}}}\uc2  of $0.59 - $0.69, crypto analysts have projected a continuous upward trajectory for the native \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token. With its commitment to research and heightened adoption, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run comes with little or no surprise. Currently one of the top cryptocurrencies in the market, analysts have touted it to reach the $1 benchmark in little time.\par \par \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Set To Dominate the DeFi World As Interest Increases Amidst Presale\par \par \uc2 With the cryptocurrency market constantly evolving, the decentralized finance (DeFi) world has witnessed the introduction of promising crypto projects with exceptional attributes. One such project is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://presale.pullix.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pullix (PLX)}}}\uc2 , an upcoming hybrid crypto exchange that offers transparency and security for traders in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 While centralized exchanges (CEX) are widely recognized for their reliability, decentralized exchanges (DEX) have gained popularity due to their secure, transparent, and fast transactions. However, Pullix aims to bridge the gap between these two worlds by combining their strengths and addressing their respective challenges.\par \par \uc2 One notable challenge in decentralized finance (DeFi) is liquidity, and Pullix (PLX) aims to tackle this issue. By providing a unified platform for seamless trading of global assets and easy access to liquidity, Pullix aims to enhance customer experience and convenience.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the native PLX token introduces several features to improve user engagement and incentivize value growth. These include a profit share model (PSM) that facilitates daily income sharing among active users. The platform also offers among other benefits, reduced fees, staking rewards, and governance rights.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the token's fixed supply and token-burning mechanism promote scarcity and further contribute to its value appreciation. But that\u8217\'20\'19s not all, there is also a specific launchpad component that runs on the native PLX token which enables users to invest early in innovative DeFi and NFT projects. This initiative helps the projects scale faster while also improving token holders' ability to use the platform easily.\par \par \uc2 Currently in the last stage, Pullix has raised over a total of $8.8 million with 130 million PLX tokens sold thus far, amassing nearly 20,000 active users. Meanwhile, the native PLX tokens, which are currently priced at $0.14, are expected to surge 100x at launch because of its innovative appeal. With the presale drawing to a close, now will be the best time to buy in and invest in this revolutionary DeFi project.\par \par \uc2 For more information regarding Pullix\u8217\'20\'19s presale see links below:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pullix.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Visit Pullix}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com