sed by experts as the one with a promising future. Chances are by the end of 2024, Pushd (PUSHD) will outperform major crypto coins and be the next Bitcoin (BTC). Pushd\u8217\'20\'19s (PUSHD) promising potential makes it a great choice for many holders.\par \par \uc2 Pushd (PUSHD) is at stage 5 of the presale and is predicted to earn 30x more. The truth is that Pushd (PUSHD) will make the most gains and be unstoppable in its bid to be the future of cryptocurrencies. Buying more Pushd (PUSHD) is akin to staking up great wealth for oneself for the future.\par \par \uc2 Pushd (PUSHD) will be the first fully decentralized web3 marketplace that will pave the way for seamless online buying and selling. The Pushd (PUSHD) presale is still selling at an affordable price.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Pushd (PUSHD) presale by visiting the websitehere.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240302ek32000ji\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrency\par \b \uc2 Crypto recaptures $2T market cap as Bitcoin climbs above $57,000\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 999 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether are leading a powerful crypto market rally, with the total value of all digital assets eclipsing $2 trillion.\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization has reclaimed the $2 trillion level for the first time since April 2022 as positive market sentiment and consistent inflows into spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) pushed BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/766d62cf-55d0-4a9f-9824-bab8866d2298.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market capitalization. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A rally in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price brought the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency by market cap to a multiyear high of $57,513, while Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) enjoyed a 7% pump to rest at $3,270 at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Other top altcoins were also flashing green, with \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) gaining 9% over the last 24 hours to hit $110. XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s AVAX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) were up 5.3%, 7%, and 6.5%, respectively, over the same period. The 10th-placed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) enjoyed double-digit gains, climbing 15% to $0.09779.\par \par \uc2 Their combined efforts have culminated in a 7.7% rally to the global crypto market value, lifting it to a 22-month high of $2.14 trillion, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 To put it into perspective, the crypto market is now some $33 billion bigger than \uc2 Amazon\uc2  and $42 billion larger than \uc2 Google\uc2  parent \uc2 Alphabet\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has more than doubled within a few months\par \par \uc2 Crypto enthusiasts on the X were quick to celebrate the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-cap-returns-to-2t-for-the-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 return to the $2 trillion mark}}}\uc2 , with some, such as The Kobeissi Letter, asking whether \u8220\'20\'1Cnew all-time highs are ahead for Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BREAKING: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  is now trading above $56,000 for the first time since November 2021.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is up over 250% from its 2022 low, adding $700 billion in value in less than 2 years.\par \par \uc2 The total market cap of the crypto market is now at $2.25 trillion, more than double its recent\u8230\'20\'26 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/bwWrASbbRY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/bwWrASbbRY}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Kobeissi Letter (@KobeissiLetter) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KobeissiLetter/status/1762325463563636750?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 27, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Commentators at The Kobeissi Letter noted that total crypto market capitalization has \u8220\'20\'1Cmore than doubled from its recent low\u8221\'20\'1D of $978 billion reached on Sept. 11, 2023.\par \par \uc2 Independent technical analyst Crypto Damus spotted the crypto market cap at $2.06 trillion, saying it was approaching a critical resistance level.\par \par \uc2 He shared the following chart with his over 36,000 followers on X, wondering what new price discoveries would be with just 50% to go until the $3 trillion all-time high is regained.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/d7c2db22-26e9-47c2-98d9-e68f3340e9b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market cap. Source: Crypto Damus/X\par \par \uc2 Popular analyst Voice of Crypto posted a chart showing all the major cryptocurrencies trading in the green, terming the move above $2 trillion in total market cap as \u8220\'20\'1Cextraordinary.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Daily Market Report\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/crypto?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #crypto}}}\uc2  market's performance has been extraordinary today, considering how the total market cap is above the $2 trillion mark, and now sits at around $2.13 trillion. Take a look at all this green. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/VOC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #VOC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/VoiceOfCrypto?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #VoiceOfCrypto}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/ETH?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/cryptocurrency?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #cryptocurrency}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yfXJh2LJlP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yfXJh2LJlP}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Voice of Crypto (@VoiceofCrypto2) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/VoiceofCrypto2/status/1762431664511213942?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 27, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Positive market sentiments back crypto prices\par \par \uc2 The rallying market is basking in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sentiment, given that the Fear & Greed Index is showing \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D at 79 on Feb. 27, according to data from Alternative.\par \par \uc2 The index was last in the \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D zone in November 2021, when the price of the pioneer cryptocurrency reached an all-time high of $69,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/769fb130-6855-4864-85c8-ba46e042dca7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative\par \par \uc2 During strong rallies, the index will likely remain in the \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D zone for an extended period. However, Alternative warns, \u8220\'20\'1CWhen investors are getting too greedy, that means the market is due for a correction.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-accumulate-300-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Spot Bitcoin ETFs accumulate 300K BTC as net inflow rises to $6B}}}\par \par \uc2 Market analyst Bitcoin Suisse posted the chart below showing the market sentiment also in the \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D territory at 79, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/BitcoinSuisseAG/status/1762493708551794999?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCrypto and equities are continuing to trade at multi-year or all-time highs, and both are currently in extreme greed levels when it comes to market sentiment.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/53733055-4205-47ae-8488-99b9846a3a2e.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market rally driven by inflows into crypto products\par \par \uc2 The rally in the wider crypto market is led by Bitcoin, which has seen strong demand on the back of spot ETFs. At the same time, outflows from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) hit the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-lowest-ever-outflow-bitcoin-etfs-2-week-inflow-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lowest volume ever of $22 million}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Data from Farside Investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/?p=997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  slowing outflows from GBTC for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-bitcoin-etf-records-lowest-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third consecutive day}}}\uc2  on Feb. 26. The converted \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  ended the trading week on Feb. 23 with a net outflow of $44.2 million, which further halved on Feb. 26.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 reporting, BTC investment products {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-171-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-0bc3a2259018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recorded 99% of all crypto fund inflows}}}\uc2  last week. Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-2-year-high-as-institutional-investors-inflow-nears-600m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 welcomed $569.5 million in fund inflows}}}\uc2 , bringing the total global assets under management to $67.5 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/afefc93c-478f-4c75-afa1-6d59930c7043.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Capital flows for crypto investment products. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Bitcoin ETFs continue to see inflows totaling $5.5 billion since their market debut on Jan. 11, according to data from Yahoo Finance. Overall, the crypto products have taken in a net of $5.8 billion since they began trading, according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-etfs-a-beginners-guide-to-exchange-traded-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  are also rallying alongside BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price, with \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s iShares \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  at position \u8220\'20\'1C#5 of the 3,400 ETFs & well ahead o