eading a powerful crypto market rally, with the total value of all digital assets eclipsing $2 trillion.\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization has reclaimed the $2 trillion level for the first time since April 2022, as positive market sentiment and consistent inflows into spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) pushed BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/766d62cf-55d0-4a9f-9824-bab8866d2298.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market capitalization. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A rally in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price brought the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization to a multi-year high of $57,513, while Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) enjoyed a 7% pump to rest at $3,270 at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Other top altcoins were also flashing green, with Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) gaining 9% over the last 24 hours to hit $110. XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) were up 5.3%, 7%, and 6.5%, respectively, over the same period. The tenth-placed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) enjoyed double-digit gains, climbing 15% to $0.09779.\par \par \uc2 Their combined efforts have culminated in a 7.7% rally to the global crypto market value, lifting it to a 22-month high of $2.14 trillion, according to data from CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 To put it into perspective, the crypto market is now some $33 billion bigger than \uc2 Amazon\uc2  and $42 billion larger than \uc2 Google\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s parent \uc2 Alphabet\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has more than doubled within a few months\par \par \uc2 Crypto enthusiasts on the X social media platform were quick to celebrate the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-cap-returns-to-2t-for-the-first-time-since-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 return to the $2 trillion mark}}}\uc2 , with some, such as The Kobeissi Letter, asking whether \u8220\'20\'1Cnew all-time highs are ahead for Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 BREAKING: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  is now trading above $56,000 for the first time since November 2021.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is up over 250% from its 2022 low, adding $700 billion in value in less than 2 years.\par \par \uc2 The total market cap of the crypto market is now at $2.25 trillion, more than double its recent\u8230\'20\'26 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/bwWrASbbRY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/bwWrASbbRY}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Kobeissi Letter (@KobeissiLetter) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KobeissiLetter/status/1762325463563636750?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 27, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Commentators at The Kobeissi Letter noted that total crypto market capitalization has \u8220\'20\'1Cmore than doubled from its recent low\u8221\'20\'1D of $978 billion reached on Sept. 11, 2023.\par \par \uc2 Independent technical analyst Crypto Damus spotted the crypto market cap at $2.06 trillion, saying it was approaching a critical resistance level.\par \par \uc2 He shared the