itcoin, which has seen strong demand on the back of spot ETFs. At the same time, outflows from the Grayscale \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  (GBTC) hit the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-lowest-ever-outflow-bitcoin-etfs-2-week-inflow-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lowest volume ever of $22 million}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/?p=997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Data}}}\uc2  from Farside Investor shows slowing outflows from GBTC for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-bitcoin-etf-records-lowest-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third consecutive day}}}\uc2  on Feb. 26. The converted \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  ended the trading week on Feb. 23 with a net outflow of $44.2 million, which further halved on Feb. 26.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 reporting, BTC investment products {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-171-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-0bc3a2259018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recorded 99% of all crypto inflows}}}\uc2  last week. Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-2-year-high-as-institutional-investors-inflow-nears-600m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 welcomed $569.5 million inflows}}}\uc2 , bringing the total global assets under management to $67.5 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/afefc93c-478f-4c75-afa1-6d59930c7043.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Capital flows for crypto investment products. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Bitcoin ETFs continue to see inflows totaling $5.5 billion since their market debut on Jan. 11, according to data from Yahoo Finance. Overall, the crypto products have taken in a net of $5.8 billion since they began trading, according to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-etfs-a-beginners-guide-to-exchange-traded-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  are also rallying alongside BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price with \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  IBIT at position \u8220\'20\'1C5 of the 3,400 ETFs & well ahead of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Vanguard_Group"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @Vanguard_Group}}}\uc2  \u8216\'20\'18s top ETF, VOO\u8221\'20\'1D according to ETF analyst HODL15Capital.\par \par \uc2 Massive trading volume for Bitcoin ETFs today {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24IBIT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $IBIT}}}\uc2  is #5 of the 3,400 ETFs & well ahead of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Vanguard_Group?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @Vanguard_Group}}}\uc2  \u8216\'20\'18s top ETF, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24VOO&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $VOO}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FBTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FBTC}}}\uc2  is also very strong. Let\u8217\'20\'19s go $BTC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/dbgJoleki9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/dbgJoleki9}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 HODL15Capital (@HODL15Capital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HODL15Capital/status/1762504995818123481?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 27, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvMWIwMzExN2UtZTBiMy00ZjYyLWJlNmMtZTZhOTJhNzZiMWJmLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240227ek2r000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,609 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls target new yearly highs as retail and institutional investors show their excitement over the upcoming halving and the steady inflow to spot BTC ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) soared to a two-year high near $55,000 on Feb. 26, buoyed by the continued demand from the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows that institutional {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-2-year-high-as-institutional-investors-inflow-nears-600m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors pumped $570 million into Bitcoin investment products}}}\uc2  over the past seven days.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs have seen inflows of more than $5 billion in net assets under management (AUM) since their launch, while gold ETFs have seen outflows of $3.6 billion during the same period, according to a Feb. 26 research report shared on X by senior \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  and associate analyst Andre Yapp. The analysts expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-adds-3k-btc-etfs-surpass-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs AUM to overtake that of gold ETFs}}}\uc2  in the next two years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/16bc98db-7306-4b33-861b-3bfee31fa544.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength is likely to uplift the mood in the crypto space, benefitting select altcoins. However, as Bitcoin approaches its all-time high, the risk of a pullback can not be ruled out as the bears try to make one last-ditch attempt to stop the rally.\par \par \uc2 Could the Bitcoin bulls maintain the breakout, or will higher levels tempt short-term traders to book profits? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index skyrocketed above the 5,048 resistance on Feb. 22, indicating the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/d8d4cb0a-522e-472f-8c0c-67ede23cbb53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) suggests that the uptrend may be losing steam.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (4,983) remains the crucial level to watch out for on the downside. If this support cracks, the index may descend to the 50-day simple moving average (4,857).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the index continues higher, it will invalidate the negative divergence. The failure of a negative pattern generally results in a sharp up move. The index could then rise to 5,200.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears yanked the U.S.Dollar Index (DXY) below the 20-day EMA (103) on Feb. 22, but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying at the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/cba27980-cf12-4fd4-94d6-34ffb72e3d97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price rises and sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to drive the index above 105. If they do that, the rally could reach 107.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price continues lower from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are trying to make a comeback. The index could then slide to the 50-day SMA (103). A bounce off this level could keep the index inside a range for some time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the $53,000 overhead resistance on Feb. 26 after consolidating in a tight range for the past several days. This suggests that bulls remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/c7db865f-f351-4376-9951-b19500a0a607.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $53,000, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and soar toward $60,000 where the bears are again expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 There are several layers of support on the downside. If $50,500 breaks down, the bulls will try to arrest the decline at the 20-day EMA ($50,075) and then the breakout level of $48,970. The bears will have to tug the price below $48,970 to indicate the start of a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($45,734).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) surged above the $3,036 resistance on Feb. 25, signaling the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/78783532-235d-43da-a121-dbc1df2342e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate that bulls are in command, but the overbought zone on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests a minor correction or consolidation is possible. If buyers do not allow the price to sustain below $3,000, the likelihood of a rally to $3,300 and then to $3,540 increases.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA ($2,823). That will indicate aggressive profit booking by the traders. The ETH/USDT pair could then plunge to $2,717 and subsequently to the 50-day SMA ($2,546).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is trying to resume its uptrend, but the overbought level on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the bears may pose a strong challenge near the overhead resistance at $400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/62cb95b2-d840-4ebc-9b40-cdcd7540c359.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level but rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($356), it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That will enhance the prospects of a break above $400. The BNB/USDT pair may then rally to $460.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are aggressively booking profits. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($323). A break below this level will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the moving averages for the past few days, indicating uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b4015800-af44-454a-a16e-c6288c51dbfb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  just below the midpoint suggest a possible range-bound action in the near term. The boundaries of the range could be $0.48 on the downside and $0.58 on the upside.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive and maintain the price above $0.58 to indicate that the correction may be over. The XRP/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.67 and eventually to $0.74. The support on the downside is at $0.48 and then $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is finding support at the 50-day SMA ($100), indicating that the bulls are trying to arrest the decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/79c7e1be-6728-42ec-b06c-df1afb252181.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. Buyers will have to push and maintain the price above the downtrend line to start a rally to the overhead resistance zone between $119 and $127. If this zone is surmounted, the up move may reach $135.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then plummet to $80.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-tokens-rally-amid-nvidia-breakout-earnings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AI tokens rally amid Nvidia\u8217\'20\'19s breakout earnings}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to protect the 20-day EMA ($0.58) in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), indicating that the sentiment remains positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4b4f4b42-bf0d-42aa-b98b-9093b82c5543.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory show that the bulls have a slight edge. Buyers will try to kick the price to the overhead resistance zone between $0.64 and $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down sharply and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls have given up. That could start a correction to the 50-day SMA ($0.54).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($36.12) on Feb. 24, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/67b07a31-a307-4638-94f9-aad5e2c09da4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the buyers or the sellers. If the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could descend to $32.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($37.84) could open the doors for a possible rally to the overhead resistance of $42. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal the completion of an inverse H&S pattern.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the breakout level from the triangle but failed to propel Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the $0.09 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/14b0ba17-de1c-462f-bfab-8b0b047b6e07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears will try to gain the upper hand by pulling the price below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the uptrend line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair could start a downward move to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to drive and maintain the price above $0.09 to indicate the start of a new up move. The pair could surge to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone, where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvMTcyYTc2ZjItN2Q2ZS00ZGI4LTkyNWMtNmM2OGU0ZGMyNzE0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240226ek2q000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
