s reached 60K+. Also, the growing interest from crypto whales with deposits of $20,000+ might expedite ScapesMania's transition from niche to mainstream.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania's smart contract has received approval from prominent security-ranking firms, ensuring peace of mind for holders. Additionally, the PancakeSwap listing is on the horizon, with CEX listings still in the works.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania is also notable for a great cliff vesting structure to prevent token dumping, making sure that supply and demand are well-matched for potential growth.\par \par \uc2 Make sure you don't pass up the opportunity to leverage all discounts and potentially beat the market with the TGE fast approaching. Be quick if you want to be the first one in line for all the post-listing opportunities, which might be quite lucrative.\par \par \uc2 TGE ALERT \u8211\'20\'13 Keep Up With Latest News \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240224ek2o000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, LINK, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,605 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hesitation to sustain above $52,000 has triggered profit booking in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance near $52,000, increasing the possibility of a short-term correction. The sideways action resulted in net outflows of roughly $36 million from the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) on Feb. 21, according to various sources, including BitMEX Research. However, the bleeding stalled on Feb. 22, and the day saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-inflows-recover-btc-price-50k-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net inflows of about $251 million}}}\uc2  into the ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts believe the markets are ready for a pullback before the halving in April. Popular trader and analyst Rekt Capital said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-pre-halving-pullback-45k-btc-price-support-retest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current bull phase is similar}}}\uc2  to the 2016 and 2020 bull runs. If history repeats itself, \u8220\'20\'1Ca pre-halving retrace\u8221\'20\'1D followed by \u8220\'20\'1Ca post halving reaccumulation period\u8221\'20\'1D is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b6816824-4101-44a5-9c74-48558eefa7e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hesitation to continue its rally has triggered profit-booking in select altcoins. A corrective phase is positive for the long-term health of the markets as it shakes out the weak hands and allows the stronger hands to add at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 What are the crucial support levels to watch out for on the downside in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Nov. 21 candlestick shows that the bulls purchased the dip to the immediate support of $50,625, but could not overcome the barrier at $52,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/83d046d6-3c51-45b6-82b2-228de92a7157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to yank the price below $50,625. If they can pull it off, the BTC/USDT pair could plunge to the strong support at $48,970. A bounce off this level will indicate that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips. The uptrend will resume on a break above $52,000. The pair could then reach $60,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to pull the price below $48,970. If they do that, the selling could intensify, and the pair may nosedive to the 50-day SMA ($45,247).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tried to jump above the psychological resistance of $3,000 on Feb. 22, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4f560fe6-5b56-406e-a82d-831cb5b2af05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to start a correction toward the breakout level of $2,717. This is an important level to watch out for because the 20-day EMA ($2,734) is nearby. If the price rebounds off $2,717 with force, it will indicate that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The bulls will then again attempt to clear the hurdle at $3,000. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair may reach $3,300.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to tug and maintain the price below $2,717 to weaken the bulls. The pair may then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($2,497). Such a deeper fall could delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) resumed its uptrend after breaking above the $367 resistance on Feb. 21. The next target objective on the upside is $400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/1dd194b3-66a0-4fe1-9a41-3ae70e386582.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to stall the up move at $400, but if the bulls do not give up much ground from the level, it will indicate that every minor dip is being bought. That will improve the prospects of a rally to $460.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $368, and then the 20-day EMA ($344). If the supports fail to hold, the correction could reach the 50-day SMA ($318). This is an essential level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will signal a trend change.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($99) on Feb. 21, but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($105).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/633dc34a-0e6a-479e-9da8-77a2d64d6013.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the SOL/USDT pair could descend to $93 and then to $80. This level is likely to attract aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to overcome the barrier at the downtrend line to signal that the correction may be over. The pair could then attempt a rally to $126, where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Feb. 22, indicating indecision between the buyers and sellers. This uncertainty resolved to the downside on Feb. 23, suggesting that the bears had overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/3fedcc4b-129f-43fe-92d9-1a49a27394e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the pair to the strong support zone between $0.48 and $0.46. A strong rebound of this zone suggests that the XRP/USDT pair remains range-bound between $0.46 and $0.57 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to shove the price above $0.57 to indicate the start of a new up move. The pair will then attempt a rally to $0.67 and subsequently to the formidable resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is trying to take support at the 20-day EMA ($0.57), but the bears have not given up and are maintaining the selling pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/787a53f4-e0b0-483e-8494-4eeef5a3c2ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the bears prevail, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could skid to the 50-day SMA ($0.53). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if this level gives way, the pair could plummet to the vital support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then try to overcome the resistance zone between $0.64 and $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) tried to start a recovery on Feb. 22, but the bears fiercely defended the 20-day EMA ($37.90). This suggests that recoveries are being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4c9992bb-b871-4c0e-a756-fbac0453318c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears continued selling on Feb. 23 and pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($35.96). The AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the solid support at $32. A solid bounce off this level will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $32 and $42 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will then attempt to drive the price above $42 and complete the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the symmetrical triangle, while the bears are trying to pull the price back below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/7b318355-bb88-44d0-9a86-8e40a501fc1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to propel the DOGE/USDT pair above the $0.09 resistance. If they succeed, the pair could start an uptrend toward the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($0.08). The pair could then slump to the uptrend line. A break below this level will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back in an uptrend. The bears are trying to drag the price to the breakout level of $17.32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/6eca4d0a-96ec-4b23-8dda-e3e8577bd91d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $17.32 with strength and rises above the 20-day EMA ($18.67), it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will increase the likelihood of a retest of $20.85.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($16.65). If this level cracks, it will indicate that the bulls have given up. That may start a deeper correction to $15 and later to $12.85.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to keep Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) inside the ascending channel pattern, while the bears are striving to pull the price below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/9e4eb87d-0d54-48c7-a996-a663abdff120.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($7.41) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA ($7.17), the DOT/USDT pair could slide to $6.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a strong bounce off the current level will indicate that the bulls are fiercely defending the support line. That may keep the price inside the channel for some more time. The bulls will try to push the pair to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvNGFiODIyYTUtYTE5ZC00ZTAzLThlMTEtMjc4Zjg1M2Y0ZTAzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240223ek2n000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
