light\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, LINK, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,576 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The risk of a short-term correction in Bitcoin has increased, but will dip buyers step in to save the day?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading sideways for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. Will the sellers overpower the buyers and start a short-term correction, or could the buyers come out on top? That is the question on every crypto investor\u8217\'20\'19s mind.\par \par \uc2 Dwindling hopes of an early rate cut by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  have resulted in profit booking in the S&P 500 Index. That could signal a risk-off sentiment in the near term, increasing the risk of a pullback in Bitcoin and select altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4ba4004f-e85a-41f4-9c5b-244c21c87d30.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the dip may not change the long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. Investors are likely to view every dip as a buying opportunity because of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s upcoming halving in April, which has historically been a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  event.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels that may arrest the decline in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is struggling to sustain above $52,000, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/c34bddec-9e15-48dd-944d-991a8ea395b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $50,000, short-term traders may give up and book profits. That could pull the BTC/USDT pair to the 20-day exponential moving average ($48,842).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with force, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying at lower levels. That will increase the likelihood of a rally above $52,000. The pair could then jump to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal the start of a pullback to the 50-day simple moving average ($44,924).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the psychological resistance of $3,000 on Feb. 21, indicating profit booking by short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/ebac04ad-71c1-4dd8-9a9d-525ae30ca7cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a strong uptrend, the corrections generally last between one to three days. The crucial support on the downside is $2,717. If the price snaps back from $2,717 with force, it will indicate that every minor dip is being purchased aggressively. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $3,000. The ETH/USDT pair may then rally to $3,300.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($2,680), it will signal the start of a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($2,467).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up after a brief correction and surged above the $367 resistance on Feb. 21, signaling the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/af0d7ae3-a2b7-4dae-ace2-6ea8c107b2c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate that the bulls are in command. If buyers maintain the price above $368, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and surge toward $400.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the 20-day EMA ($336) and the next is the 50-day SMA ($315). The bears will have to yank the price below the 50-day SMA to indicate a trend change.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebound fizzled out at $115, and the price turned down on Feb. 19, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/f63fba08-4c9b-475b-a3e8-4c08c745689e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on Feb. 21, signaling that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The 50-day SMA may act as a support, but it may not hold for long. If the support cracks, the SOL/USDT pair could start a decline to $93, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rise above the downtrend line. The pair could then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) closed above the downtrend line on Feb. 19, but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at $0.57. This suggests that every minor relief rally is being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/05c4443e-ed5c-4611-887c-7585bcd3a9e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price below the moving averages. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could dip toward the strong support at $0.46. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.46, the pair could climb to $0.57 and stay inside this range for some time. A break and close above $0.57 will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.64 on Feb. 20, suggesting profit booking by the short-term traders. The price could reach the 20-day EMA ($0.57).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/cae4dc0a-2dec-4005-ab5b-d0c41e034d51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to defend the 20-day EMA aggressively if they want to keep the up move intact. If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $0.64 and eventually to $0.68. A break and close above this resistance will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price tumbles below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair may then consolidate inside a large range between $0.46 and $0.64 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the 50-day SMA ($36) on Feb. 20, but the bears sold the recovery to the 20-day EMA ($38.22) in Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/6fb127fb-5ca7-4d1c-86bf-612eaf4e8b6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term. If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may drop to $32, which is likely to act as a strong support. A solid rebound off the support could keep the pair between $32 and $42 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive and sustain the pair above $42 to complete the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern and gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/michael-saylor-buy-bitcoin-forever-no-reason-sell"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Michael Saylor to forever buy Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 \u8216\'20\'18No reason to sell the winner\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Feb. 18, but the bulls could not overcome the barrier at $0.09. This suggests a negative sentiment where the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/3b1d3a6d-c4a2-41b9-beb9-61123f29baff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the moving averages, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the uptrend line. This is an essential level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the pair may start a descent to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the short term if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $0.09. That opens the doors for a possible rally to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($18.81) on Feb. 20, but the bulls could not build upon the recovery. The price turned down and slipped below the 20-day EMA on Feb. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/91b97590-682c-4d89-b7e3-4eef49be836b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next stop on the downside is the breakout level of $17.32. This level may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the price rebounds off $17.32 with strength, the LINK/USDT pair may rise to the 20-day EMA and later to the overhead resistance at $20.85.\par \par \uc2 The zone between $17.32 and the 50-day SMA ($16.51) is likely to act as a formidable support on the downside. A break below this zone will suggest a potential trend change in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $8.21, indicating that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/ea335074-9e24-402b-af7d-f58c8f990df8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair has reached the 50-day SMA ($7.18), which is an important level to watch out for. If this level gives way, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair could then drop to the neckline and subsequently to $6.\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. If the price rebounds off the neckline, the pair could reach $8.21 and stay range-bound between these two levels for some time. The bulls will be back in the game on a close above $8.21.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvMGIwM2NkNmMtYzAxMS00MmQxLTg0ZDctYThiOWUwOTdhODkwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240221ek2l0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
