\par\par \b \uc2 Is DeeStream (DST) Twitch' biggest competitor, Chainlink (LINK) & Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) investors buying into presale likely to hit 25x in 2024?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 591 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 February 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chainlink (LINK): Consolidation and Potential Breakout}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ): Alonzo Hard Fork Impact and Price Prediction}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeeStream (DST)'s Potential 25x: Is It Twitch's Biggest Competitor?}}}\par \par \uc2 In the world of digital currencies, DeeStream (DST) is bravely taking on traditional video platforms, aiming to compete with Twitch by emphasizing free speech and decentralization. Investors who support Chainlink (LINK) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) holders are interested in DeeStream's different approach and are joining its presale, which starts at $0.035 per token. Some believe there's a chance of earning 25 times their investment before the end of 2024.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) seems to be stabilizing, suggesting it might break through the $25 resistance level, while Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is dealing with changes after a successful Alonzo hard fork. As the cryptocurrency world changes, DeeStream's disruptive influence and promising investment potential attract attention from those looking for innovation and significant profits in this fast-moving market.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK): Consolidation and Potential Breakout\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK) is currently consolidating above a newly established support level, indicating strength among buyers as they defend recent gains. The trading range between $19 and $23 is likely to persist in the coming weeks, with the Directional Movement Index (DMI) suggesting a potential \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover. Despite decreasing volumes, the bulls appear poised to break above the $25 resistance after further basing. While a temporary delay in the breakout is possible, the likelihood of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pullback remains low at this stage.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Alonzo Hard Fork Impact and Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 The announcement of the Alonzo hard fork in 2021 caused Cardano's value to rise noticeably. The flawless execution of the recent Vasil hard fork is a key factor in its successful outcome. It is currently trading for $0.6134, which is 1% more than it was twenty-four hours ago. Its price trajectory over the future week will be influenced by a number of factors, including the general state of the market and events that are taking place. Experts in the cryptocurrency space predict that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will move between $0.57 and $0.63 on a weekly average, with an average value of roughly $0.60.\par \par \uc2 DeeStream (DST)'s Potential 25x: Is It Twitch's Biggest Competitor?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://deestream.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeeStream}}}\uc2  (DST) has become an important player in the world of watching videos, challenging traditional platforms by focusing on free speech and decentralization. It stands out because it allows users to stream directly to each other and is governed in a decentralized way. This makes it different from other platforms. As the world values open conversations and freedom of speech, DeeStream (DST) gives users a place where they can express themselves without worrying about censorship. The ongoing presale is a good chance for those who want to invest in this new and changing project at only $0.035.\par \par \uc2 DeeStream (DST) offers a unique investment opportunity with its different ways of letting people watch videos. Experts are already predicting a 25x return once the platform is launched. People who have invested early will benefit from participating in the DeeStream (DST) presalebecause of the project's potential for growth.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the DeeStream presale by visiting the website here\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240221ek2l000mc\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,604 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders are struggling to flip $52,000 to support, but the predictable price action could lead traders to focus on altcoins.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) snapped its five-week winning streak and fell by 0.42% last week as the United States Consumer Price Index and Producer Price Index for January rose more than economists expected. Hot inflation reports increased concerns that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  may not cut rates till late in the year. Previously, market observers were anticipating a rate cut as early as March.\par \par \uc2 The adverse macroeconomic data has not affected Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price, which rallied about 8% to finish the week at $52,137, its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/open-interest-echoes-69k-btc-price-5-things-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 highest weekly close since November 2021}}}\uc2 . Although $52,000 has been acting as a resistance for the past few days, the Bitcoin bulls have not hurried to book profits. This suggests that the market participants remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/93dc72b4-a48a-4168-a811-14db58aa1b7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another positive in favor of Bitcoin is that outflows from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) have been slowing down. After bleeding $5.64 billion in January, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-gbtc-outflows-reach-7b-when-will-it-stop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows from GBTC have slowed}}}\uc2  to $1.37 billion in February.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin start the next leg of the uptrend, pulling select altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average (4,940) on Feb. 13, indicating an uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/95927194-4c24-47f2-9253-116646cb2043.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are not ready to give up easily and are trying to protect the overhead resistance of 5,048. The negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) cautions of a possible correction or consolidation in the short term.\par \par \uc2 A break below the 20-day EMA will indicate the start of a deeper correction. The index could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average (4,813) and subsequently to 4,650.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the index continues higher and breaks above 5,048, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The index could then surge toward 5,200.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar Index (DXY) attempted to start an up move on Feb. 13, but the rally met with strong selling pressure near 105.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/796175aa-2a58-4bc2-84d6-2c051fb570dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and reached the 20-day EMA (104), an important support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to propel the index to 106 and then to 107.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the index breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that higher levels continue to attract selling by the bears. The index may then slump to the 50-day SMA (103), which is likely to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is consolidating in an uptrend. The bears are trying to stall the rally at $52,000, but the bulls have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/f4f81076-aec4-4929-9380-b6dde8da78d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near a crucial resistance generally resolves to the upside. If the bulls shove and maintain the price above $52,000, it will indicate the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The BTC/USDT pair could then surge toward $60,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to quickly drag the price below the 20-day EMA ($48,260). If they do that, the stops of several short-term traders may get hit. The pair could then plunge to the 50-day SMA ($44,647).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off $2,717 on Feb. 17, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8c53df6c-a45a-428b-86d8-3b12e54c6693.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair rose above the immediate resistance of $2,868 on Feb. 18, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. Buyers will try to maintain the momentum and kick the price to the psychologically critical level of $3,000.\par \par \uc2 The rally of the past few days has sent the RSI above 78, indicating the possibility of a minor correction or consolidation in the near term. Sellers will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($2,615) to signal a short-term top.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back in an uptrend, suggesting profit booking by short-term traders. Generally, pullbacks do not last for more than three days in a strong uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/d2ada471-c4a5-4969-822e-cb8e2fbc1715.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($330) and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate that the bulls are in control. If the price turns up and breaks above $367, it will suggest that the uptrend has resumed. The BNB/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $400.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and slips below $348, the pair may reach the 20-day EMA. This level may again attract buyers, but if the bears prevail, the pair may plummet to the 50-day SMA ($314).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the downtrend line and the 20-day EMA ($0.54) for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/eda34d4e-2052-428c-9db6-748434c8378e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into the positive zone, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. If the price breaks and closes above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The XRP/USDT pair will then attempt a rally to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the downtrend line and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears remain in command. The pair may then descend to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) pulled back to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on Feb. 17, and the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/cd5b9a98-72aa-4734-bedb-878d18de189a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($106) and the RSI above 62 indicate that the bulls have the upper hand. There is a minor resistance at $119, but that is likely to be crossed. The SOL/USDT pair could then retest the stiff overhead resistance of $127. If this level is scaled, the pair may reach the pattern target of $135.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and dives below the 20-day EMA. That may result in long liquidations, pulling the pair to the 50-day SMA ($100).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-leveraged-token-services-shutdown"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance to shut down multiple leveraged token services}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) long tail on the Feb. 17 candlestick shows that the bulls continue to view dips to the 20-day EMA ($0.56) as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/d8752e50-a63f-451c-bee7-7594f6e45b1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain the price above the immediate resistance of $0.62. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the vital resistance at $0.68. This level may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears, but if the buyers prevail, the next stop is expected to be $0.90.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from $0.68, it will indicate that the bears are vigorously defending the level. A break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $42 level on Feb. 15, but a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($38.40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/a6b5346e-3302-46d7-810d-8d433c88346a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to clear the obstacle at $42, and if they succeed, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair will complete an inverse H&S pattern. The pair may then skyrocket to $50, which may prove to be a difficult barrier to cross.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the 20-day EMA is the key support to watch out for. If this level cracks, the pair may slip to the 50-day SMA ($36.16). Such a move will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $32 and $42 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back into the symmetrical triangle pattern on Feb. 17, but the bulls protected the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/ebe3d5eb-33cf-46df-805c-912f063f69c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.08) has started to turn up gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is above 63, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback. If the bulls clear the hurdle at $0.09, the DOGE/USDT pair could climb to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and collapses below the moving averages. Such a move indicates that the bears are selling on every minor relief rally. The selling could intensify on a break below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvNGVjM2Y2MGItNzBkZC00YjczLWEzZjAtMWU2OGMwNGQyNjMwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240219ek2j000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/16: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, LINK, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,628 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally could hit a barrier near $52,000, but the pullback is likely to be shallow.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rallied above $52,000 this week and the rally shows no signs of tiring out. That indicates continued demand for Bitcoin at every higher level. A report by on-chain data analytics firm CryptoQuant said they estimate that more than \u8220\'20\'1C75% of new investment into Bitcoin\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-about-75-new-investment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comes from the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, nothing goes up forever. Several analysts suspect the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-55-4-k-next-warnings-bitcoin-euphoria"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally is getting overheated in the near term}}}\uc2 . It is difficult to call a top when the momentum is strong, but every euphoric moment eventually peaks and is followed by a sharp correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/e06f2797-a99d-4faa-920c-6a3a40615b32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Macroeconomic factors could act as a headwind for the market rally in the near term. On Jan. 16, \uc2 CME Group\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s FedWatch Tool was showing a 63% probability of a 25 basis points rate cut by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  in their March meeting, but that expectation has dwindled to 10.5% after the Consumer Price Index and the Producer Price Index numbers for January {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-us-ppi-miss-52k-fed-rate-cut-odds-fall"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remained above market forecasts}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin start a correction in the near term, and will that pull down the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been facing resistance near $52,000, but the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears, indicating that they are not hurrying to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/66440412-66a4-473f-adcb-675ea3bb4bd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($46,947) indicates that the bulls have the upper hand, but the relative strength index (RSI) above 81 suggests that the rally may have run up too fast in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and snaps back from $48,970, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will increase the possibility of the continuation of the up move.\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $52,000, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $60,000, which is likely to act as a formidable hurdle. Conversely, the pair will be in danger of a short-term reversal if it skids below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the $2,717 resistance on Feb. 14, indicating the resumption of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is the psychologically important level of $3,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/73d24053-97e4-4b6e-a5e8-1c2ae1999e25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp up move of the past few days has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  into the overbought territory, indicating that the rally may be overheated in the short term. That could result in a minor correction or consolidation in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $2,717, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. Instead, if the price turns down and slips below $2,717, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The ETH/USDT pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($2,526).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $119 on Feb. 14 and is likely to retest the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern at $107.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/af581a51-63a9-4bbb-993e-3820b069c413.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the neckline, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $126. The SOL/USDT pair will then attempt a rally to the pattern target of $135.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price breaks below the neckline, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on rallies. The bulls will again try to arrest the fall at the moving averages, but if they fail in their endeavor, the pair may slide to $93.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign that proved correct in the case of BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ). Buyers pushed the price above the descending triangle pattern on Feb. 8 and followed that up with a break above the overhead resistance of $338 on Feb. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/50b039fd-8228-4555-814c-b62d4db6db40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Feb. 15 and Feb. 16 candlestick shows the bears are trying to halt the upward move near $366. Sellers will have to drag the price below $338 to weaken the bulls. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($322).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price consolidates near the current level, it will suggest that the bulls anticipate the up move to continue. A break above $366 will open the doors for a possible rise to $400.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($0.53) on Feb. 14 and broke above the 50-day SMA ($0.55) on Feb. 15, indicating steady buying at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8f2c3258-2188-4b23-8934-733bc930f64a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the downtrend line, which is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the bulls prevail, the XRP/USDT pair could accelerate toward $0.67. There is a minor resistance near $0.62, but it is likely to be overcome.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are fiercely defending the downtrend line. The pair may thereafter descend to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling for a few days, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum on Feb. 14 and broke above the immediate resistance at $0.57.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/59531442-c20d-4383-b788-97c73db1ee0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.54) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight edge. There is a minor resistance at $0.62, but it is likely to be crossed. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is at the moving averages. A break and close below the 50-day SMA ($0.53) will suggest that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair could then plunge to the solid support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls nudged Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the $42 overhead resistance but could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the Feb. 15 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/ddf1e078-f570-4cb4-88ac-c3355d39f380.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price could dip to the 20-day EMA ($37.87), which is the first line of support. If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a break above $42. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse H&S pattern, triggering a rally to $50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving average, it will suggest that the pair may swing between $32 and $42 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Feb. 14 and broke above the downtrend line, indicating that the bulls are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/0c9bd717-1ba0-4b10-bc0b-4a7e8e0bcebd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above the downtrend line, the DOGE/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and surge toward the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone. The bears are expected to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that every higher level is being sold into. The pair may then decline to the uptrend line and later to the strong support at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been facing profit booking near $20.85, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/127a96e3-57d1-4194-b700-cc69061529f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the sentiment remains positive, and traders anticipate the uptrend to resume. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($18.41) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory also indicate advantage to buyers. A break above $20.85 could open the doors for a move to the pattern target of $21.79.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is the crucial support to watch on the downside. If this level is violated, the LINK/USDT pair may plummet to $17.32.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the 50-day SMA ($7.25) for the past two days, indicating buying from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/a57bce9b-d49e-4ee2-8815-52d367d8533c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls are making a comeback. The 20-day EMA ($7.20) is likely to act as a support on dips and the bulls will try to propel the price to $8.58.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the moving averages. The pair could then slump to $6, which is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvYmRiMDc3YTEtZWY4NC00ZDcyLWFlZjUtMWI2MzQxY2U1YmY0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240216ek2g000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
