\par\par \b \uc2 Regret Not Investing In Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) And Binance Coin (BNB)? Pullix Crypto Has Potential To Beat Both\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 848 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 February 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Voltaire Upgrade: A New Hope for Governance and Growth}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance Coin (BNB): Past Peaks and Regulatory Challenges}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Pullix Presale: Your Ticket to Next 100x Gains}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors often reminisce about missed opportunities, particularly with coins like Cardano(\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Binance Coin (\uc2 BNB\uc2 ) that soared by 100x in the 2020/21 bull run. Currently, in the last stages of its presale event, Pullix offers a fresh opportunity for investors to get in on the ground floor before it takes off. Let's take a closer look at why this project can potentially return 100x gains in 2024.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Voltaire Upgrade: A New Hope for Governance and Growth\par \par \uc2 Cardano caused market FOMO in 2021 in the lead-up to its highly anticipated Alonzo fork, which brought smart contract functionalities to the blockchain. Those who entered the market at the best time saw gains of more than 10,000% as Cardano was poised to dethrone Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 However, the Alonzo fork became a sell-the-news event as Cardano prices plummeted in the days following the upgrade. While Cardano has yet to revisit the 2021 hig