ser engagement and transparency.\par \par \uc2 DeeStream (DST) swap service meets the crucial need for accessibility and liquidity in the crypto space. The VIP program adds extra appeal, providing exclusive benefits and building user loyalty. The participation of major players like \uc2 Binance\uc2  (BNB) whales and Bitcoin (BTC) holders highlights DeeStream's (DST) credibility, suggesting a promising future in decentralized finance.\par \par \uc2 In short, with Binance Coin (\uc2 BNB\uc2 ) and Bitcoin (BTC) encountering hurdles and benefiting from positive market feelings, the DeeStream (DST) presale introduces new ideas and user-friendly rewards. In the changing crypto scene, every project plays a distinct role in influencing the future of decentralized finance. Investors should pay attention to these changes to make informed decisions in this lively market.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the DeeStream (DST) presale by visiting the website here\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial ad\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240213ek2d000jl\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,583 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price opened the week with a bang, hitting $50,300 as spot BTC ETF inflows continue to rise.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has reached the psychologically crucial level of $50,000, boosted by the strength in the United States stock markets and solid inflows into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs). Popular trader Daan Crypto Trades pointed out in a X post that net inflows into the Bitcoin ETFs have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-50k-shortly-btc-price-erases-etf-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive for 11 consecutive days}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Several analysts expect the bull run to continue, but CryptoSlate research and data analyst James Van Straten cautioned traders about a possible correction. Van Straten said in a X post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/best-weekly-close-since-2021-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s total supply in profit is nearing 95%}}}\uc2 , which \u8220\'20\'1Cusually marks tops.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/2eaba3a4-2479-496d-a68f-70c78408f77c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While short-term risks of a pullback remain, the long-term picture looks encouraging. Crypto analysis platform Glassnode said in a X post on Feb. 10 that select on-chain indicators are showing signs that Bitcoin could be in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/on-chain-indicators-suggest-high-risk-bitcoin-market-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 initial stages of a bull market}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its up move, pulling select altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) extended its rally above the psychologically important level of 5,000 last week, indicating solid demand from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/3bb622d7-c70f-402e-897b-78ea08643477.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above 5,000, the index is likely to pick up momentum and surge toward the next target at 5,200. Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) cautions that a correction could be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price below the 20-day exponential moving average (4,913) to signal a short-term local top. The index may then fall to the 50-day simple moving average (4,779).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) is consolidating after breaking out of the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on Feb. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/f96d2c99-ebe2-454a-9cd5-c4a2c3715dcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA (103.63) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone indicate that bulls have a slight edge. If buyers propel the price above 104.60, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The index may then climb to 106 and later to 107.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price skids below the neckline, it will indicate that the bears are trying to make a comeback. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be invalidated if the price continues lower and slumps below 102.77.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the Jan. 11 high of $48,970, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend on Feb. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/e4ee4557-6a55-4534-a71f-d1b2c2fb1cb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A close above $48,970 will confirm the breakout and set the stage for a possible rally to $52,000. The $50,000 level may act as a minor resistance, but it is likely to be crossed. A strong momentum could clear the path for a potential rise to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the BTC/USDT pair turns down and breaks back below $48,970, it will suggest that the bears are selling near $50,000. That will increase the risk of a fall to $44,700.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recovery near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $2,507 on Feb. 12, but the bulls did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/e1d7a24e-459a-416e-8fc9-69f7bdc19354.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($2,400) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in command. There is a minor resistance at $2,600, but if that level is crossed, the ETH/USDT pair could reach $2,717.\par \par \uc2 The breakout level of $2,400 remains the key support to watch for on the downside. If this level is taken out, the selling could accelerate, and the pair may plummet to the strong support at $2,100. Buyers are expected to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on Feb. 8, but the bulls are finding it difficult to drive the price to the overhead resistance at $338.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4fd71e6b-22e0-49e6-8cb2-30a612ef0227.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair dipped near the moving averages on Feb. 12, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. Buyers will try to clear the minor hurdle at $326 and shove the price to the stiff overhead resistance of $338.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the moving average, it will indicate that the bears are attempting a comeback. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $288.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt is facing selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.52), indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/7549e826-0db9-4e5b-ba54-ea0a343d568f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns lower from the current level, the bears will try to sink and maintain the price below the strong support at $0.50. If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the critical support at $0.46. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign of strength. The pair may then climb to the downtrend line, which is likely to act as a major hurdle for the bulls. A break above this resistance will clear the path for a possible rally to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the neckline of the inverse H&S pattern on Feb. 10 and are trying to defend the level during the pullback on Feb. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/3282f918-ecb2-4990-bfd7-6840c7ba0c8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above $107, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to accelerate toward $117 and then $126. A break above this resistance will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $135.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the break above $107 may have been a bull trap. The pair may then fall to $93 and later to $80.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-50k-first-time-since-dec-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin hits $50K for first time since December 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the downtrend line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/6f879e5c-47b3-4748-bbda-1612600c3d33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the channel on Feb. 10, but they could not build upon the breakout on Feb. 11. The bears tried to take advantage of the situation and sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.53) on Feb. 12, but the bulls held their ground. This shows that every minor dip is being bought. Buyers will try to propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.62 and subsequently to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to drag the price back below the moving averages. If they can pull it off, the pair may fall to the vital support at $0.46. Buyers are expected to guard this level because if they fail to do that, the pair may dive to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling near $42, indicating that the higher levels continue to attract sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/bd4d96bc-ce8f-4947-8ded-91bb0683ce82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the moving averages. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA ($36.27), it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. The AVAX/USDT pair will then again try to overcome the barrier at $42. If that happens, the pair may soar to $50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a slide below the moving averages will indicate that the breakout was a fake move. The pair may decline to $32, an important level to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a symmetrical triangle for the past several days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/6f7936aa-3ef8-4c4f-9524-d57e1b2c9388.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.08) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. Buyers will have to thrust the price above the triangle to gain the upper hand. The DOGE/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they sink and maintain the price below the uptrend line. That may start a fall to the strong support at $0.07 and eventually to $0.06. Buyers are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvM2U2MTNhZWYtZGJkMi00Yzg1LWIzMGYtYzEzY2U3MDdiZGIzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240212ek2c0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
