\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano to fall off of crypto's top 10, whales making an early exit to alternative token priced $0.11\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 983 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 February 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano's Journey So Far}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ls-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Challenges Facing Cardano}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Rise of Retik Finance (RETIK)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Shifting Landscape}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency landscape is a dynamic and ever-evolving space, where the fortunes of digital assets can change rapidly. One such cryptocurrency currently facing a pivotal moment is Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), a project that has been widely acclaimed for its innovative blockchain platform. However, recent developments have left Cardano hovering on the edge of the top 10 rankings, and the crypto community is witnessing a shift in focus among Cardano whales towards an emerging DeFi powerhouse known as Retik Finance (RETIK), priced at just $0.11. In this article, we explore the challenges Cardano is currently facing and the emergence of Retik Finance as a compelling alternative.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's Journey So Far\par \par \uc2 Cardano, often referred to as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to its native cryptocurrency, has been a prominent player in the cryptocurrency space for several years. Founded by \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , one of the co-founders of Ethereum, Cardano set out with a vision to create a more secure and scalable blockchain platform. It has gained recognition for its commitment to peer-reviewed research and academic rigour, which has set it apart in the crypto world.Over the years, Cardano has amassed a loyal following, and its \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token has consistently ranked among the top cryptocurrencies by market capitalization. The project has achieved significant milestones, including the launch of its smart contract platform, Alonzo, which opened the door to decentralised applications (dApps) and DeFi on the Cardano blockchain.\par \par \uc2 The Challenges Facing Cardano\par \par \uc2 Despite its promising beginnings and achievements, Cardano now finds itself in a precarious position. The crypto market is highly competitive, and maintaining a top-ranking position is no easy feat. Several factors have contributed to the challenges Cardano currently faces:\par \par \uc2 Competition from Rival Blockchains\par \par \uc2 Cardano faces stiff competition from other blockchain platforms like Ethereum, Binance Smart Chain, and Solana. These platforms have already established themselves as leaders in the space, with vibrant ecosystems of dApps and DeFi projects.\par \par \uc2 Slow Adoption of DeFi\par \par \uc2 While Cardano's Alonzo upgrade brought smart contract functionality, the adoption of DeFi projects on the platform has been slower than expected. \uc2 DeFi\uc2  is a driving force in the crypto space, and platforms with thriving DeFi ecosystems tend to attract a significant user base.\par \par \uc2 Cardano Whales Making Early Exits\par \par \uc2 One significant development that has raised eyebrows in the Cardano community is the early exits of Cardano whales. Whales are large holders of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens who have the power to influence the market. Some of these whales have 