d article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240210ek2a00105\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,587 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins have broken above their respective overhead resistance levels, indicating that bulls are making a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is on the move, and the exchange-traded funds (ETFs) investors are cheering the rise by buying more. The spot Bitcoin ETFs witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-third-largest-inflow-btc-price-46-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 their third largest inflows on Feb. 8}}}\uc2 , totaling $403 million. This brings the total inflows into the ETFs to more than $2.1 billion since the launch on Jan. 11.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s spot Bitcoin ETFs have each amassed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-fidelity-etfs-largest-debut-month-30-years"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than $3 billion in assets under management}}}\uc2 . Comparing the first-month performance of all ETF launches in the past 30 years, Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in a Feb. 8 post on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 iShares Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (IBIT) and Fidelity\u8217\'20\'19s Wise Origin Bitcoin Fund (FBTC) are in \u8220\'20\'1Cleague of own,\u8221\'20\'1D occupying the top two spots by a wide margin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/38cfb3d2-7740-4215-9b32-9359afb6338c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move is not limited to Bitcoin alone, as select {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-nears-45-5-k-altcoins-historic-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins have also started to move up}}}\uc2 , breaking above their respective overhead resistance levels. This indicates that the sentiment is improving in the entire crypto space.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin maintain its positive momentum, triggering further rally in select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Repeated failures by the bears to sink the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($43,352) in the past few days attracted strong buying by the bulls on Feb. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/f813447e-b0cc-4bd5-a640-3c9c08856e3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers asserted their supremacy by pushing the price above the $44,700 resistance on Feb. 8. This clears the path for a potential rally to the psychologically important level of $50,000, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 However, if buyers do not give up much ground from $50,000, the rally could continue toward $52,000. The bears will regain control after they sink and sustain the price below $41,884. The BTC/USDT pair could then plummet to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the $2,400 overhead resistance on Feb. 7, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/34c6556f-4563-4b41-9298-18708f6606fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to tug the price back below the breakout level on Feb. 8, but the bulls held their ground. The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $2,632. If the price turns down from $2,632 but finds support at the 20-day EMA ($2,358), it will indicate a positive sentiment. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $2,717.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price back below the moving averages to trap the aggressive bulls. That may result in long liquidation, pulling the ETH/USDT pair to $2,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($305) on Feb. 7 and broke above the downtrend line on Feb. 8, invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4a5e5ceb-dce1-489b-94df-21bacbc28095.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as buyers waiting on the sidelines make an entry. Buyers kicked the price above $320, opening the gates for a retest of the $338 resistance. If this level is scaled, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $360.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or $338, it will indicate profit booking at higher levels. A drop below the moving averages suggests the pair may swing between $288 and $338 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the moving averages on Feb. 7, and the bulls are trying to drive the price above the stiff overhead resistance at $107.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/59db51bc-78c8-42b4-a47a-8a8a67fe454d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair could first rise to the Dec. 25 high of $126 and thereafter attempt a rally to the pattern target of $135.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply and plunges below $92. That may start a downward move to $79, where the bulls are likely to make an entry.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears could not sink and maintain XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.50 support, indicating that the bulls are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b031661e-85b1-4e9c-b6e1-c129dee1ec72.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has recovered to the 20-day EMA ($0.52), a significant level to watch out for in the near term. If buyers clear this hurdle, the XRP/USDT pair could start its journey to the downtrend line. A break and close above the downtrend line will indicate that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then jump to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support on the downside is at $0.50. A close below this level will indicate that the bears have the upper hand. The pair may then slide to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Feb. 7 candlestick shows solid buying by the bulls near the crucial support at $0.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/dbb4e315-4784-43aa-bace-fbcb489caac1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on Feb. 8 and are trying to challenge the downtrend line of the descending channel. If buyers overcome this barrier, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $0.60 and subsequently to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns lower from the downtrend line and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That will indicate aggressive selling on rallies and keep the price inside the channel for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($34.92) on Feb. 6, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/c8dca9ae-44b3-45f7-8eac-fb5b660d6907.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position by maintaining the price above the downtrend line of the channel. It will signal a short-term trend change if they manage to do that. The AVAX/USDT pair could start an up move to $44 and then to the critical resistance at $50.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to yank the price below $32.30. The pair may then continue to oscillate inside the descending channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-btc-spot-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US Bitcoin ETFs make up to 15% of BTC spot trading \u8212\'20\'14 Coinbase}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b07c96b8-f9fa-468e-b564-0059f1473618.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Feb. 7, opening the doors for a possible rise to the downtrend line. Sellers have vigorously defended the level in the past; hence, they will again try to halt the rally at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price reverses direction from the downtrend line, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time. Contrarily, if buyers pierce the downtrend line, the pair may pick up momentum and soar toward the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink and sustain Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern may have attracted buyers who pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($6.92) on Feb. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/db16ca61-b9fe-41b8-8de9-6a6a59334389.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair has reached the 50-day SMA ($7.40), which is likely to act as a strong resistance. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to indicate that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then march toward $8.58.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bears are aggressively defending the level. The pair may then slide toward the support at $6.50 and later to $6.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating after breaking out of the stiff overhead resistance at $17.32 on Feb. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/0e4110ee-d074-4c96-9d76-c08183115056.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($16.87) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory show that bulls have an edge. Buyers will try to arrest the decline at the breakout level of $17.32. If that happens, the possibility of the resumption of the uptrend increases. The LINK/USDT pair could then surge to $21.79.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($15.48).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvOGY3NTM1ZGUtNjYwNy00ZGUyLWE3NTQtNTA0OWFhZjhiMjZjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240213ek290000e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
