ERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) neared $45,500 after the Feb. 8 Wall Street open as \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation brought the highest BTC price levels in a month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/0a895123-b2b0-4ea8-99b1-c2611af5fa7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Shorts fail to suppress a new BTC price advance\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  tracked ongoing strength in BTC/USD, which built on the previous day\u8217\'20\'19s gains.\par \par \uc2 The pair was up 2.5% on the day at the time of writing, setting a precedent for strong moves on major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Concerns had centered on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-nears-45k-warning-bitcoin-leveraged-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the role of leveraged traders}}}\uc2  in sparking the upside, with open interest increasing by nearly $1 billion in less than 24 hours on Bitcoin alone.\par \par \uc2 Despite this, the market looked eager to recoup more of the ground lost during the descent from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-record-notable-volume-on-day-1-btc-price-nearly-hits-49k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two-year highs of $49,000}}}\uc2  on Jan. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Interesting, this will bring \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  one way or another\par \par \uc2 MMs have the option to pin price and milk everyone or support an expansive move {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/cSTLGcJ41O"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/cSTLGcJ41O}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Skew \u916\'03\'94 (@52kskew) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/52kskew/status/1755589233845399835?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CClose the day above $45k and this goes a lot higher. Patience remains the name of the game,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Jelle {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoJelleNL/status/1755621679806525766"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  subscribers on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 Fellow trader Credible Crypto focused on the lack of impact that sellers were having on the market.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll signs pointing to overly aggressive shorts that are failing to have much of an effect on price,\u8221\'20\'1D part of his latest X post read.\par \par \uc2 More of the same.\par \par \uc2 Funding pushed back up only to be forced right back down as OI continues to rise and spot premium increases.\par \par \uc2 All signs pointing to overly aggressive shorts that are failing to have much of an effect on price.\par \par \uc2 Continue the squeeze please {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XLBtfSpLZm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/XLBtfSpLZm}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/eQXgKvrPeH"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/eQXgKvrPeH}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 CrediBULL Crypto (@CredibleCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1755557702040715267?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 8, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Trader Bagsy, meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Bagsy/status/1755620022012059758"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  that those who sold BTC at the launch of the United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) last month would now be seeking a reentry.\par \par \uc2 Zooming out, financial commentator Tedtalksmacro highlighted $43,800 as an important level to hold in the event of a BTC price retracement.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD should also continue to hold its 50-day exponential moving average (EMA), he added, with this currently sitting at $42,330.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUltimately, if we are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I don\u8217\'20\'19t think $41,800\u8211\'20\'13$42,000 should be tested again or we should lose that level,\u8221\'20\'1D he explained in his latest \uc2 YouTube\uc2  video.\par \par \uc2 Altcoin price action heats up\par \par \uc2 Of particular note at the time of writing were Binance\u8217\'20\'19s BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which were up around 8.5% and 10.5%, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-forecasts-new-all-time-highs-more-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 Bitcoin price forecasts calling new all-time highs and more in 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Largest altcoin Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) traded near $2,450, having gained nearly 7% in the past week.\par \par \uc2 Commenting on the action, popular trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1755618928926376198"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  that altcoins on aggregate could be about to witness a \u8220\'20\'1Chistoric breakout.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/5db83495-c014-4948-b4f1-12eaec1bcf75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin market cap chart. Source: Rekt Capital/X\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis ETH breakout may serve as fuel for the next phase of Altcoin rallies,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1755617199686136067"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  in another of the day\u8217\'20\'19s X posts.\par \par \uc2 Vying for the crown of best intraday performance, meanwhile, were several of the top 10 altcoins by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvNTQ0Mzc0NTEtMTQ3OS00YTdiLTk3ZTktZDcyMzk5NWFkOTEzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240209ek2800009\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up this week?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 722 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This week's uplift in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's valuation has been propelled by broader market uptrends and the ripple effect of the recent Solana network downtime.\par \par \uc2 This week, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has experienced a notable rise, rising over 8.5% to reach $0.535 by Feb. 8. The bulk of this weekly appreciation, approximately 6.5%, occurred in the last 24 hours, driven by a confluence of technical indicators, on-chain data, and foundational developments.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4ea249ef-6cc4-4e32-8c31-68841b153b48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Overall market trend pushes Cardano up\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s rise this week mirrors upside sentiment elsewhere in the crypto market. For instance, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the leading cryptocurrencies by market cap, have risen by over 4% and 5.25% week-to-date, respectively.\par \par \uc2 The daily correlation coefficient between Cardano and Bitcoin has remained mostly positive throughout history. As of this week, it was above 0.75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4da9abd0-2631-4fd9-9d4c-6340219af65b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD and BTC/USD daily correlation coefficient. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 This uptrend indicates a heightened interest in crypto assets overall, fueled by the U.S.'s recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/9-bitcoin-etf-buy-142k-btc-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approval}}}\uc2  of Bitcoin-based spot exchange-traded funds (ETFs) and the anticipation surrounding Bitcoin's next {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-halving-how-does-the-halving-cycle-work-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halving}}}\uc2  event in April.\par \par \uc2 Travis Kling, the chief investment officer at Ikigai, mentions the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jerome-powell-unsustainable-fiscal-path-united-states-economy-rate-cuts-march"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rate cut policy}}}\uc2  as one of the major catalysts behind the crypto market rally, which, in turn, is boosting \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price. He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Travis_Kling/status/1754510026679455990"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 "A week ago, the market was pricing six cuts starting in March. Last week, [Jerome] Powell told you to go [in] March. Last night on 60 Minutes, he told you three cuts, not six\u8230\'20\'26result? Stocks up. Crypto up."\par \par \uc2 Increased on-chain activity\par \par \uc2 In addition to broader market trends, Cardano's price rally has recently taken cues from the recent improvements in its network activity.\par \par \uc2 The total-value-locked (TVL) across the Cardano ecosystem has grown from 660.30 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 720.91 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last 24 hours. A rising TVL suggests more assets being locked in Cardano smart contracts, suggesting growing adoption.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/2980d6d0-4249-4c9a-b058-b294d3f07154.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano's TVL performance chart. Source: Defi Llama\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the Cardano price boom in the last 24 hours coincides with a modest rebound in its daily active addresses and daily transactions count.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/03870ccc-2412-4891-b47b-f184c3685cbd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano's daily active addresses and transactions count. Source: Defi Llama\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  outage benefits rival Cardano\par \par \uc2 Cardano's price rally this week occurred after the news of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-network-outage-block-production-halted"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana's network outage}}}\uc2  on Feb. 6. Cardano and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) are layer-one blockchain rivals.\par \par \uc2 There has been a 6.7% increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's value compared to \uc2 SOL\uc2  since, indicating a possible shift in investor strategy. Adopting a cautious stance, traders appear to be reallocating funds from the \uc2 Solana\uc2  ecosystem toward Cardano, seekin safety amid the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/9c75a7c3-a9ba-448f-b6e8-b3be5094efba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\uc2 SOL\uc2  daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Cardano price technical setup\par \par \uc2 Cardano's recent upward trajectory began at a critical support level, identified by the confluence of a horizontal trendline at $0.494 and the lower trendline of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's existing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-trade-bull-and-bear-flag-patterns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear flag}}}\uc2  formation, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/983e7d8b-2251-4b2d-a0a5-01c00ab05ef1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 As of Feb. 8, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's price was eyeing upward continuation toward the flag's upper trendline near $0.55. However, since bear flags are \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuation patterns, the cryptocurrency's likelihood of undergoing a breakdown is high, with its price target sitting around $0.421.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-nears-45k-warning-bitcoin-leveraged-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price nears $45K amid warning Bitcoin leveraged traders in control}}}\par \par \uc2 Should such a breakdown occur, by February\u8217\'20\'19s end, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s targeted price level could potentially adjust to around $0.421, down approximately 20% from current price levels.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bull flag setup\par \par \uc2 The bear flag downside target is also near the lower trendline of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's broader descending channel pattern (purple), which resembles a bull flag, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/bfa61784-8b2d-4d03-ae4e-d51685c91ca8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 This bull flag shows potential for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price to rise toward $0.72 by March or April.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDMvZWUyNDI5NjYtNjU2OS00YWFhLTg0ZTEtZDAzY2FiYzMxMWIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240209ek280000b\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,624 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A trend change for Bitcoin and altcoins could be on the horizon. Will the correction in U.S. regional bank stocks be the catalyst?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has not displayed any fireworks since the launch of spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs), but that has not stopped investors from piling into select ETFs. According to senior Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 , \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-now-fifth-largest-etf-flows-this-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 catapulted into the top 5 ETFs}}}\uc2  in year-to-date flows.\par \par \uc2 The launch of the spot Bitcoin ETFs has resulted in investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/substitution-gold-for-bitcoin-now-underway-cathie-wood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shifting from gold to Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , according to ARK Invest CEO Cathie Woods. While speaking in a \uc2 YouTube\uc2  chat with chief futurist Brett Winton, Woods said that Bitcoin is likely to behave as a \u8220\'20\'1Crisk off asset\u8221\'20\'1D during the next banking crisis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/2ca53153-7607-4a73-8876-ee12bfa04d8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The more than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-1m-bitcoin-bulls-dream-nycb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 60% fall in New York Community Bancorp}}}\uc2  (NYCB) stock since Jan. 30 brings back memories of the banking crisis seen a year ago. The fall is of particular interest to the crypto community because \uc2 NYCB\uc2  had acquired the failed crypto-focused \uc2 Signature Bank\uc2  in 2023.\par \par \uc2 Could the developing banking crisis boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price in the near term? Will the altcoins follow? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading inside a tight range for the past few days, indicating a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/ac4219e0-dbd7-4962-adaa-74a740cfce00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls hold a slight edge as the price has been trading above the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,577) for several days. Buyers will have to overcome the obstacle at $44,700 to build positive momentum. The BTC/USDT pair may soar to the psychological resistance at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate an advantage to the bears. The pair may then slump to $40,000 and eventually to $37,980. This level is likely to see solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) surged above the moving averages on Feb. 6, indicating that the bulls are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b9dd2491-416d-4b11-a70f-67670dc67e1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the stiff overhead resistance of $2,400. The bears will try to defend this level with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, the ETH/USDT pair could jump to $2,600 and later to $2,717.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the uptrend line, it will indicate that the bears are fiercely defending the $2,400 level. The pair may swing inside the $2,100 to $2,400 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to ward off the onslaught from the bears and kept BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($303) in the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/7e10b148-7f2f-4b7c-ba56-7321ba81cc4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($303) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If buyers kick the price above the downtrend line, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $320 and subsequently to $338.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns lower and breaks below $296, it will indicate advantage to the bears. The pair could then descend to the vital support at $288. If this level cracks, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The next support on the downside is at $260.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to start a rebound off the 20-day EMA ($96) in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/d37e284d-dfe5-4aa4-9fdc-f5096c57bba8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The immediate support is at $93. If this level gives way, the SOL/USDT pair risks a fall to the strong support at $80. If the price turns up sharply from $80, the pair may reach the 20-day EMA. A break above this resistance suggests that the pair may consolidate between $107 and $80 for a while.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and retain the price above $107 to get back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to hold XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the $0.50 support, but the weak bounce suggests that the bears have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/147706f8-a39d-4cff-b85b-5a828e2cf7e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is likely to sink below $0.50, which could start the next leg of the down move to the solid support at $0.46. This level has held on two previous occasions; hence, the bulls will again try to arrest the fall at this support.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then attempt a rally to the downtrend line, which remains the key level to watch out for. A break above the downtrend line could suggest the start of a rally to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) in the past few days increased the selling pressure on Feb. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/df1003ab-b1b0-4ae4-915a-f1edc9f6fee4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $0.46, where buyers are likely to step in. If the price bounces off $0.46 but returns from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will enhance the prospects of a drop to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from $0.46 and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair may then surge to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) tried to start a relief rally from the 20-day EMA ($34.49) on Feb. 5, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/f45db96f-6c5e-45e3-8241-610f19fb005c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to gain the upper hand in the near term by pulling the price below the $32 support. If they manage to do that, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could descend to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it will indicate that the bulls are back in command. The pair could rally to $44 and after that to the critical resistance at $50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/over-the-counter-crypto-trading-philippines-dubai-uae"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Regulated OTC desks could spur \b  \highlight22crypto adoption\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle and the 20-day EMA ($0.08).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8bf7b333-9e23-4d20-b397-4e2313ab921f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory give a slight edge to the bears. If the price plunges below the uptrend line, the DOGE/USDT pair could decline to $0.07. This level is likely to attract buyers, but if the bulls fail to push the price back into the triangle, the likelihood of a drop to $0.06 increases.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could attempt a rally to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the start of an up move to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have repeatedly failed to push and maintain Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($6.86) in the past few days, indicating that the bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/bf0e9892-6e45-4481-beb3-35559835eaca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the nearby support at $6.50. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could start a downward move to $6 and thereafter to $5.40.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair may climb to the 50-day SMA ($7.42). A break and close above this level will signal a potential trend change in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend, but the price turned down from $19.79 on Feb. 5, indicating that the bears are vigorously defending the $20 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/2d04a925-c52d-4bb3-9c46-a8ec47765156.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After the breakout from a range, the price usually turns down and retests the breakout level. The LINK/USDT pair could drop to $17.32, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $17.32, it will indicate that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will increase the likelihood of the continuation of the uptrend. The pair may then attempt a rally to $21.79.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA ($16.51).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvNTA3ZTM0NGMtYmY1Yy00MDE5LTkxYjYtZmMzZWEzZDBkZDBjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240208ek270000g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
