et cap of $10.9 billion, there is a lot of potential still untapped within the Cardano ecosystem. Trigger points like new protocol upgrades, developer and user adoption, and partnerships can set off parabolic rallies at opportune times.\par \par \uc2 Given Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s staying power and technological edge, a clean break of the $1 mark seems imminent in 2024. With some lucky breaks on protocol updates and collaboration deals, it may very well extend as high as $10 during peak bullishness.\par \par \uc2 Click Here To Buy PAMBO Tokens\par \par \uc2 Concluding Thoughts\par \par \uc2 Sub $1 tokens Pandoshi (PAMBO), Polygon (MATIC) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) check all the boxes for an exponential rise in 2024, propelled by tailwinds like new product features, mainstream visibility, partnerships and overall maturity of the underlying blockchain networks.\par \par \uc2 Pandoshi, as a recently introduced community-focused DeFi ecosystem, offers unmatched upside for early backers before exchange listings. Polygon (MATIC) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) have already shown glimpses of their peak potential on price charts. 2024 may see history repeat itself with these promising tokens staging their biggest breakouts to date!\par \par \uc2 Click Here To Buy PAMBO Tokens\par \par \uc2 Visit the links below for more information about Pandoshi (PAMBO):\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pandoshi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://pandoshi.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Whitepaper: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.pandoshi.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://docs.pandoshi.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240206ek2500001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,660 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin may remain inside a range for a while as a strong U.S. dollar could limit the upside.\par \par \uc2 Stock markets in the United States continued their march higher last week, even after the Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  dashed hopes of a rate cut in March. However, Powell did say that a rate cut would likely happen this year. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jerome-powell-unsustainable-fiscal-path-united-states-economy-rate-cuts-march"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Powell reiterated these views}}}\uc2  during his interview with \uc2 CBS\uc2  news show 60 Minutes.\par \par \uc2 Fed comments and strong macroeconomic data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2024/02/05/dollar-scales-fresh-peaks-as-fed-cut-bets-recede.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced}}}\uc2  expectations of rate cuts by the Fed to 120 basis points in 2024, down from 150 basis points at the end of last year, Fed funds futures showed. This pushed the U.S. dollar Index (DXY) to its highest level in 11 weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/1b901345-c2ed-4ae2-b5c7-b4a48a4b2145.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Historically, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) moves in inverse correlation with the U.S. dollar. Hence the strength in the greenback could act as a headwind for Bitcoin in the near term. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is the strong inflows into \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) in January, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-fidelity-bitcoin-etfs-top-10-for-january-flows-morningstar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 totaling about $4.8 billion}}}\uc2 . Continued inflows into the ETFs could limit the downside.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin remain stuck in a range, or is a breakout on the cards? How are the altcoins expected to behave? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average (4,850) on Feb. 1 and soared to a new all-time high on Feb. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/80b0d63d-d803-427b-bde7-70699f1c7408.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, indicating that the bulls are in command, but the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) warrants caution. The up move could face selling at the psychological resistance of 5,000, but if buyers bulldoze their way through, the next stop could be 5,200.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support on the downside is the 20-day EMA. A slide below this level will be the first indication that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That may start a fall to the 50-day simple moving average (4,734) and then to 4,650.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar Index snapped back sharply from the 50-day SMA (102.84) on Feb. 2 and broke above the neckline of the inverted head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/c112f97b-72ea-4399-9908-881d9689275f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is 107.39, just below the formidable overhead resistance at 108. However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to halt the up move near 104.55 and again at 106.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to tug the price below the 50-day SMA to seize control. The index may decline to the vital support zone between 101 and 99.57. The bulls are expected to defend this zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have failed to sink Bitcoin below the 20-day EMA ($42,463) even after repeated attempts, suggesting that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b3bfdbb9-5c67-4eb4-bf1a-73b7aec1d8cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price to the $44,000 to $44,700 overhead resistance zone. This remains the key zone for the bears to defend because if they fail in their endeavor, the BTC/USDT pair could skyrocket to the psychological level of $50,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $44,700, the pair may consolidate in a tight range for a while. The bears will be on top if they sink the pair below $41,394. The pair may then slide to $40,000 and eventually to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for several days, but the bears have failed to pull the price to the strong support at $2,100. This suggests buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/63656cac-a9ed-43a6-ba1a-1fc4e1ad75f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could challenge the $2,400 level. A break and close above this resistance will indicate that bulls have overpowered the bears. The pair may rise to $2,600 and then to the Jan. 12 intraday high of $2,717.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will signal that the bears are active at higher levels. That may keep the pair stuck inside the $2,100 to $2,400 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($300) on Feb. 4, but the bulls are struggling to build upon the strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/ddcc05dc-44b5-4c58-99c3-9d15b4d836be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line to invalidate the descending triangle pattern. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $320 and subsequently to $338.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that the bears continue to sell on minor rallies. The pair may then drop to the strong support at $288. If this level crumbles, the pair will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which could start a down move to $260.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears could not maintain XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below $0.50 on Jan. 31 and Feb. 1, which started a recovery to the 20-day EMA ($0.53) on Feb. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/131ad73d-5376-41a5-9054-0ee2820ce8b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from the 20-day EMA on Feb. 4, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. If the $0.50 support gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could plunge to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are vigorously defending the $0.50 support. The positive divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also points toward a recovery in the near term. If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may attempt a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/0e1093e9-d4d8-4080-b0c9-0a8cc1324017.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days is forming an inverse H&S pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $107. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $125. There is a minor resistance at $117, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks and maintains below the moving averages, it will signal that the bulls have given up. The SOL/USDT pair may start a descent to $79, which is an important level for the bulls to guard, because if it cracks, the next stop may be $64.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-new-february-high-bitcoin-target-25k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price sets new February high as Bitcoin buyers target faraway $25K}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been hovering near the 20-day EMA ($0.50) for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/95280cf1-8a0d-4d0b-bbc2-759fa1597ef9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting a range-bound action in the near term. If buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to overcome this obstacle to signal a potential trend change in the near term.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the price breaks below $0.48, it will indicate that bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The pair may slide to $0.46 and later to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from the downtrend line on Feb. 3, but a positive sign is that the bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($34.55).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/0f001bd1-85c3-4576-85ee-2c621bd2ee16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, it will increase the likelihood of a break above the descending channel. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $44 and thereafter attempt a rally to the psychologically important level of $50.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upward move, they will have to quickly yank the price below the immediate support at $32. If they do that, the pair could slump toward the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line near $24.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade below the 20-day EMA ($0.08), but the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the uptrend line of the symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/7c694799-71d0-4078-94a7-58b71166026f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the DOGE/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days. The pair will try to rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above or below the triangle. If the price surges above the triangle, the pair could travel to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone. On the contrary, a break below the triangle will open the doors for a fall to $0.07 and then $0.06.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvYTRlNmFmMWYtMDNlMi00NWYyLWJhNDctMWI3M2IyOGQ2MDk1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240205ek25000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
