of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240204ek240018h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Dogecoin\par \b \uc2 Dogecoin network activity goes parabolic \u8212\'20\'14 Will DOGE price follow?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 499 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders keep an eye on DOGE price after a sharp uptick in activity on Dogecoin.\par \par \uc2 Popular memecoin Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading sideways, above the 200-day exponential moving average (EMA) since Jan. 7. DOGE price is down 0.4% over the last week and 14% over the last month, and even though the technical setup hints at further losses for DOGE, the recent spike in network activity is interesting.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin network activity surges\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin is experiencing a significant increase in its network activity. Data from market intelligence firm IntoTheBlock shows over 890,000 new Dogecoin addresses have been created over the past week.\par \par \uc2 This increase in new addresses coincides with an 86% adoption rate as the new users execute their first transactions on the blockchain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/076f5532-9d74-408f-8d3f-e65e8373e43f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin: New addresses. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 Additional data from Santiment shows a spike in daily active addresses (DAA), which increased from 124,240 on Jan. 23 to more than 498,000 on Feb. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8b94a466-983f-48ec-a50a-7fad78c2cc44.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin network DAA. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 This resurgence in network activity could be due to the release of the iconic Doom video game on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-dogecoin-a-beginners-guide-to-doge-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin}}}\uc2  blockchain and the upcoming DOGE-1 launch.\par \par \uc2 DOOM meets Dogecoin! Developer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/minidogeart?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #minidogeart}}}\uc2  deploys the iconic 1993 DOOM game on the Dogecoin blockchain using Ordinals technology. Now, gaming data is fetched entirely from Dogecoin network, showcasing the potential of blockchain for preserving digital assets.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 BlockVoyager (@BlockVoyagerAIO) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BlockVoyagerAIO/status/1750113560448164191?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 24, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 A third factor is the increasing use of Dogechain, a layer-2 blockchain built on the Dogecoin network.\par \par \uc2 It is important that creativity brings new victories and with them new users - Dogechain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Dogechain?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Dogechain}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Dogecoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Dogecoin}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yjSjsNncqz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yjSjsNncqz}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 DogeChainNews (@DogeChainNews1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DogeChainNews1/status/1753344549521379569?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 2, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 These factors have helped generate interest in the Dogecoin network, and if this trajectory remains, DOGE price could react if investors begin to take positions in the coin.\par \par \uc2 However, the technical setup suggests that the price is poised for a deeper correction from the current levels.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-2-2-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ada-avax-doge-dot-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 2/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOGE, DOT, LINK}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s descending triangle could attract more bears\par \par \uc2 Since Dec. 6, 2023, DOGE price action has been characterized by a series of lower highs and relatively equal lows around $0.078, and a descending triangle has appeared on the daily chart.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  technical formation is confirmed once the price produces a decisive close below the support line \u8212\'20\'14 formed by the equal lows. This projects a drop in price equal to the height of the triangle\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8276f4bc-6d3f-48db-979a-a0e30f13b495.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Despite this pessimistic outlook, the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the neutral zone at 45, a hint at traders\u8217\'20\'19 current indecisiveness.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvZTFlOGY5YTYtNjQwNC00MzkxLTgyMmYtZTQ2NjViMmQxNWZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240205ek220000g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Dogecoin\par \b \uc2 Dogecoin network activity goes parabolic \u8212\'20\'14 Will DOGE price follow?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 499 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders keep an eye on DOGE price after a sharp uptick in activity on Dogecoin.\par \par \uc2 Popular memecoin Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading sideways, above the 200-day exponential moving average (EMA) since Jan. 7. DOGE price is down 0.4% over the last week and 14% over the last month and even though the technical setup hints at further losses for DOGE, the recent spike in network activity is interesting.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin network activity surges\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin is experiencing a significant increase in its network activity. Data from market intelligence firm IntoTheBlock shows over 890,000 new Dogecoin addresses have been created over the past week.\par \par \uc2 This increase in new addresses coincides with an 86% adoption rate as the new users execute their first transactions on the blockchain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/076f5532-9d74-408f-8d3f-e65e8373e43f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin: New addresses. Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 Additional data from Santiment shows a spike in daily active addresses (DAA), which increased from 124,240 on Jan. 23 to more than 498,000 on Feb. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8b94a466-983f-48ec-a50a-7fad78c2cc44.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin network DAA. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 This resurgence in network activity could be due to the release of the iconic DOOM video game on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-dogecoin-a-beginners-guide-to-doge-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin}}}\uc2  blockchain and the upcoming DOGE-1 launch.\par \par \uc2 DOOM meets Dogecoin! Developer {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/minidogeart?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #minidogeart}}}\uc2  deploys the iconic 1993 DOOM game on the Dogecoin blockchain using Ordinals technology. Now, gaming data is fetched entirely from Dogecoin network, showcasing the potential of blockchain for preserving digital assets.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 BlockVoyager (@BlockVoyagerAIO) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BlockVoyagerAIO/status/1750113560448164191?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 24, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 A third factor is the increasing use of Dogechain, a layer 2 blockchain built on the Dogecoin network.\par \par \uc2 It is important that creativity brings new victories and with them new users - Dogechain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Dogechain?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Dogechain}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Dogecoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Dogecoin}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yjSjsNncqz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yjSjsNncqz}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 DogeChainNews (@DogeChainNews1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DogeChainNews1/status/1753344549521379569?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 February 2, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 These factors have helped generate interest in the Dogecoin network and if this trajectory remains, DOGE price could react if investors begin to take positions in the token.\par \par \uc2 However, the technical setup suggests that the price is poised for a deeper correction from the current levels.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-2-2-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ada-avax-doge-dot-link"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 2/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOGE, DOT, LINK}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s descending triangle could attract more bears\par \par \uc2 Since Dec. 6, 2023, DOGE price action has been characterized by a series of lower highs and relatively equal lows around $0.078, and a descending triangle has appeared on the daily chart.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  technical formation is confirmed once the price produces a decisive close below the support line \u8211\'20\'13 formed by the equal lows. This projects a drop in price equal to the height of the triangle\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/8276f4bc-6d3f-48db-979a-a0e30f13b495.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Despite this pessimistic outlook, the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the neutral zone at 45, a hint at traders\u8217\'20\'19 current indecisiveness.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvZTFlOGY5YTYtNjQwNC00MzkxLTgyMmYtZTQ2NjViMmQxNWZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240205ek220000z\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 2/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,593 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are steadily reclaiming the upper part of the current trading range and altcoin charts are also showing fresh rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 The launch of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) in January failed to boost prices as traders focused on the outflows from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC), ignoring the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/9-bitcoin-etf-buy-142k-btc-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net inflows into the remaining ETFs}}}\uc2 . This shows that the traders sought to sell the news and book profits on their positions.\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that Bitcoin did not stay below the $40,000 level for long. This indicates that lower levels continue to attract investors. Buying on dips and selling on rallies may keep {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-150-days-5k-btc-price-trading-range"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin inside a range for a few days}}}\uc2 . The next major catalyst for Bitcoin is the halving in April.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/614c2746-e06b-498f-b9af-a6d9a15e7ffd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another positive in favor of the bulls is that Bitcoin has produced an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gains-january-new-sub-40k-btc-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 average monthly gain of about 12% in February}}}\uc2 , according to CoinGlass data. Since 2013, Bitcoin has ended February with a negative monthly return only in 2014 and 2020.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin repeat its strong historical performance in February? Will altcoins follow Bitcoin higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading between the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,365) and the overhead resistance of $44,700 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/953191c1-40f8-486f-bf5a-1dbdde627fd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into the positive territory, indicating a minor advantage to buyers. If bulls overcome the barrier at $44,700, the BTC/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $49,000. The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are trying to take charge. The selling could pick up on a slump below $41,394. The pair may then descend to $40,000 and later to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the $2,100 to $2,400 range, but the bulls have not given up and are trying to kick the price above the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/16cc169a-fa8c-4db0-9d19-caf7d5674fd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A close above $2,400 will be the first sign of strength. That could attract further buying, pushing the ETH/USDT pair toward $2,700. If the price turns down from $2,700 but rebounds off $2,400, it will indicate that the sentiment has turned positive. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the current level or $2,400, it will indicate that the pair may spend some more time inside the range. The bears will be at an advantage if the price dives below $2,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($304) on Jan. 31, but the bears could not break the 50-day SMA ($297) support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/90e34a25-c556-45ef-88a2-1688ea476311.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, signaling a balance between supply and demand. A break above the downtrend line will tilt the balance in favor of the buyers. There is a minor resistance at $322, but if crossed, the BNB/USDT pair may soar to $338.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns lower from the downtrend line, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and the bears are selling on rallies. That increases the risk of a break below $288.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $107 on Jan. 30 but rebounded off the moving averages on Feb. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/2a44ae1f-4795-4cda-a9f7-2e696d675962.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price above $107. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair will complete an inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. That may start an up move to $126, which is a strong hurdle, but if the bulls prevail, the next stop could be the pattern target of $134.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upward move, they will have to quickly tug the price below the moving averages. The pair could drop to $80, which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers yanked XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.50 support on Jan. 31, but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/6dd3c55f-967c-493b-8f06-395d46a71f33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break above the $0.51 resistance could clear the path for a rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.53). The bears are expected to defend this level with vigor. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could plunge to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. The pair may then travel to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to overcome this obstacle to start a new up move to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending channel pattern for several days, indicating that the bears continue selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/b1529ac6-1b9f-4baf-bfdc-e6bf985d68c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.51) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the downtrend line. A break and close above this level will suggest that the short-term downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch on the downside is $0.46, and then the support line of the channel near $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($34.29) on Jan. 31, but the bears could not build upon this strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/215b1e9c-6c7c-4531-9a2f-414c12e8f4f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price climbed above the 20-day EMA on Feb. 2, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers. This increases the likelihood of a break above the channel\u8217\'20\'19s downtrend line. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could start an up move to $44 and subsequently to the crucial resistance at $50.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price reverses direction from the downtrend line and breaks below $32. That will set the stage for a decline to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drops-hour-us-payrolls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price drops 1.3% in an hour as US payrolls smash estimates}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the 20-day EMA ($0.08) for the past few days, but the bears have not been able to challenge the $0.07 support. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/cd673850-3260-4b72-a671-46f427c10675.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA and gain the upper hand in the near term. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This remains the key level to watch out for, as the bears have successfully defended the level for many days.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will indicate that the bears have not given up. The pair may then slide to the $0.07 support. On the other hand, a break above the downtrend line will signal a potential trend change. The pair may then rise to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the neckline of the H&S pattern on Jan. 31, but they could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/4bc91da7-5861-46d3-a5c3-48bb6b840c41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Solid buying by the bulls pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($6.92) on Feb. 2. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($7.44) will indicate that the bears are losing their grip. That could open the doors for a rally to $8.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will signal that the bears remain active at higher levels. The DOT/USDT pair may consolidate between the 50-day SMA and $6 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) range-bound action resolved to the upside with a breakout above $17.32 on Feb. 2, suggesting that the buyers have overpowered the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-02/5da26101-ece7-494b-b77f-0890ac6ac707.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily and will try to pull the price back below the breakout level. If they manage to do that, several aggressive bulls may get trapped. That may result in a fall to the 20-day EMA ($15.38).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers maintain the price above $17.32, it will suggest a valid breakout. The $17.32 level may then act as a launchpad, propelling the LINK/USDT pair toward the target objective of $21.79.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDIvMzBjM2Q3NWMtZmU4OC00M2ZlLWIzNWUtZmEyN2RjNDBjY2IxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240205ek220000j\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,587 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s upcoming halving in April is likely to attract buyers and clear the path for a potential rally above $45,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been volatile in January. Early on, the price rose near $49,000 in anticipation of the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) launch, but then sold off as the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) saw massive liquidations.\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that GBTC\u8217\'20\'19s outflows have been reducing in the past few days. Live data from intelligence firm Arkham shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-braces-fed-powell-gbtc-outflows-340m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows of $340 million from Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s fund}}}\uc2 , a marginal increase over Jan. 30 outflow of $270 million but way lower than the peak outflow of $641 million on Jan. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/48beb8ad-26d9-4586-80c9-339b6840d462.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders are likely to gradually shift their focus from the \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  flows to the upcoming halving in April. Pseudonymous crypto trader Rekt Capital said in a X post (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) on Jan. 29 that any dip in Bitcoin over the next two weeks could be the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/one-last-chance-buy-bitcoin-bargain-prices-rekt-capital"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 last chance to buy before the pre-halving rally}}}\uc2  kicks in.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical overhead resistance levels that need to be crossed for the up move to resume in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the 50-day simple moving average ($42,893) on Jan. 29, but the bulls could not maintain the momentum and catapult the price above $44,700.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/3ea82ac4-eea4-42b0-8dde-a38cf4904e4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,277) on Jan. 31, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests the buyers are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into support.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to propel the price above $44,700. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and skyrocket toward $49,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $44,700, it will suggest that the bears are vigorously defending the level. The pair may then trade inside a tight range between the 20-day EMA and $44,700 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls kicked Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on Jan. 30 but could not clear the overhead hurdle at $2,400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/fe9d5b49-3ca8-4c88-b841-83604c2ec580.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to tug and maintain the price below the moving averages. If they succeed, it will signal that the ETH/USDT pair may oscillate inside the $2,100 to $2,400 range for a while. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint also indicate a possible consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above $2,400 or below $2,100. If the $2,400 level gives way, the pair may soar to $2,700 and eventually to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned lower from the downtrend line on Jan. 30, indicating that the bears are fiercely guarding this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/fcf114be-a27b-4200-aff1-1ad19a948e97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price dips and sustains below the 20-day EMA ($305), the BNB/USDT pair could dip to the 50-day SMA ($295) and thereafter to the vital support at $288. Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail to do that, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. This negative setup has a pattern target of $238.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair may then climb to $338.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) break above the downtrend line is the first sign that the bulls are trying to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/944e1bba-6a6b-4427-96d9-96c29260222a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above the nearest resistance at $107, but the sellers had other plans. The long wick on the Jan. 30 candlestick shows that the bears have not given up and are selling at $107.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or the moving averages, it will suggest that dips are being bought. That will increase the likelihood of a break above $107. If that happens, the SOL/USDT pair may surge to $117 and then to $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on Jan. 30 may have attracted strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/3e604961-90b2-4aed-b6c9-8ba764681f24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to protect the $0.50 support, but the repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. If the price maintains below $0.50, the XRP/USDT pair may descend to the crucial support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the first key resistance on the upside. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rally to the downtrend line. The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers drove Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on Jan. 29, but could not build upon this strength. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4ff3d595-ae93-4bfe-be55-9b5780c80b4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, signaling a range-bound action in the near term. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plunge to $0.46 and later to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.54, the pair may climb to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to overcome this obstacle to suggest that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been correcting inside a descending channel pattern for several days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/dd8be1c8-2181-4419-b711-1366bedb9f1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from the downtrend line on Jan. 30 and reached the 20-day EMA ($34.29). A drop below the 20-day EMA suggests that the AVAX/USDT pair may remain inside the channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it will suggest that bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then start the next leg of the up move to $44 and subsequently to the psychological resistance at $50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-hopium-study-reveals-84-of-investors-expect-new-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin halving hopium: Study reveals 84% of investors expect new all-time highs}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears at the 20-day EMA ($0.08).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/757ffad0-99e2-403b-bf18-cc1b029dd3b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have repeatedly thwarted attempts by the bulls to clear the 20-day EMA, but a positive sign is that the buyers have not given up much ground. This suggests that the bulls anticipate a move higher toward the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it will indicate a short-term trend change. The DOGE/USDT pair may climb toward the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone. This positive view will be invalidated if the pair turns down and breaks below the $0.07 support.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($6.95) on Jan. 29, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/83dbb684-dc8c-4304-8140-197b489dfd03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. The DOT/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $6 and the 50-day SMA ($7.46) for some time.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the pair to the 50-day SMA. A break and close above this resistance could propel the pair to $8.50. On the contrary, a break below the neckline could pull the pair to $6. If this level cracks, the pair may slide to $4.80.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $12.85 and $17.32 for many days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/3efb6ba0-b8e1-4553-8487-bda7634f102b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, in a range, traders buy near the support and sell at the resistance. The break above the moving averages on Jan. 29 opened the doors for a rally to the overhead resistance at $17.32. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $17.32, the LINK/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to drive and sustain the price above $17.32 to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The target objective on the upside is $21.79.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvYzk5YzZkMGEtZTE5My00MjM0LWFiNmQtNDg1OTQ4ZWM4MTc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240201ek1v00003\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
