I) at 47.209 reinforces this neutral stance, while the MACD level at -0.012 and Momentum at 0.014 provide little indication of a decisive move in either direction.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, if Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) breaks above the immediate resistance, it could pave the way for a rally towards the next barriers of $0.855 and potentially $1.161, especially if it manages to scale effectively and maintain its competitive edge in the industry.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outcome could see \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  retracting towards $0.419, and in a more extended downturn, possibly reaching as low as $0.243. This scenario might unfold if the market reacts negatively to the broader economic environment or if Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) faces unforeseen challenges in scaling its platform.\par \par \uc2 As \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  hovers around the $0.53 mark, its performance in the near future will be a testament to whether it can capitalize on its solid foundation and outpace its competition, or if it succumbs to market pressures at this crucial juncture.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Market Performance\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/01/hope-alive-for-xrp-reaching-10-alternatively-an-innovative-crypto-may-realize-it-immediately"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple}}}\uc2  (XRP) has been in the spotlight after the US court's declaration of XRP as a non-security that has shifted the focus away from XRP's speculative trading patterns to its real-world applications (RWA). \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s (XRP) intrinsic value is increasingly linked to its utility in the cross-border payment market projected to reach a colossal $250 trillion in the next three years \u8211\'20\'13 a factor that could significantly drive XRP's value.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BITSTAMP%3AXRPUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Currently, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is trading between its first support level at $0.5622 and the first resistance level at $0.6842. The market's response to XRP's increased relevance in payment solutions and its status shift is evident in its market cap, which has risen by 1% to $29.02 billion, and a notable 31% surge in trading volume to $903.16 million.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 From a technical standpoint, \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's (XRP) 10-day EMA ($0.5337) is hovering around the last trading price, indicating a potential consolidation phase. The 50-day ($0.5721) and 200-day ($0.5671) EMAs suggest a slight \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias in the medium term.\par \par \uc2 The RSI at 41.29 and the Stochastic %K at 41.4 both lean towards a more \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, although they are not in the oversold territory.\par \par \uc2 The ADI at 36.34 shows a moderate trend strength, which could mean the current price trend may sustain.\par \par \uc2 However, the negative CCI at -41.64 and the MACD at -0.01746 indicate that bears have a slight edge in the current market setup.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, if XRP manages to break above $0.6842, it could open the path towards the next resistance levels at $0.7531 and $0.8751, supported by its increasing utility in the payment sector.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook would see \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) falling below its current support at $0.5622, potentially leading to further declines towards $0.5091 and $0.3871.\par \par \uc2 Given XRP's unique position post-declaration as a non-security, its movement may not entirely adhere to traditional technical analysis, as its value is more closely tied to its utility and adoption in the global payment industry.\par \par \uc2 Bottomline\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's surge past $43,000, driven by factors such as declining GBTC sales and the enablement of \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  ad support, points to a potential rally. However, the coming Fed policy decision and US economic data present a pivotal moment that could sway the market santiment. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), with its recent 8% market cap increase, is trading between key support and resistance levels, showing a consolidation phase in its technical indicators. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), trading between its own crucial levels, faces a unique situation after being declared a non-security. Its value is now more connected to its utility in the vast cross-border payment market. Amid a mix of optimism and caution, the market's response to these developments will determine the future trajectory of both \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and XRP.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240130ek1u000rv\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,613 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Market observers expect the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  to cut rates by March, which could boost demand for risky assets like Bitcoin and large-cap altcoins.\par \par \uc2 United States equities markets are on a roll, supported by strong economic growth and signs that inflation may be slowing down on a yearly basis. The S&P 500 Index (SPX) climbed 1.06% last week, continuing its march toward the psychologically important level of 5,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) also behaved identically, rising 1.08% last week. It was an impressive performance, considering that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price had fallen near $38,500 during the week. The strong recovery shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/61658c7f-e8f9-4eb0-b24c-c86db0ba99c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from the FedWatch Tool shows that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  will hold rates in their Jan. 31 meeting but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-yearly-open-fomc-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 start cutting rates from their March meeting}}}\uc2 . An expansive monetary policy is usually a positive sign for risky assets.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its recovery, or will higher levels attract strong selling by the bears? How are the altcoins expected to behave? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index continued its northward march last week, indicating solid demand from the bulls at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/dc0acca5-c5c0-45e8-8808-f4255a76bb68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The index is facing some resistance at 4,900, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the buyers expect the uptrend to resume. If buyers kick the price above 4,907, the index could reach the 5,000 level, where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day exponential moving average (4,806). A slide below this support could clear the path for a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average (4,694).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) is facing resistance at the downtrend line, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/474dcc86-77d3-43c1-8b09-0cf51968d7ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA (103) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers push and maintain the price above the downtrend line, the index may climb to 104.50 and later to 106.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the bears are fiercely defending the downtrend line. The index may then slip to 102.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to drive Bitcoin above the 50-day SMA ($42,795) on Jan. 28 and 29, but the bears held their ground. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/247e1cf6-5068-47cc-a123-9d04e353edd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA, the BTC/USDT pair could reach $44,700. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears. If the price turns down from $44,700 and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips and maintains below the 20-day EMA ($41,950), the pair may gradually dip toward $40,000 and then $37,980. The next trending move is likely to begin after buyers shove the price above $44,700 or bears sink the pair below $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) Jan. 28 candlestick shows that the bears are selling near the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/182cfe32-4acf-43d5-b948-f45edd171a7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($2,340) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, indicating that the bears have a slight edge. Sellers will try to pull the price to $2,168 and then to the strong support at $2,100. A strong rebound off this level may keep the ETH/USDT pair stuck inside the $2,100 to $2,400 range for a while.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. The pair may then rise to $2,400, which is an important resistance to keep an eye on. If this level is scaled, the pair may climb to $2,600.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the descending triangle pattern for the past few days, indicating that the bears are trying to take control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/727383a4-dbfa-4132-974a-664f0ecf2743.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the bulls successfully defended the $288 support and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($304). The BNB/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line, an important resistance to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern will be invalidated. The pair may then rally toward $338.\par \par \uc2 The sentiment will turn negative after bears tug the price below the $288 support and complete the descending triangle pattern. That may start a fall to $260.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range between $0.46 and $0.74 for several months, indicating buying at support and selling near resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/48d7ea2d-8f52-4c49-a709-f0edd4bb6278.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is below 37, indicating that the bears hold the edge. Sellers will try to sink the price below the psychological support at $0.50 and challenge the crucial level of $0.46. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the $0.46 support as a break below it may result in a fall to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the downtrend line to signal a comeback. The XRP/USDT pair may jump to $0.67 and eventually to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line, which is the first sign that the correction may be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/36aababb-4520-4ad1-ab3d-6ccfa6e6cb8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a balance between buyers and sellers. A break above $104 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The SOL/USDT pair may then rise to $117.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. That may trap the aggressive bulls and pull the pair to $80.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pullback reached the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Jan. 28, which is acting as a stiff resistance, as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/8c76303d-056a-4248-b1ce-f0581b8c12de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the support line of the channel near $0.42. The bulls will try to defend this level because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair may plummet to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above the 20-day EMA will open the doors for a possible rally to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s downtrend line. Buyers will have to pierce the downtrend line to indicate that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($34) on Jan. 28, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears may not give up easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/a8fce909-a691-4781-9eb5-487af0c5d1e2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line, which is likely to act as a major barrier. If the price turns down sharply from the current level or the downtrend line and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair may remain inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price above the channel to indicate a potential trend change in the near term. The pair may start an up move toward $44 and thereafter attempt a rally to the psychologically important level of $50.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Jan. 28 but kept up the pressure and cleared the hurdle on Jan. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/be5a0427-aafb-43cd-8270-73612c5fb516.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to bears, but the \uc2 RSI\uc2  near the midpoint suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be reducing. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. The bears have successfully defended the level in the past, and they will try to do that again.\par \par \uc2 However, if buyers overcome the obstacle at the downtrend line, the pair may start its journey toward the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone. The important support on the downside is $0.07.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvNDhkNDc4ODktNTU4MS00ZmJkLWIzNzEtZjkxNTUwNTM1ODQwL