assive liquidations in the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC). However, \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  analysts said in a Jan. 25 market report that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-sell-off-to-stem-jpmorgan-bitcoin-etfs-record-net-outflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bulk of the profit taking in GBTC}}}\uc2  has \u8220\'20\'1Chappened already,\u8221\'20\'1D meaning \u8220\'20\'1Cmost of the downward pressure on Bitcoin from that channel should be largely behind us.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/83b96755-0574-4c44-9848-c494db69810d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Every bull market has its share of corrections, which helps shake out the weak hands and allow the stronger hands to buy at lower levels. During a correction, waiting for a support level to be established before buying is generally a good strategy.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins that may hold? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dip near $37,980 on Jan. 23, pushing the price to the 20-day exponential moving average ($41,904) on Jan. 26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4e71057e-9b91-4905-9367-93488c7b6f32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair is likely to face a stiff battle between the bulls and the bears near the moving averages. If the pair ascends the 50-day simple moving average ($42,904), the next stop could be $44,700. The bulls may again face stiff opposition from the bears at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the pair may remain range-bound between $44,700 and $37,980 for a while. A slide below $37,980 could start the downward move to $34,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) Jan. 25 strategy shows that the bulls are trying to protect the nearby support at $2,168.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/b52455a8-c250-4933-a3cd-5f017dfa7477.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair will attempt to pull back to the downtrend line, which is likely to act as a stiff barrier. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will signal that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could enhance the prospects of a drop to $2,100. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the level.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a rise above the moving averages will be the first indication that the selling pressure is reducing. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up on a rally above $2,400.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off strong support at $288, indicating that the bulls are aggressively buying at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c7d6a6c1-10e3-476d-a545-2cb459baaed7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($304) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. This is the key level to watch out for because a break above it could drive the pair to $338.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the downtrend line, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the descending triangle pattern for a few more days. A break below $288 will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which has a target objective of $238.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $87 on Jan. 22 but could not capitalize on this strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1dbaf872-e95f-4735-b811-e280a49dbf11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pulled the price toward the moving averages, which are likely to act as a stiff resistance. But if buyers shove the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The SOL/USDT pair could first rise to $107 and thereafter attempt a rally to $117.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will signal that the bears hold the edge. Sellers will have to sink the price below $79 to open the doors for a possible drop to $64.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to arrest XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) decline at $0.50, but a weak recovery suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/e27c23ce-c511-49b5-bcbc-db4c8693e9c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the oversold zone, indicating that the bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($0.55), sellers will try to tug the price below $0.50 and challenge the next support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a rise above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the bears are losing their grip. The XRP/USDT pair will then try to climb to the downtrend line, where the bulls are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the descending channel pattern on Jan. 23, and after a brief hesitation, the bulls are trying to extend the relief rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on Jan. 26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/6fabfbaf-7249-481f-a0ab-7eae6068337c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative zone indicate that the bears have the upper hand. They will try to halt the rally at the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may retest the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line. If this level gives way, the selling could intensify, and the pair may plummet to the next support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair is likely to climb to the downtrend line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s AVAX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has started a relief rally, and the bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c9ae8652-ad70-4590-adef-c60c3788eba0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The recovery is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($33.81), which is sloping down. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The AVAX/USDT pair may then retest the low at $27.24. A break below this level could risk a drop to $24.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The pair could then climb to the overhead resistance of $38.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-community-strategies-market-dips-buying-tips"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dip or discount? Crypto community schools us on market moves}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been facing selling at the downtrend line, but the bears have not been able to sink the price below the $0.07 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/7889908c-860e-45b3-97b9-8dd7dcca3775.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to defend the $0.07 level with vigor. If the price rebounds off $0.07, the DOGE/USDT pair could climb to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to indicate that the correction may be over. The pair could then attempt a rally to the $0.10\u8211\'20\'13$0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to yank the price below the strong support of $0.07. If they do that, the pair could move downward to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) completed a head-and-shoulders pattern with a close below the neckline on Jan. 22. The bears tried to start a down move, but the bulls purchased the dip on Jan. 23, and the price recovered to the neckline of the pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/a9e9077d-2405-468c-87cd-e4038a2c5cbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price climbs back above the neckline, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting solid buying by the bulls. The 20-day is likely to act as a strong hurdle, but if the bulls overcome it, the DOT/USDT pair may pick up momentum and climb to $8.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the neckline or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. A drop below $5.97 could start the next leg of the downtrend to $4.80.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s LINK ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside the $12.85\u8211\'20\'13$17.32 range for several days, indicating indecision between the buyers and sellers about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/e46eaf4e-d5da-41e4-841a-7b05a9fcd83e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout of a range with certainty. Hence, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before taking directional bets. Until then, traders generally buy the dips to the support and sell near the resistance of the range.\par \par \uc2 The price may dip to $12.85, where buying is likely to pick up. A break above the moving averages will increase the likelihood of a rally to $17.32. This view will be invalidated if the LINK/USDT pair turns down sharply and plunges below $12.85. That will signal the start of a downward move to $10.50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.co