uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , the crypto market has had a tough time lately, with Bitcoin (BTC) down significantly from its early January highs. Investors are on the lookout for other crypto projects that have the potential to yield returns. Amidst this, most altcoins have also posted sizable losses, but these five cryptocurrencies have defied Bitcoin drops: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nuggetrush.io/?utm_source=PR&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=cdy&utm_content=24"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NuggetRush (NUGX)}}}\uc2 , Chainlink (LINK), Optimism (OP), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and Binance Coin (BNB).\par \par \uc2 These five altcoins have shown a solid \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook with their unique propositions. According to analysts, investors who want to enjoy the upcoming bull run in 2024 should add these tokens to their portfolio. With NuggetRush in its presale stage, investors seeking the best crypto to buycan have a stake in this project.\par \par \uc2 Let's explore these five cryptocurrencies that defy the Bitcoin drop.\par \par \uc2 Buy NuggetRush Now > Buy NuggetRush Now \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240126ek1q000p2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Analysts have turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the near term, but strong demand from the newly launched Bitcoin ETFs could be a sign that the market sell-off is reaching a point of exhaustion.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $40,000 level. Buyers seem to be positive about the long-term prospects of the newly launched Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs), but the sellers are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-down-39k-grayscale-gbtc-bleeding-outflow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 focusing on the $3.4 billion in outflows}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Apart from the crypto-specific issues, some analysts are worried about the worsening macroeconomic situation. \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2 , the former CEO of BitMEX, cautioned investors in his latest blog post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-risks-30k-supercharged-inflation-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin risks a fall between $35,000 and $30,000}}}\uc2 . According to Hayes, the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  could find it difficult to cut rates in the near future as rising shipping costs due to the Houthi attacks on ships in the Red Sea could boost inflation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/0b2ff617-3b52-4679-9aa1-171442b4c513.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Several analysts have turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short term, but solid demand from the newly launched Bitcoin ETFs may limit the downside. Within seven days of their launch, the nine spot Bitcoin ETFs have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-buy-100k-btc-7-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 amassed more than 100,000 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the crucial levels that may attract buying in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged below the $40,000 support on Jan. 22, indicating that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The price slipped near the strong support of $37,980, which is likely to hold in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/79680e59-bc00-443a-b09d-93b65004a44a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price is attempting to bounce off $37,980, but the bulls may face stiff resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,116). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair will risk a fall below $37,980. In that case, the pair may slump to the next strong support at $34,000.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to aggressively defend the zone between $34,000 and $37,980. They will have to kick the price above the 20-day EMA to signal a comeback. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up after the pair jumps above $44,700.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) weak bounce off the 20-day EMA ($2,395) on Jan. 19 attracted further selling by the bears, who tugged the price below the breakout level of $2,400 on Jan. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1aadc99b-5331-4554-aebc-80139ac1e261.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near 40, indicating that bears have a slight edge. Sellers will try to sink the price to the strong support at $2,100. The bulls are expected to protect the level with all their might because a drop below it may start a new downtrend toward $1,900.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the bulls maintain the ETH/USDT pair above the downtrend line. The pair will then try to rally to $2,614 and subsequently to $2,717.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from the downtrend line on Jan. 22 and closed below the 20-day EMA ($305), indicating aggressive selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/bc3ad460-3c57-4d2d-b043-bf8bd3f88a07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below $288. If that happens, the bears will try to drag the price to the neckline and then to $232.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price bounces off $288 with strength, it will suggest that the bulls are fiercely protecting the level. The BNB/USDT pair may then rise to the 20-day EMA. A break above this level will pave the way for a possible rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been in a pullback for the past many days. The bears strengthened their hold further by pulling the price below the 50-day SMA ($91) on Jan. 22,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/73cfc0bd-f4b5-4895-9274-905a4619dc01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. There is a minor support at $77, but if this level gives way, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could complete a 100% retracement and fall to $64.\par \par \uc2 The downtrend line is the major barrier to watch out for on the upside. If buyers drive the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair may then jump to $107.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.56) on Jan. 15 and slipped below the immediate support of $0.54 on Jan. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/decfabee-3c46-41a5-a7a4-39120bb9f5cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the oversold territory, indicating that bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. Sellers will try to tug the price to $0.46 where the buyers are likely to step in. However, any bounce is expected to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.46, a retest of $0.41 may be on the cards.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to propel and maintain the price above the downtrend line. The pair may then rise to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been falling inside a descending channel pattern for the past few days, indicating that higher levels are being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/41e3bad1-d575-4fcc-a2b6-da644930603d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.52) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate that the bears are in control. Sellers will try to strengthen their position further by yanking the price below the channel. If they do that, the selling could accelerate and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may dive to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price bounces off the support line of the channel, the bulls will attempt to overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may ascend to the downtrend line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) attempted a relief rally off the $31 support on Jan. 19, but the weak bounce shows that bears continue to pound on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/23a1db1f-ef47-40b5-acf0-f1e5ce39928d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Intense selling pressure pulled the price below the $31 support on Jan. 22. The bulls are trying to push the price back above the breakdown level of $31, but the recovery is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($34.32). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may fall to $24.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the selling pressure could be reducing. The price may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($37.63).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) started a recovery on Jan. 20, but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($0.09). This shows that bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/35c93dab-64ef-413f-abf5-5c82a6c20c80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the strong support near $0.07, which has held on three previous occasions. If the price rebounds off this level with force, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may oscillate between $0.07 and $0.09 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.07, it will open the doors for a possible fall to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a rise above the 50-day SMA. The pair may then climb to the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern on Jan. 22, indicating that the bears are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/a5c364e8-5cf9-496b-a2f5-6d8328f311a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price back above the neckline but are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears. If the price turns down from the neckline, it will signal that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the likelihood of a further downside to $4.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push the price back above the neckline, it will indicate strong buying at lower levels. The downside risk will reduce after the DOT/USDT pair sustains above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a large range between $12.85 and $17.32 for several days, indicating buying at lower levels and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1c23d724-1dbe-47dd-b085-f30cc6d1826d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flattish, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a slight advantage to the bears. The LINK/USDT pair could drop to the support of the range at $12.85, where buying is likely to emerge. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The bears will gain the upper hand if they sink and sustain the price below $12.85. That could start a fall to $12 and thereafter to $10.50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvZWExYmQzNjktNjYxZi00MWRlLTk1NWUtZDRlYzcxYThmMzc1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240124ek1o000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
