ience as a meme coin.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240120ek1k000um\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 587 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s price action is in the control of the bears. Cointelegraph explains why.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/3d40700d-0c12-4503-b16c-b97184743985.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the reasons why Cardano has been trading lower recently.\par \par \uc2 Extended correction from overbought conditions\par \par \uc2 From the technical point of view, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ongoing correction is part of a corrective cycle that started in mid-December after \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a 20-month high of $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Traders booked profits as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index}}}\uc2  (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) on daily charts became overbought after crossing 70.\par \par \uc2 An \uc2 RSI\uc2  reading above 70 means the asset is becoming overvalued and may undergo trend reversal or corrective pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/cf2774be