 volume and core developers coincide with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 27% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the same period, hinting that these metrics have influenced \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's short-term price trends \u8212\'20\'14 and Jan. 19 is no different.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-15-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ada-avax-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 The downturn in the broader crypto market\par \par \uc2 The entire crypto market is correcting from its peak when {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-record-notable-volume-on-day-1-btc-price-nearly-hits-49k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot ETFs}}}\uc2  were approved and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems to mirror the same pattern. Factors that may have boosted traders' selling include the reducing Crypto Fear and Greed index and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-one-week-later-btc-sells-off-but-etfs-reap-success"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Bitcoin ETF-driven selling}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/e995f976-3dd9-4caa-bcf6-7551b895e73e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market cap's daily performance chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Notably, Bitcoin has experienced substantial selling pressure recently, with the BTC price crashing to $40,000 on Jan. 12. This has been attributed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-etf-volumes-10b-gbtc-sales"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 large outflows}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC), which is possibly a reflection of investors choosing to move into the Bitcoin ETFs with lower fees. The entire crypto market dropped as Bitcoin dropped, with major altcoins like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  falling in tandem.\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear and Greed index slid from the \u8220\'20\'1Cgreed\u8221\'20\'1D zone last week to \u8220\'20\'1Cneutral\u8221\'20\'1D on Jan. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1494196a-4948-41dd-903e-b9153288dcf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear and Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Declining \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sentiment could be responsible for the current market-wide correction. The \u8220\'20\'1Cneutral\u8221\'20\'1D value means market participants are treading with caution as they wait to see the direction the market will take in the short term.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMDYvZTIzMDE1ZGQtODcyOC00YjI3LTgzYjctODgxYTY1YjUwMTlhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240119ek1j000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
