ht22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 . As we enter what is being termed an 'altseason', these altcoins merit attention for their potential to capitalize on the shifting market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240119ek1j000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP price\par \b \uc2 XRP price falls near critical support level as Bitcoin and crypto market correct\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 749 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 XRP price gives back a majority of its recently accrued gains and investors\u8217\'20\'19 hope for a spot XRP ETF dissolve.\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price has dropped 10% in January as investors book profits and broader \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment takes over the cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 XRP price now appears primed for further losses in the short term, primarily due to a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern.\par \par \uc2 XRP price trades below a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  triangle\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 3, XRP broke below the support line of a descending triangle at $0.5934, risking a 17% correction.\par \par \uc2 Now, XRP has been trading sideways below the technical chart pattern, and this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern forms when the price consolidates inside a triangle defined by a series of lower highs and relatively equal lows.\par \par \uc2 A descending triangle is resolved after the price breaks below its support line, accompanied by a rise in trading volumes. The pattern\u8217\'20\'19s breakout target is obtained by adding the height of the triangle (the thickest part of the triangle) to the breakout point on the downside.\par \par \uc2 In the case of XRP, the chart pattern was resolved on Jan. 3 as the price dropped to $0.5048, its lowest level since Oct. 19, 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/05cc216f-9bb2-48f9-ae20-2a2f48104e46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Attempts to lift XRP were frustrated by supplier congestion from the 100-day exponential moving average (EMA), currently at $0.5934. On Jan. 17, the token lost yet another crucial support level provided by the 200-day EMA at $0.5717.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-technical-analysis-strategies-that-help-confirm-winning-trades"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 moving average convergence divergence (MACD)}}}\uc2  indicator moved within the negative region below the neutral line. This suggested that the market conditions still favored the downside.\par \par \uc2 As such, if the sell-off continues, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target of $0.4971 could be seen for XRP, down around 19% from the current levels.\par \par \uc2 XRP supply in profit at historical levels\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for XRP could be attributed to profit-booking by sellers. Data from market intelligence firm Santiment shows that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and XRP are currently exhibiting historically high-risk profit levels.\par \par \uc2 The firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/santimentfeed/status/1747870783391903842?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  the following chart on the X social platform, saying:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C#Bitcoin (83%), #Ethereum (84%), and #XRPLedger (81%) have their respective supplies in historically high-risk profit levels compared to their averages that hover in the 55%-75% range dating back to 2018.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/d7f5acc7-c686-4dc9-b162-5220d6ff9be0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, Ethereum and XRP supply in profit. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 This means holders are booking profits on recent rallies as uncertainties kick in.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-1-15-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ada-avax-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 1/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 According to Santiment, XRP\u8217\'20\'19s price could still recover \u8220\'20\'1Cdue to more exposure from # ETF\u8217\'20\'19s and other positive news,\u8221\'20\'1D but a good signal to look out for \u8220\'20\'1Ccontinued long-term growth would be a breach below 75% of their supplies in profit once again.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 No plans for an XRP ETF \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Blackrock\par \par \uc2 The approval of 11 spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/bitcoin-etfs-a-beginners-guide-to-exchange-traded-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs)}}}\uc2  in the United States on Jan. 10 sparked hopes of other spot ETFs entering the market, including Ether ETFs and XRP ETFs.\par \par \uc2 There are a number of spot ETH ETFs before the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 , whose final decision is expected on May 23. While this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-outperforms-bitcoin-by-20-but-how-long-can-eth-hold-the-2-5k-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sparked a rally in Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price}}}\uc2  last week, there are little prospects for the same happening for XRP ETFs.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest asset manager, has reportedly said it has no plans to launch a spot XRP ETF.\par \par \uc2 Citing \u8220\'20\'1Cpeople with direct knowledge of the matter,\u8221\'20\'1D Fox Business journalist Charles Gasparino shared this news through a post on X, saying, \u8220\'20\'1C@BlackRock has no plans for a spot $XRP ETF.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 SCOOP: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BlackRock?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @BlackRock}}}\uc2  has no plans for a spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XRP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XRP}}}\uc2  ETF, according to people with direct knowledge of the matter story developing\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Charles Gasparino (@CGasparino) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CGasparino/status/1747978469382725773?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 18, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Speculation on a spot XRP ETF was previously sparked by a comment from \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO \uc2 Larry Fink\uc2  during a Fox Business {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxbusiness.com/video/6344768405112"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 When asked about an XRP ETF, the CEO\u8217\'20\'19s elusive response of \u8220\'20\'1CI can\u8217\'20\'19t talk about that!\u8221\'20\'1D fueled discussions and hopes among investors and analysts.\par \par \uc2 The recent developments have dampened these hopes, contributing to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment in the XRP market.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par